r_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=21010","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":15,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/21010","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=4968,13005"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=21010&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20369,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn 65\u00d765cm In 3D \u2013 Hoa \u0110\u00e0o, Chim \u00c9n | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-dao-yen-65x65cm-in-3d","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-dao-yen-65x65cm-in-3d\/","sku":"KLVI23 DAOYEN","short_description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"16f47g5\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1316\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u2013 N\u00e9t Xu\u00e2n Tr\u00ean L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1619\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn 65\u00d765cm l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m vu\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a SenSilk, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 chim \u00e9n, g\u1ee3i l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, ni\u1ec1m vui \u0111o\u00e0n vi\u00ean v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1817\">V\u1edbi b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u kem ng\u00e0, h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e0o, \u0111\u1ecf r\u01b0\u1ee3u v\u00e0 v\u00e0ng \u00e1nh, \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang ho\u1eb7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ak2r85\" data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"490\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"490\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"1600\">. <strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"511\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI23 DAOYEN<br data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"528\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"599\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"636\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"650\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"662\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"682\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"743\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"760\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"774\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"776\" data-end=\"790\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"809\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"822\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o, chim \u00e9n v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"903\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"917\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> H\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 Ng\u00e0 kem \u2013 \u0110\u1ecf r\u01b0\u1ee3u \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1<br data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"974\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"989\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1007\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1024\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1061\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1076\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1220\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1407\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1534\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1576\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1595\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-section-id=\"yizbxw\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2447\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn 65\u00d765cm In 3D | SenSilk<\/h2>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"yizbxw\" data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2447\">Khi hoa \u0111\u00e0o g\u1eb7p c\u00e1nh \u00e9n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2515\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ta ngh\u0129 \u0111\u1ebfn m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2531\">M\u1ed9t nh\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e0o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2544\">M\u1ed9t \u0111\u00f4i \u00e9n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2600\">M\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1eddi trong tr\u1ebbo c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u l\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2602\" data-end=\"2652\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb ch\u00ednh c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5y.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2654\" data-end=\"2924\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e0o h\u1ed3ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, xen gi\u1eefa l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh chim \u00e9n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf. S\u1eafc <strong data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2828\">kem ng\u00e0, h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e0o, \u0111\u1ecf r\u01b0\u1ee3u v\u00e0 v\u00e0ng \u00e1nh<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7, mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb n\u1eef t\u00ednh nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ng\u1ecdt, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2926\" data-end=\"3072\">N\u1ebfu hoa \u0111\u00e0o g\u1ee3i n\u00ean <strong data-start=\"2946\" data-end=\"2981\">s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n<\/strong>, th\u00ec chim \u00e9n l\u1ea1i mang theo h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3071\">tin vui, s\u1ef1 tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3140\">Khi \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ea1nh nhau, hai h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n r\u1ea5t \u0111\u1eb9p:<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20378#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-dao-yen-quang-co-hoa-dao-chim-en.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu n\u1eef qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 chim \u00e9n c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-20378\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-1-20378\">\n\t\t\t\tKh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20379#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-dao-yen-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o, chim \u00e9n v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft trang tr\u00ed truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20375#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-dao-yen-phoi-ao-dai.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch cho trang ph\u1ee5c\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<blockquote data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3203\">\n<p data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3203\"><strong data-start=\"3144\" data-end=\"3203\">M\u00f9a xu\u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn \u2013 tin vui v\u1ec1 \u2013 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ryjunp\" data-start=\"3210\" data-end=\"3246\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng s\u1eafc l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3324\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn kh\u00f4ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng gam m\u00e0u qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3519\">N\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"3330\" data-end=\"3341\">kem ng\u00e0<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u00fap s\u1eafc hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean. Vi\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ecf r\u01b0\u1ee3u mang \u0111\u1ebfn chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c, trong khi nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m v\u00e0ng \u00e1nh t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3623\">Nh\u00ecn t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang m\u1ed9t v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 ph\u1ea7n c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn r\u1ea5t d\u1ec5 b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3659\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n SenSilk h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi:<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3767\">\n<p data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3767\"><strong data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3767\">\u0110\u01b0a nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11ihlre\" data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3801\">100% L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3863\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ee7 tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng \u0111\u1ee1 n\u00f3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3987\"><strong data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3921\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3989\" data-end=\"4086\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u00e0ng tr\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean theo t\u1eebng c\u1eed ch\u1ec9.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4131\"><strong data-start=\"4088\" data-end=\"4131\">L\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4133\" data-end=\"4195\">L\u1ee5a l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n n\u1ec1n gi\u00fap c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n \u1ea5y tr\u1edf n\u00ean s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"swy09d\" data-start=\"4202\" data-end=\"4247\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt In 3D \u2013 \u0110\u01b0a s\u1eafc \u0111\u00e0o l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4249\" data-end=\"4365\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"4265\" data-end=\"4291\">k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o, chim \u00e9n v\u00e0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4367\" data-end=\"4526\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in gi\u00fap t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 phong ph\u00fa v\u1ec1 th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c khi kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf ra ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng tr\u00ean trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4642\"><strong data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4642\">Khi m\u1edf ra, b\u1ea1n nh\u00ecn th\u1ea5y c\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n.<br data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4576\" \/>Khi qu\u00e0ng l\u00ean, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u1ea5y tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yz49ik\" data-start=\"4649\" data-end=\"4697\">Kh\u0103n Vu\u00f4ng 65\u00d765cm \u2013 Nh\u1ecf G\u1ecdn, Nhi\u1ec1u C\u00e1ch Ph\u1ed1i<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4699\" data-end=\"4788\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"4714\" data-end=\"4725\">65\u00d765cm<\/strong>, \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n linh ho\u1ea1t trong t\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4908\"><strong data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4803\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5:<\/strong> G\u1ea5p kh\u0103n th\u00e0nh d\u1ea3i nh\u1ecf v\u00e0 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho s\u01a1 mi, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4910\" data-end=\"4986\"><strong data-start=\"4910\" data-end=\"4922\">Th\u1eaft n\u01a1:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc n\u01a1 l\u1ee5a nh\u1ecf \u1edf c\u1ed5 \u00e1o mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5104\"><strong data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5009\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i:<\/strong> S\u1eafc kem ng\u00e0 v\u00e0 hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, \u0111\u1ecf ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5248\"><strong data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5136\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c blazer:<\/strong> Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"cbicsc\" data-start=\"5255\" data-end=\"5292\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u2013 M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 Mang Theo Tin Vui<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5294\" data-end=\"5356\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn vui trong kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5415\">Nh\u01b0ng m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 <strong data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5390\">\u00fd ngh\u0129a<\/strong> th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edb l\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5417\" data-end=\"5470\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn mang trong m\u00ecnh nh\u1eefng bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ed3ng c\u1ea3m:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5472\" data-end=\"5587\"><strong data-start=\"5472\" data-end=\"5495\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n.<\/strong><br data-start=\"5495\" data-end=\"5498\" \/><strong data-start=\"5498\" data-end=\"5520\">Chim \u00e9n \u2013 tin vui.<\/strong><br data-start=\"5520\" data-end=\"5523\" \/><strong data-start=\"5523\" data-end=\"5551\">L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u2013 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/strong><br data-start=\"5551\" data-end=\"5554\" \/><strong data-start=\"5554\" data-end=\"5587\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Vi\u1ec7t \u2013 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5589\" data-end=\"5626\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5827\">\n<li data-section-id=\"qbm1mz\" data-start=\"5628\" data-end=\"5666\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb9 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef th\u00e2n y\u00eau.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hteou0\" data-start=\"5667\" data-end=\"5692\">B\u1ea1n b\u00e8, \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12x2ynb\" data-start=\"5693\" data-end=\"5720\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cmp01t\" data-start=\"5721\" data-end=\"5738\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m5kq5x\" data-start=\"5739\" data-end=\"5777\">B\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf y\u00eau v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"j99pvd\" data-start=\"5778\" data-end=\"5827\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"glqicl\" data-start=\"5834\" data-end=\"5869\">\u0110I\u1ec0U G\u00cc L\u00c0M N\u00caN KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A \u0110\u00c0O Y\u1ebeN?<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gevl2\" data-start=\"5871\" data-end=\"5903\">01. 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5904\" data-end=\"5953\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s00pyw\" data-start=\"5955\" data-end=\"5989\">02. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5990\" data-end=\"6032\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ri\u00eang b\u1edfi SenSilk.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1623rqa\" data-start=\"6034\" data-end=\"6064\">03. K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D cao c\u1ea5p<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6127\">Th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u00f5 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"adjzrg\" data-start=\"6129\" data-end=\"6155\">04. K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 65\u00d765cm<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6156\" data-end=\"6210\">D\u1ec5 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a6lwza\" data-start=\"6212\" data-end=\"6245\">05. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a \u0111\u1eb9p<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6246\" data-end=\"6314\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 chim \u00e9n g\u1ee3i m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, tin vui v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ypg0q2\" data-start=\"6316\" data-end=\"6357\">06. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u1ea3 th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6421\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3jwf7\" data-start=\"6428\" data-end=\"6479\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u2013 D\u00e0nh Cho Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Y\u00eau Nh\u1eefng \u0110i\u1ec1u Thanh Tao<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6481\" data-end=\"6519\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u00e0o c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6521\" data-end=\"6556\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n kem.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6576\">M\u1ed9t \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng vi\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ecf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6578\" data-end=\"6613\">M\u1ed9t \u0111\u00f4i \u00e9n nh\u1ecf gi\u1eefa nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e0o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6615\" data-end=\"6661\">V\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ee7 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean kh\u00ed ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6663\" data-end=\"6789\"><strong data-start=\"6663\" data-end=\"6789\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n mang m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat s\u1eafc xu\u00e2n b\u00ean m\u00ecnh.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"6858\"><strong data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"6858\">Kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<br data-start=\"6810\" data-end=\"6813\" \/>Kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<br data-start=\"6830\" data-end=\"6833\" \/>Ch\u1ec9 v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edb.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"vwcbsb\" data-start=\"6865\" data-end=\"6905\">SEN SILK \u2013 K\u1ec2 CHUY\u1ec6N VI\u1ec6T NAM B\u1eb0NG L\u1ee4A<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6907\" data-end=\"7026\">SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00e1c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"6935\" data-end=\"6962\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> t\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a, thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean, di s\u1ea3n v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7028\" data-end=\"7067\">M\u1ed7i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7069\" data-end=\"7151\">V\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7084\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn<\/strong>, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7125\" data-end=\"7150\">hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 \u0111\u00f4i \u00e9n nh\u1ecf<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7153\" data-end=\"7314\">T\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"7166\" data-end=\"7189\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 mang theo m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jn2pwg\" data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7352\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"7320\" data-end=\"7352\">Love Vietnam. Remember Silk.<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1dc1jtm\" data-start=\"7359\" data-end=\"7379\">C\u00c2U H\u1eceI TH\u01af\u1edcNG G\u1eb6P<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wshc4x\" data-start=\"7381\" data-end=\"7427\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7429\" data-end=\"7483\">Kh\u0103n \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"7454\" data-end=\"7482\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1te9lnp\" data-start=\"7485\" data-end=\"7523\">Kh\u0103n \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7525\" data-end=\"7573\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7544\" data-end=\"7555\">65\u00d765cm<\/strong>, d\u1ea1ng kh\u0103n vu\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wboasf\" data-start=\"7575\" data-end=\"7612\">Kh\u0103n \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7614\" data-end=\"7662\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"7643\" data-end=\"7661\">k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ezpk1k\" data-start=\"7664\" data-end=\"7711\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u1ee7a SenSilk kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7713\" data-end=\"7759\">C\u00f3. <strong data-start=\"7717\" data-end=\"7759\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k5rj8i\" data-start=\"7761\" data-end=\"7807\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 chim \u00e9n c\u00f3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7809\" data-end=\"7932\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn <strong data-start=\"7830\" data-end=\"7854\">m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng<\/strong>, trong khi chim \u00e9n g\u1eafn v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7882\" data-end=\"7931\">tin vui, s\u1ef1 tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mlvz2z\" data-start=\"7934\" data-end=\"7981\">Kh\u0103n \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7983\" data-end=\"8150\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 chim \u00e9n khi\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1rjh4c1\" data-start=\"8157\" data-end=\"8194\">\u0110\u00c0O Y\u1ebeN \u2013 M\u1ed8T N\u00c9T XU\u00c2N \u0110\u1ec2 MANG THEO<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"8196\" data-end=\"8236\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n \u0111i qua theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8238\" data-end=\"8280\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8282\" data-end=\"8333\">V\u00e0 c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"8310\" data-end=\"8332\">mang theo b\u00ean m\u00ecnh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8335\" data-end=\"8371\"><strong data-start=\"8335\" data-end=\"8346\">\u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8373\" data-end=\"8425\">M\u1ed9t nh\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e0o.<br data-start=\"8387\" data-end=\"8390\" \/>M\u1ed9t \u0111\u00f4i \u00e9n.<br data-start=\"8401\" data-end=\"8404\" \/>M\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-section-id=\"1i9f8bd\" data-start=\"8427\" data-end=\"8474\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"8431\" data-end=\"8474\">Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Y\u1ebfn c\u00f9ng SenSilk.<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>