ull,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 53 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","formatted_dimensions":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Mai V\u0169 65x65cm In 3D &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=20356","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/20356","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=20356&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20346,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n In 3D &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u0103ng Cao C\u1ea5p | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d\/","sku":"KLVI22 MIENDISAN","short_description":"<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9focig\" data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"464\"><span role=\"text\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/span><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"518\">Nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"744\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng 65 \u00d7 65cm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D v\u1edbi c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac, c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"939\">Nh\u1eefng gam m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng kem, xanh tr\u1ea7m v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i trong m\u1ed9t b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u, mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, ho\u00e0i ni\u1ec7m nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"1034\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n. \u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"493\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"493\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"1631\">. <strong data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"514\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI22 MIENDISAN<br data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"534\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"605\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"642\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"656\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"668\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"688\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"712\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"729\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"749\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"766\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"780\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"796\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"815\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"828\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Di s\u1ea3n ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac, c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t Nam, hoa sen v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"931\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"945\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Ng\u00e0 kem \u2013 Xanh ng\u1ecdc \u2013 Xanh r\u00eau \u2013 N\u00e2u tr\u1ea7m \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim<br data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1005\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1020\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1038\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1055\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1092\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1107\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1236\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1251\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1438\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1550\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1565\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1607\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1626\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1gotgey\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1470\">MI\u1ec0N DI S\u1ea2N \u2013 KHI V\u1eba \u0110\u1eb8P VI\u1ec6T NAM \u0110\u01af\u1ee2C K\u1ec2 B\u1eb0NG L\u1ee4A<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1527\">M\u1ed7i v\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i trong k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1542\">M\u1ed9t m\u00e1i \u0111\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1561\">M\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i ch\u00f9a c\u1ed5.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1585\">M\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc y\u00ean b\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1626\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng tr\u00ecnh mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1697\">Nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong k\u00fd \u1ee9c v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1755\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk t\u1ea1o n\u00ean <strong data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1754\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1757\" data-end=\"2066\">Thay v\u00ec k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u01a1n l\u1ebb, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u00e1t c\u1eaft c\u1ee7a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3. Nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng tr\u00ecnh ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac, c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft mang tinh th\u1ea7n truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0 \u0111ang m\u1edf ra m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2065\">b\u1ee9c tranh thu nh\u1ecf v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2068\" data-end=\"2095\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2144\">L\u00e0 nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef qua nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ebf h\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2146\" data-end=\"2264\">V\u00e0 l\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac khi nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u00e2n thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u r\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t Nam: <strong data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2263\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2344\"><strong data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2344\">M\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<br data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2286\" \/>M\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2312\" \/>M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng l\u1ee5a.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-3\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20354#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-vuong-mien-di-san-65x65cm-sensilk.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 di s\u1ea3n Vi\u1ec7t Nam\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20348#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n 65x65cm in 3D SenSilk qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 thanh l\u1ecbch\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20351#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-cach-quang-co-sensilk-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1kvtsac\" data-start=\"2351\" data-end=\"2379\">THI\u1ebeT K\u1ebe B\u1ea2N QUY\u1ec0N SENSILK<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2534\"><strong data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2396\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n<\/strong> l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ri\u00eang theo h\u01b0\u1edbng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2533\">di s\u1ea3n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2793\">B\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng kem, n\u00e2u tr\u1ea7m c\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng s\u1eafc xanh nh\u1eb9 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u. C\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac, c\u1ea3nh quan v\u00e0 hoa v\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1eeba mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u1eeba d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng trong th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2846\">\u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1eb1m \u1edf c\u00e1ch c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2920\">Khi m\u1edf kh\u0103n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 t\u1eebng l\u1edbp chi ti\u1ebft trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"3018\">Khi g\u1ea5p kh\u0103n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0ng l\u00ean c\u1ed5, ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hi\u1ec7n ra c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ee7 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3059\"><strong data-start=\"3020\" data-end=\"3059\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"ovhft5\" data-start=\"3066\" data-end=\"3092\">100% L\u1ee4A T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3180\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf gi\u00e0u c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ee7 tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u1ea5y.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3311\"><strong data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3246\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3313\" data-end=\"3433\">B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c thanh l\u1ecbch khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u00fap c\u00e1c m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3435\" data-end=\"3481\">V\u1edbi SenSilk, l\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3567\"><strong data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3567\">L\u1ee5a l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eefng c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c k\u1ec3 theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"pztrz2\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3613\">NGH\u1ec6 THU\u1eacT IN 3D \u2013 \u0110\u01afA DI S\u1ea2N L\u00caN L\u1ee4A<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3775\"><strong data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3630\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n<\/strong> s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3661\">in 3D KTS<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 chi ti\u1ebft cao tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3777\" data-end=\"3911\">C\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n n\u00e0y gi\u00fap SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0o c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"4001\">Khi m\u1edf kh\u0103n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 c\u1ea3nh quan kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4127\">Khi g\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh thay \u0111\u1ed5i theo t\u1eebng c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n kh\u00e1c nhau tr\u00ean trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4187\"><strong data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4187\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u2013 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea5u.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1d0paol\" data-start=\"4194\" data-end=\"4244\">KH\u0102N VU\u00d4NG 65 \u00d7 65CM \u2013 THANH L\u1ecaCH V\u00c0 D\u1ec4 \u1ee8NG D\u1ee4NG<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4344\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4274\">65 \u00d7 65cm<\/strong>, Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4346\" data-end=\"4353\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4688\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1w1s5k8\" data-start=\"4355\" data-end=\"4388\">G\u1ea5p ch\u00e9o v\u00e0 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ikgf3p\" data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4427\">Th\u1eaft kh\u0103n c\u00f9ng \u00e1o s\u01a1 mi ho\u1eb7c blazer.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"eq6qu\" data-start=\"4428\" data-end=\"4462\">\u0110\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai khi m\u1eb7c \u00e1o d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6cel2x\" data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4512\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1odrjgq\" data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4564\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u00fai x\u00e1ch nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t2vay1\" data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4626\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"z9un0a\" data-start=\"4627\" data-end=\"4688\">L\u00e0m m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4766\"><strong data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4766\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nh\u1ecf nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i th\u1ea7n th\u00e1i c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1vzxo88\" data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4821\">MI\u1ec0N DI S\u1ea2N \u2013 M\u00d3N QU\u00c0 MANG C\u00c2U CHUY\u1ec6N VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"4823\" data-end=\"4875\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t thi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i th\u1eadt l\u1edbn.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4877\" data-end=\"4962\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn nh\u1edb l\u00e2u nh\u1ea5t ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"4930\" data-end=\"4961\">c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ph\u00eda sau m\u00f3n qu\u00e0<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4964\" data-end=\"5169\">V\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"5017\" data-end=\"5045\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng ai mu\u1ed1n trao t\u1eb7ng m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9, v\u1eeba mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5171\" data-end=\"5201\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5634\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1m931n5\" data-start=\"5203\" data-end=\"5280\"><strong data-start=\"5205\" data-end=\"5238\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong> mu\u1ed1n mang theo m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hlhbdz\" data-start=\"5281\" data-end=\"5358\"><strong data-start=\"5283\" data-end=\"5301\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong> y\u00eau th\u00edch nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ri\u00eang.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"y2xv45\" data-start=\"5359\" data-end=\"5436\"><strong data-start=\"5361\" data-end=\"5382\">B\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i<\/strong> nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yhrlb1\" data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5505\"><strong data-start=\"5439\" data-end=\"5470\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u1edf n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i<\/strong> mu\u1ed1n l\u01b0u gi\u1eef m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1sv6yfn\" data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5574\"><strong data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5533\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp tri \u00e2n, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1k3xysr\" data-start=\"5575\" data-end=\"5634\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau <strong data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5633\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5692\"><strong data-start=\"5636\" data-end=\"5692\">Trao Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n l\u00e0 trao m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"kcpo6b\" data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5738\">V\u00cc SAO N\u00caN CH\u1eccN KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A MI\u1ec0N DI S\u1ea2N?<\/h1>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gevl2\" data-start=\"5740\" data-end=\"5772\">01. 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5774\" data-end=\"5865\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb sang tr\u1ecdng tinh t\u1ebf khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s00pyw\" data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5901\">02. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5903\" data-end=\"6023\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n ri\u00eang v\u1edbi ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac, c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"siltvv\" data-start=\"6025\" data-end=\"6069\">03. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n di s\u1ea3n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6071\" data-end=\"6177\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng tr\u00ecnh, c\u1ea3nh quan v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1caiic2\" data-start=\"6179\" data-end=\"6205\">04. K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D KTS<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6207\" data-end=\"6311\">Gi\u00fap th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 chi ti\u1ebft cao tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"qt0my5\" data-start=\"6313\" data-end=\"6341\">05. K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 65 \u00d7 65cm<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6343\" data-end=\"6403\">Nh\u1ecf g\u1ecdn, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea5u trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mu8wxs\" data-start=\"6405\" data-end=\"6444\">06. V\u1eeba l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n, v\u1eeba l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6446\" data-end=\"6547\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"n0lwuu\" data-start=\"6554\" data-end=\"6602\">MI\u1ec0N DI S\u1ea2N D\u00c0NH CHO NG\u01af\u1edcI Y\u00caU V\u1eba \u0110\u1eb8P VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"6604\" data-end=\"6647\">C\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau Vi\u1ec7t Nam qua nh\u1eefng con ph\u1ed1 c\u0169.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6649\" data-end=\"6741\">C\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau qua m\u00e1i \u0111\u00ecnh, ng\u00f4i ch\u00f9a, d\u00f2ng s\u00f4ng hay nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e3 \u0111i qua nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ebf h\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6743\" data-end=\"6832\">C\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft r\u1ea5t nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6884\"><strong data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6884\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean cho nh\u1eefng c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u1ea5y.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6886\" data-end=\"6907\">Kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6909\" data-end=\"6929\">Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n nhi\u1ec1u l\u1eddi.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6931\" data-end=\"7066\">Ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n vu\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t tinh t\u1ebf, c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 mang theo m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n k\u00fd \u1ee9c v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7162\"><strong data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7162\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n.<br data-start=\"7085\" data-end=\"7088\" \/>M\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<br data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7106\" \/>M\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n.<br data-start=\"7117\" data-end=\"7120\" \/>M\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n di s\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c mang theo b\u00ean m\u00ecnh.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"s1ytgg\" data-start=\"7169\" data-end=\"7216\">SENSILK \u2013 KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M CAO C\u1ea4P T\u1eea VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"7218\" data-end=\"7342\">SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"7273\" data-end=\"7341\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7344\" data-end=\"7488\">T\u1eeb kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf in 3D, m\u1ed7i d\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7658\"><strong data-start=\"7490\" data-end=\"7505\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh \u1ea5y \u2013 \u0111\u01b0a nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh g\u1eafn v\u1edbi k\u00fd \u1ee9c, ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00ean m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7660\" data-end=\"7692\"><strong data-start=\"7660\" data-end=\"7692\">Love Vietnam. Remember Silk.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"1dc1jtm\" data-start=\"7699\" data-end=\"7719\">FAQ<\/h1>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"bhx9pa\" data-start=\"7721\" data-end=\"7771\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7773\" data-end=\"7873\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"7809\" data-end=\"7837\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1f21oqy\" data-start=\"7875\" data-end=\"7917\">Kh\u0103n Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7919\" data-end=\"7974\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"7934\" data-end=\"7973\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 65 \u00d7 65cm<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1m3lmxj\" data-start=\"7976\" data-end=\"8027\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u1ee7a SenSilk kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8029\" data-end=\"8153\">C\u00f3. Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"8048\" data-end=\"8078\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 di s\u1ea3n, ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ws63jv\" data-start=\"8155\" data-end=\"8208\">Kh\u0103n Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8210\" data-end=\"8318\">Kh\u0103n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"8223\" data-end=\"8245\">k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in 3D KTS<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"w8r2ac\" data-start=\"8320\" data-end=\"8371\">Kh\u0103n Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8373\" data-end=\"8556\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t \u1edf n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18xta2r\" data-start=\"8558\" data-end=\"8604\">Kh\u0103n 65 \u00d7 65cm c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8606\" data-end=\"8735\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, g\u1ea5p ch\u00e9o, th\u1eaft kh\u0103n, \u0111\u1eb7t tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, s\u01a1 mi, blazer v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<h1 data-section-id=\"aqpk4d\" data-start=\"8742\" data-end=\"8789\">MI\u1ec0N DI S\u1ea2N \u2013 MANG M\u1ed8T PH\u1ea6N VI\u1ec6T NAM TR\u00caN L\u1ee4A<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"8791\" data-end=\"8841\">Di s\u1ea3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef trong nh\u1eefng c\u00f4ng tr\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8843\" data-end=\"8855\">Trong k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8857\" data-end=\"8917\">Trong nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean quen thu\u1ed9c v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ebf h\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8919\" data-end=\"8963\">V\u00e0 c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8965\" data-end=\"9108\"><strong data-start=\"8965\" data-end=\"8980\">Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n<\/strong> k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u1ea5y v\u1edbi th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nh\u1ecf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n r\u1ea5t ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi mang n\u00f3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9197\"><strong data-start=\"9110\" data-end=\"9197\">Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D 65 \u00d7 65cm, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n SenSilk.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9199\" data-end=\"9241\"><strong data-start=\"9199\" data-end=\"9241\">SenSilk \u2013 Love Vietnam, Remember Silk.<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1320000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.320.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.320.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.100.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.100.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20348,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk-247x296.webp","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n 65x65cm In 3D","alt":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n 65x65cm in 3D SenSilk qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 thanh l\u1ecbch"},{"id":20353,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-vuong-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-vuong-mien-di-san-65x65cm-in-3d-sensilk-247x296.webp","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n In 3D Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk","alt":"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu qu\u00e0ng Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Mi\u1ec1n Di S\u1ea3n in 3D cao c\u1ea5p"},{"id":20349,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-mien-di-san-hoa-tiet-di-san-viet-nam-1.webp","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/khan-lua-mien-di-san-hoa-tiet-di-s