e","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-vuong-in-3d-giang-huong-sen\/","sku":"KLVI20 GIANGHUONGSEN","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"841\"><strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"588\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p thu\u1ed9c <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"650\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau Collection<\/strong> c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"666\">SenSilk<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"703\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"748\">in 3D ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao<\/strong> nh\u1eb1m t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa sen, ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed3ng qu\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ak2r85\" data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"543\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"543\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"1634\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"564\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI20 GIANGHUONGSEN<br data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"588\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-only-node=\"\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"696\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"710\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"722\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"742\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"766\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"783\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"820\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"834\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"850\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"866\" data-end=\"869\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"882\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa sen v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"959\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Xanh ng\u1ecdc \u2013 H\u1ed3ng sen \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1<br data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1023\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1041\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1058\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1095\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1110\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1239\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1254\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1441\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1553\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1568\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1610\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1629\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h1 data-section-id=\"1q5revv\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1046\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen | L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/h1>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng in 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/lua-to-tam-sensilk\/\"><strong data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1511\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong><\/a>, thu\u1ed9c <strong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1550\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau Collection<\/strong> c\u1ee7a <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/sensilk-4\/\"><strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1566\">SenSilk<\/strong><\/a>, mang c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa sen v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/khan-lua-vuong-giang-huong-sen-toan-khan-sensilk.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-20234\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/khan-lua-vuong-giang-huong-sen-toan-khan-sensilk-1024x875.jpg\" alt=\"To\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen c\u1ee7a SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen, ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 ru\u1ed9ng b\u1eadc thang\" width=\"1020\" height=\"872\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1q5revv\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1046\">Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen \u2013 Khi h\u01b0\u01a1ng l\u00faa, hoa sen v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a c\u00f9ng k\u1ec3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1094\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1163\">Nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang theo c\u1ea3 k\u00fd \u1ee9c c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t v\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1368\"><strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1184\">Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh b\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a l\u00e0ng qu\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t Nam, n\u01a1i nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ed3ng l\u00faa v\u00e0ng tr\u1ea3i d\u00e0i, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1ea7m sen n\u1edf r\u1ed9 v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng g\u1eafn b\u00f3 v\u1edbi thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1500\">T\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 \u0111\u00f3a sen l\u1edbn \u0111ang khoe s\u1eafc \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho s\u1ef1 thanh cao, thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1677\">Bao quanh l\u00e0 d\u00f2ng ch\u1ea3y m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a l\u00e1 sen, h\u1ed3 n\u01b0\u1edbc, c\u00e1nh b\u01b0\u1edbm v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t g\u1ee3i nh\u1edb \u0111\u1ebfn ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0110\u00f4ng S\u01a1n, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 v\u1eeba hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u1eeba mang chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1784\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 b\u1ee9c tranh hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kho\u00e1c l\u00ean vai.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1847\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 tri\u1ebft l\u00fd thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u00e0 SenSilk lu\u00f4n theo \u0111u\u1ed5i:<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1900\">\n<p data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1900\"><strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1900\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1bsy68r\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1962\">\u0110i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1eaazcw\" data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1993\">100% L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2089\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u1edbi b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2091\" data-end=\"2194\">L\u1ee5a mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u1ea3 b\u1ed1n m\u00f9a v\u00e0 gi\u00fap t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jwwcil\" data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2230\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D s\u1eafc n\u00e9t<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2278\">SenSilk s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i gi\u00fap:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2395\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1o9hwl7\" data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2300\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc trung th\u1ef1c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uslxef\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2324\">\u0110\u1ed9 chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"chy5p1\" data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2358\">Gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f3i6tw\" data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2395\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1eafc n\u00e9t \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2470\">Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3 chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1eeba mang t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1eeba ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uiq6\" data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2509\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n SenSilk<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2511\" data-end=\"2587\">Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n thu\u1ed9c <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-in\/\"><strong data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2586\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau Collection<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2589\" data-end=\"2646\">To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u00e1ng t\u00e1c ri\u00eang v\u1edbi ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2786\">\n<li data-section-id=\"12sxwjc\" data-start=\"2648\" data-end=\"2666\">Hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yh349h\" data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2686\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"so17pj\" data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2704\">Ru\u1ed9ng b\u1eadc thang<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pczrg5\" data-start=\"2705\" data-end=\"2715\">\u0110\u1ed3ng l\u00faa<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3cw8o\" data-start=\"2716\" data-end=\"2734\">V\u0103n h\u00f3a l\u00faa n\u01b0\u1edbc<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ymm85j\" data-start=\"2735\" data-end=\"2763\">Hoa v\u0103n \u0110\u00f4ng S\u01a1n c\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7u<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3m9qnw\" data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2786\">Thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2875\">\u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft trang tr\u00ed m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m8mecr\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2911\">Phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2913\" data-end=\"2946\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e0u s\u1eafc qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2948\" data-end=\"2982\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ea1y theo xu h\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u1eafn h\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3082\">Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng theo phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3081\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3084\" data-end=\"3170\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u1eddi trang thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"7bpvfr\" data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3568\">C\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3612\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng theo nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3780\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1j78cr7\" data-start=\"3614\" data-end=\"3625\">Cho\u00e0ng c\u1ed5<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"eze4vv\" data-start=\"3626\" data-end=\"3637\">Qu\u00e0ng vai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jr7xd\" data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3648\">Bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jj5woq\" data-start=\"3649\" data-end=\"3664\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojsruz\" data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3686\">L\u00e0m kh\u0103n c\u1ed5 \u00e1o vest<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hdgd7z\" data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3717\">Trang tr\u00ed trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"362j08\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3736\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1yjrbne\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3761\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng v\u00e1y t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"al74m1\" data-start=\"3762\" data-end=\"3780\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng blazer<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3782\" data-end=\"3845\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13wng2g\" data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3887\">M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3889\" data-end=\"3930\">Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4099\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1u36u0l\" data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"3955\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1uesxrt\" data-start=\"3956\" data-end=\"3974\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1goxmia\" data-start=\"3975\" data-end=\"3999\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"843a2i\" data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4017\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7t6s9x\" data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4038\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sinh nh\u1eadt<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q6s81u\" data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4053\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"zmj2yy\" data-start=\"4054\" data-end=\"4070\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 20\/10<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15ouhde\" data-start=\"4071\" data-end=\"4084\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q6smzt\" data-start=\"4085\" data-end=\"4099\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng VIP<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4101\" data-end=\"4199\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p \u1edf h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f2n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10mslvj\" data-start=\"4206\" data-end=\"4241\">V\u00ec sao n\u00ean ch\u1ecdn kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk?<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4269\">\u2714 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4292\">\u2714 Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4321\">\u2714 \u0110\u1eadm b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4323\" data-end=\"4347\">\u2714 Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4349\" data-end=\"4370\">\u2714 H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4408\">\u2714 Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4410\" data-end=\"4455\">\u2714 \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf theo phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n9828j\" data-start=\"4462\" data-end=\"4488\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1s15z1f\" data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4539\">Kh\u0103n Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4637\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4563\" data-end=\"4590\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"o3svho\" data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4678\">Kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4808\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau phong c\u00e1ch thanh l\u1ecbch, doanh nh\u00e2n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xrux8w\" data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4849\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"5030\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng m\u1eabu kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n nh\u1edd thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf sang tr\u1ecdng c\u00f9ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"tvpzeo\" data-start=\"5037\" data-end=\"5071\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p m\u1eb7c v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5073\" data-end=\"5224\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Gam m\u00e0u thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1eadm b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 trang ph\u1ee5c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ja55xl\" data-start=\"5231\" data-end=\"5267\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D c\u00f3 b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5385\">N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n v\u00e0 gi\u1eb7t \u0111\u00fang h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean kh\u0103n s\u1ebd gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 s\u1eafc n\u00e9t trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<h2>Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u00eam t\u1ea1i SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5421\" data-end=\"5482\">N\u1ebfu y\u00eau th\u00edch Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen, b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u00eam:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5653\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1cxlqso\" data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5509\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"stnbqo\" data-start=\"5510\" data-end=\"5526\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sdn066\" data-start=\"5527\" data-end=\"5543\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In 3D<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7xhy09\" data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5561\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kj77s1\" data-start=\"5562\" data-end=\"5581\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau Tay<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c0ekrq\" data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5600\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ahv0vj\" data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5630\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau Collection<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dkrxp1\" data-start=\"5631\" data-end=\"5653\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ea3vq3\" data-start=\"5771\" data-end=\"5824\">Mua Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen Ch\u00ednh H\u00e3ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5826\" data-end=\"5944\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n SenSilk kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5946\" data-end=\"6138\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a, <strong data-start=\"6025\" data-end=\"6065\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D Gi\u00e1ng H\u01b0\u01a1ng Sen<\/strong> s\u1ebd l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn x\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1320000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","cur