han-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sen-nha-lam\/","sku":"KLDI02 SENNHALAM","short_description":"<p data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"1195\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p v\u1edbi c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1389\">Gam m\u00e0u lam ng\u1ecdc k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 c\u00f9ng \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim gi\u00fap Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh cho m\u1eb9, s\u1ebfp n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI02 SENNHALAM<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"378\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ho\u1ea1 Mi\u00ean<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Lam ng\u1ecdc \u2013 Tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-section-id=\"1hl9smj\" data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1920\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam C\u00f3 G\u00ec \u0110\u1eb7c Bi\u1ec7t?<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gunxif\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1973\">Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Trong Ng\u00f4n Ng\u1eef Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1975\" data-end=\"2186\">L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh cao c\u1ee7a hoa sen, Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh sen tr\u1eafng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n lam ng\u1ecdc d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, tinh t\u1ebf nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-5\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20168#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sen-lam-chieu-sensilk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Sen Lam Chi\u1ec1u SenSilk v\u1edbi s\u1eafc lam d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20167#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-an-hong-sen-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu cho\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen h\u1ed3ng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20172#main\"><img width=\"251\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sac-lien-xua-sensilk-251x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen v\u00e0ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a tr\u1eafng thanh l\u1ecbch\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20170#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sen-nha-lam-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen tr\u1eafng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n lam sang tr\u1ecdng\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20169#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sen-suong-mai-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu cho\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen tr\u1eafng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n xanh ng\u1ecdc thanh khi\u1ebft\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20171#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-nguyet-ha-sen-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen SenSilk v\u1edbi gam m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5q6sn9\" data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2220\">Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2370\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t. Ch\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb9p gi\u00fap t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch trong t\u1eebng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1qa7iu6\" data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2400\">C\u00f4ng Ngh\u1ec7 In 3D Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2402\" data-end=\"2527\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 gi\u00fap h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc chuy\u1ec3n t\u1ea7ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"18p12km\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2562\">D\u1ec5 D\u00e0ng Ph\u1ed1i Nhi\u1ec1u Phong C\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2691\">\n<li data-section-id=\"q69wf8\" data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2586\">Cho\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 thanh l\u1ecbch<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b9mmjb\" data-start=\"2587\" data-end=\"2607\">Cho\u00e0ng vai d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"362j08\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2626\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12cps39\" data-start=\"2627\" data-end=\"2659\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fw78oz\" data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2691\">Du l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1u4mon5\" data-start=\"2698\" data-end=\"2750\">Ph\u1ee5 Ki\u1ec7n Th\u1eddi Trang Cao C\u1ea5p Cho Ph\u1ee5 N\u1eef Thanh L\u1ecbch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2854\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"3101\">Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng lu\u00f4n \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n kh\u00f3 qu\u00ean. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa hoa sen ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u1eeba mang \u0111\u1eadm b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hgpk9n\" data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3157\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng S\u1ebfp N\u1eef, \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c V\u00e0 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Th\u00e2n \u00dd Ngh\u0129a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3159\" data-end=\"3211\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3375\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjml0g\" data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3238\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6q0zwq\" data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3270\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jndzi9\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3296\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15ouhde\" data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3310\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7t6s9x\" data-start=\"3311\" data-end=\"3331\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sinh nh\u1eadt<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1stesuv\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3350\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1frb5tt\" data-start=\"3351\" data-end=\"3375\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n n\u1eef<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3509\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang theo l\u1eddi ch\u00fac v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 thanh nh\u00e3, b\u00ecnh an v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"27t1k8\" data-start=\"3516\" data-end=\"3555\">Kh\u00e1m Ph\u00e1 Th\u00eam C\u00e1c B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3625\">N\u1ebfu y\u00eau th\u00edch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam, qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o th\u00eam:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3906\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1csx5m1\" data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3671\">B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ojhuq8\" data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3697\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-in\/\">B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10jfag6\" data-start=\"3698\" data-end=\"3733\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-ky-thuat-so-an-hong-sen\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12tjn5\" data-start=\"3734\" data-end=\"3772\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/silk-printed-scarf-sensilk-lotus-kldi03\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"92q7u5\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3848\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-sen-vang-kldi01\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Sen Lam Chi\u1ec1u<\/a><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f8ib5s\" data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3874\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng S\u1ebfp N\u1eef Cao C\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3bbwdn\" data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3906\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"od32lr\" data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"3943\">H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"4076\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1djvfsu\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3970\">Gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"40f98t\" data-start=\"3971\" data-end=\"3998\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u trong n\u01b0\u1edbc<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pmado1\" data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4015\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1d0rzls\" data-start=\"4016\" data-end=\"4042\">Tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6mhoob\" data-start=\"4043\" data-end=\"4076\">\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"6eer1j\" data-start=\"4083\" data-end=\"4104\">C\u00e2u H\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dxlvdf\" data-start=\"4106\" data-end=\"4152\">Kh\u0103n Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4228\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jyzp5\" data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4285\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4417\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch VIP ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4419\" data-end=\"4452\">Xem th\u00eam: Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng S\u1ebfp N\u1eef Cao C\u1ea5p<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4454\" data-end=\"4493\">Xem th\u00eam: Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1r3pocd\" data-start=\"4495\" data-end=\"4543\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D tr\u00ean kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4660\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i gi\u00fap h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc ch\u00e2n th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cnfxxh\" data-start=\"4662\" data-end=\"4716\">Kh\u0103n Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng trang ph\u1ee5c n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4808\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, v\u00e1y c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1gfaigf\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4851\">B\u1ed9 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam g\u1ed3m nh\u1eefng g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4853\" data-end=\"4934\">B\u1ed9 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m g\u1ed3m kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk, t\u00fai x\u00e1ch v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"19euxoy\" data-start=\"4936\" data-end=\"4985\">Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0o c\u1ee7a SenSilk?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5069\">Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5071\" data-end=\"5104\">Xem th\u00eam: B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17xx4bd\" data-start=\"5111\" data-end=\"5131\">Th\u00f4ng Tin Li\u00ean H\u1ec7<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5133\" data-end=\"5164\">SenSilk \u2013 Luxury Mulberry Printed Silk Scarves<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5166\" data-end=\"5198\">Hotline: 0976722736 \u2013 0963545166<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5200\" data-end=\"5281\">Chi nh\u00e1nh H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i: B15-08A, Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, M\u1ef9 \u0110\u00ecnh, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5283\" data-end=\"5372\">Chi nh\u00e1nh H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh: 20\/1A1 Nguy\u1ec5n Thi\u1ec7n Thu\u1eadt, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng 14, Qu\u1eadn B\u00ecnh Th\u1ea1nh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5401\">Website: <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5383\" data-end=\"5401\">https:\/\/sensilk.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1880000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"1880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\">