d_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/20153","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=12926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=14378"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=20153&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20142,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Sen Lam \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p T\u1eeb L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-ve-tay-sen-lam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-ve-tay-sen-lam\/","sku":"KLV75 SENLAM","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"427\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Sen Lam SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p tinh t\u1ebf gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"149\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a li\u00ean hoa tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a tr\u1eafng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf vu\u00f4ng 75 \u00d7 75 cm mang n\u00e9t thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tinh t\u1ebf mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ak2r85\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"454\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"454\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"1545\">. <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"474\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLV75 SENLAM<br data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"491\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"562\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"613\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"645\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng V\u1ebd Tay 75x55cm<br data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"678\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"695\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 75 x 75 cm<br data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"725\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"744\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"759\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen<br data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"793\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"853\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1042\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1068\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi:<\/strong> D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, n\u01a1 t\u00fai, th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 tay trang tr\u00ed, n\u01a1 c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng, cho\u00e0ng vai\u2026<br data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1161\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1350\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1462\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1477\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1538\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","description":"<h2>\u00dd Ngh\u0129a Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf Sen Lam<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay Sen Lam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb h\u00ecnh t\u01b0\u1ee3ng hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh cao, thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">S\u1eafc xanh lam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o, t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 b\u00ecnh an, tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7 v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u n\u1ed9i t\u00e2m. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c n\u00e9t v\u00e0ng kim m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0, t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, y\u00eau v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 theo \u0111u\u1ed5i phong c\u00e1ch thanh l\u1ecbch hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qft0vn\" data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2614\">\ud83d\udcca Th\u00f4ng S\u1ed1 S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2944\">\n<thead data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2641\">\n<tr data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2641\">\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2629\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thu\u1ed9c t\u00ednh<\/th>\n<th class=\"last:pe-10\" data-start=\"2629\" data-end=\"2641\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Chi ti\u1ebft<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2944\">\n<tr data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2693\">\n<td data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2693\">SenSilk<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2733\">\n<td data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2706\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2706\" data-end=\"2733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2764\">\n<td data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2746\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2746\" data-end=\"2764\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2792\">\n<td data-start=\"2765\" data-end=\"2778\" data-col-size=\"sm\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2792\" data-col-size=\"sm\">75 x 75 cm<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2824\">\n<td data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2804\" data-col-size=\"sm\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2824\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Hoa sen xanh lam<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2855\">\n<td data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2836\" data-col-size=\"sm\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2836\" data-end=\"2855\" data-col-size=\"sm\">V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2902\">\n<td data-start=\"2856\" data-end=\"2865\" data-col-size=\"sm\">M\u00e0u v\u1ebd<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"2865\" data-end=\"2902\" data-col-size=\"sm\">M\u00e0u chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2944\">\n<td data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2914\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2914\" data-end=\"2944\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 + T\u00fai gi\u1ea5y + Thi\u1ec7p<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2>\u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt C\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Sen Lam<\/h2>\n<h3>L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c Cao C\u1ea5p<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3>V\u1ebd Tay Th\u1ee7 C\u00f4ng \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n SenSilk tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a. V\u00ec v\u1eady kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 hai s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n gi\u1ed1ng nhau, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3>Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u0110\u1ea7y \u00dd Ngh\u0129a<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Sen Lam ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, b\u00e0, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ngo\u1ea1i giao mang \u0111\u1eadm b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\ud83d\udc49 Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u00eam c\u00e1c m\u1eabu <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-ve-tay-cao-cap\/\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay SenSilk<\/a> d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2>D\u1ecbch V\u1ee5 C\u00e1 Nh\u00e2n H\u00f3a Theo Y\u00eau C\u1ea7u<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">SenSilk h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Vi\u1ebft t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn l\u00ean kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<li>V\u1ebd l\u1eddi ch\u00fac ri\u00eang.<\/li>\n<li>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u.<\/li>\n<li>V\u1ebd logo doanh nghi\u1ec7p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Th\u1eddi gian ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n t\u1eeb 3\u20135 ng\u00e0y. Tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p c\u1ea7n g\u1ea5p vui l\u00f2ng li\u00ean h\u1ec7 hotline \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3.<\/p>\n<h2>H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n lu\u00f4n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eefa t\u1eafm d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng thu\u1ed1c t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft xo\u1eafn kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u01a1i n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh n\u1eafng g\u1eaft.<\/li>\n<li>\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 Silk.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>C\u00e2u H\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3>Kh\u0103n Sen Lam c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i v\u1ebd tay th\u1eadt kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n SenSilk v\u1ebd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3>M\u00e0u v\u1ebd c\u00f3 b\u1ecb phai kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u00f4ng. Kh\u0103n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e0u cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 h\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec7t gi\u00fap m\u00e0u b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<h3>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. M\u1ed7i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2>Kh\u00e1m Ph\u00e1 Th\u00eam B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\ud83d\udc49 Xem th\u00eam b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-vuong-ve-tay\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng V\u1ebd Tay SenSilk<\/a><\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\ud83d\udc49 BST <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-thuy-an-doc-ban\/\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/a><\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\ud83d\udc49 <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<\/a><\/p>\n<h2>Th\u00f4ng Tin Li\u00ean H\u1ec7<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">SenSilk \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Th\u1ee7 C\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\ud83d\udcde Hotline: 0976722736 \u2013 0963545166<\/p>\n<p c