ld_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","formatted_dimensions":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Sen Lam \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p T\u1eeb L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=20142","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/20142","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=12926"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=14455"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=20142&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20129,"name":"\u00c1ng Sen Mai | Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n | SenSilk","slug":"ang-sen-mai-khan-lua-thuy-an-ve-tay-doc-ban","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/ang-sen-mai-khan-lua-thuy-an-ve-tay-doc-ban\/","sku":"KLTA ANGSENMAI","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"131\"><strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"131\">T\u1ef1a N\u01b0\u1edbc \u2013 S\u1eafc M\u00e0u \u2013 V\u00e0 L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 Tr\u1eddi<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"591\">T\u1eeb nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng ng\u1eabu h\u1ee9ng c\u1ee7a s\u1eafc m\u00e0u tr\u00ean m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n l\u01b0u gi\u1eef tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i. <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"299\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/strong> \u2013 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"348\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk \u2013 g\u1ee3i m\u1edf kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc h\u1ed3 sen th\u1ee9c gi\u1ea5c trong \u00e1nh b\u00ecnh minh, n\u01a1i s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9 tan v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng d\u1ea3i xanh c\u1ee7a m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111i\u1ec3m xuy\u1ebft s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen. M\u1ed9t tuy\u1ec7t t\u00e1c l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao, bay b\u1ed5ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tz0tp2\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"615\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"1204\">\n<li data-section-id=\"17361cl\" data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"636\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLTA ANGSENMAI<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mcthqh\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"847\"><strong data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"720\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"906\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"948\"><strong data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"932\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1035\"><strong data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"976\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jzma09\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1053\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 75 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"iauisj\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1101\"><strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1081\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd v\u00e0 nhu\u1ed9m th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1gta6\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1125\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1117\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa sen \u00e1nh d\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fms7b7\" data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1498\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1350\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf theo tinh th\u1ea7n quiet luxury; t\u00f4n vinh v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pheoen\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1745\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1528\">D\u1ecbp s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng &amp; qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n qu\u00fd; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, ngo\u1ea1i giao, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u m\u1ed1c \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1te3q\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1799\"><strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1761\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p tre cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1824\"><strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1819\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t1te3q\" data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1179\"><\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"4h1dll\" data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1584\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai \u2013 Kh\u00fac B\u00ecnh Minh Tr\u00ean M\u1eb7t N\u01b0\u1edbc<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1684\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb s\u1ef1 s\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o, m\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sinh ra trong m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc r\u1ea5t ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1729\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1701\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1731\" data-end=\"1987\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng tr\u1ea3i r\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 \u00e1nh n\u1eafng \u0111\u1ea7u ng\u00e0y, g\u1eb7p nh\u1eefng d\u1ea3i xanh trong tr\u1ebbo c\u1ee7a m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc. Gi\u1eefa kho\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u \u1ea5y, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00e0u l\u00e1 xanh hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t h\u1ed3 sen v\u1eeba th\u1ee9c gi\u1ea5c sau m\u00e0n s\u01b0\u01a1ng s\u1edbm.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2200\">T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1edfi s\u1ef1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u1ea3n m\u00e0 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2067\">v\u00e0ng \u2013 xanh \u2013 h\u1ed3ng<\/strong>: s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng \u0111em \u0111\u1ebfn h\u01a1i \u1ea5m, s\u1eafc xanh t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 d\u1ecbu m\u00e1t, trong khi nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen h\u1ed3ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2202\" data-end=\"2375\">Khi tr\u1ea3i ph\u1eb3ng, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c m\u1edf ra nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t phong c\u1ea3nh. Khi kho\u00e1c l\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi, nh\u1eefng n\u1ebfp l\u1ee5a l\u00e0m c\u00e1c m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, khi\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2506\"><strong data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2506\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Ang-Sen-Mai-BST-Thuy-An-Ky-Lua.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-20137\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Ang-Sen-Mai-BST-Thuy-An-Ky-Lua-1024x820.jpg\" alt=\"T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u00c1ng Sen Mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c cao c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a SenSilk\" width=\"1020\" height=\"817\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"ovy5cx\" data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2533\">V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p C\u1ee7a \u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2535\" data-end=\"2631\">\u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m n\u1eb1m \u1edf c\u00e1ch m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n h\u00f3a th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2633\" data-end=\"2888\">\u1ede ph\u1ea7n trung t\u00e2m, s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t v\u00f9ng s\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a b\u00ecnh minh. Hai b\u00ean m\u1edf ra nh\u1eefng m\u1ea3ng xanh v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9, g\u1ee3i li\u00ean t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1eb7t h\u1ed3 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00e0u l\u00e1 sen. Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed xen k\u1ebd, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1ecbp \u0111i\u1ec7u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean cho to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"3047\">C\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n kh\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n m\u00e0 c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ec1m, loang v\u00e0 \u0111an xen. Ch\u00ednh s\u1ef1 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u1ea5y khi\u1ebfn m\u1ed7i v\u00f9ng m\u00e0u mang m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc th\u00e1i ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3178\"><strong data-start=\"3049\" data-end=\"3178\">Kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1, kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 tr\u1ea7m l\u1eafng \u2013 \u00c1ng Sen Mai gi\u1eef m\u1ed9t v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng nh\u01b0ng thanh nh\u00e3, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1aci6sr\" data-start=\"3180\" data-end=\"3228\">Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n \u2013 Khi N\u01b0\u1edbc L\u01b0u Gi\u1eef S\u1eafc M\u00e0u<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3387\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n l\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt t\u1ea1o h\u00ecnh tr\u00ean m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc, n\u01a1i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3389\" data-end=\"3484\">Trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u1ea5y, n\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o m\u00e0u m\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3486\" data-end=\"3687\">M\u1ed9t chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u1eb9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n kh\u00e1c. M\u1ed9t s\u1eafc m\u00e0u lan r\u1ed9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m thay \u0111\u1ed5i to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 t\u01b0\u01a1ng quan c\u1ee7a b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c. Ch\u00ednh v\u00ec v\u1eady, qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o t\u00e1c lu\u00f4n ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ef1ng y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 b\u1ea5t ng\u1edd v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3859\">V\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3708\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/strong>, nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng \u1ea5y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1eeba c\u00f3 t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, v\u1eeba gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vctkzh\" data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3911\">\u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n \u2013 Gi\u00e1 Tr\u1ecb N\u1eb1m \u1ede \u0110i\u1ec1u Kh\u00f4ng Th\u1ec3 L\u1eb7p L\u1ea1i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3913\" data-end=\"4012\">\u0110\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"3974\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/strong> l\u00e0 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4195\">M\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o t\u00e1c l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n m\u00e0u s\u1eafc t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c nhau. V\u00ec v\u1eady, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n, s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4265\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u00fd do m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n SenSilk mang m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4380\"><strong data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4380\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a, m\u00e0 s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt ch\u1ec9 xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"yj1h45\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4421\">100% L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m \u2013 N\u1ec1n C\u1ee7a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4423\" data-end=\"4519\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c tr\u00ean <strong data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4472\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u0169 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4759\">L\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m. Khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i ho\u1eb7c khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 kh\u00e1c nhau, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c m\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n tr\u1edf n\u00ean s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4761\" data-end=\"4929\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"4776\" data-end=\"4791\">180 \u00d7 75 cm<\/strong>, \u00c1ng Sen Mai c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 linh ho\u1ea1t s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng vai, kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12wsjuj\" data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4979\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai \u2013 Khi Hoa Sen K\u1ec3 Chuy\u1ec7n B\u00ecnh Minh<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5046\">Hoa sen v\u1ed1n \u0111\u00e3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5145\">Nh\u01b0ng v\u1edbi SenSilk, hoa sen kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t thi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5147\" data-end=\"5349\">Trong <strong data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5168\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/strong>, hoa sen xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n gi\u1eefa m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian m\u00e0u s\u1eafc r\u1ed9ng m\u1edf. Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen h\u1ed3ng n\u1ed5i l\u00ean gi\u1eefa s\u1eafc xanh c\u1ee7a m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc, trong khi \u00e1nh v\u00e0ng tr\u1ea3i d\u00e0i nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng tia n\u1eafng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0y m\u1edbi.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5351\" data-end=\"5387\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u1eeba quen v\u1eeba m\u1edbi:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5389\" data-end=\"5460\"><strong data-start=\"5389\" data-end=\"5460\">Hoa sen c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n3crj2\" data-start=\"5462\" data-end=\"5490\">Phong C\u00e1ch &amp; C\u00e1ch Ph\u1ed1i \u0110\u1ed3<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5492\" data-end=\"5690\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai mang tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"5519\" data-end=\"5556\">thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong>, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury \u2013 n\u01a1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf thay v\u00ec nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5692\" data-end=\"6289\">\n<li data-section-id=\"rg8wah\" data-start=\"5692\" data-end=\"5841\"><strong data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5710\">C\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i:<\/strong> Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng m\u1ec1m quanh c\u1ed5, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, v\u00e0ng nh\u1ea1t, xanh ng\u1ecdc ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19vek2w\" data-start=\"5842\" data-end=\"5947\"><strong data-start=\"5844\" data-end=\"5867\">Trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf:<\/strong> K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng blazer, s\u01a1 mi ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ea7m \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fiks7w\" data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"6073\"><strong data-start=\"5950\" data-end=\"5967\">Quiet Luxury:<\/strong> Ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi beige, kem, tr\u1eafng, n\u00e2u nh\u1ea1t, xanh navy ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam trung t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mri1z3\" data-start=\"6074\" data-end=\"6178\"><strong data-start=\"6076\" data-end=\"6088\">D\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c:<\/strong> Cho\u00e0ng h\u1edd tr\u00ean vai c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m l\u1ee5a ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ea7m t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b52h2m\" data-start=\"6179\" data-end=\"6289\"><strong data-start=\"6181\" data-end=\"6196\">Ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 trong nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng kh\u00f4ng gian th\u01b0 th\u00e1i.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1k979ot\" data-start=\"6291\" data-end=\"6342\">M\u1ed9t T\u00e1c Ph\u1ea9m L\u1ee5a D\u00e0nh Cho Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Tr\u00e2n Qu\u00fd C\u00e1i \u0110\u1eb9p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6344\" data-end=\"6449\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u \u2013 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6573\">T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch, y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6575\" data-end=\"6696\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ai mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0a m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"6632\" data-end=\"6666\">h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> v\u00e0o phong c\u00e1ch s\u1ed1ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"q1gsrx\" data-start=\"6698\" data-end=\"6759\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 Trao M\u1ed9t T\u00e1c Ph\u1ea9m, G\u1eedi M\u1ed9t T\u1ea5m L\u00f2ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6761\" data-end=\"6927\">V\u1edbi d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"6770\" data-end=\"6796\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/strong>, SenSilk kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n cao c\u1ea5p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m <strong data-start=\"6881\" data-end=\"6926\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6929\" data-end=\"6971\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"6973\" data-end=\"7257\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1s8mh\" data-start=\"6973\" data-end=\"7006\"><strong data-start=\"6975\" data-end=\"7006\">Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xawt5l\" data-start=\"7007\" data-end=\"7031\"><strong data-start=\"7009\" data-end=\"7031\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jbrs1x\" data-start=\"7032\" data-end=\"7059\"><strong data-start=\"7034\" data-end=\"7059\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, n\u1eef l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"blo6c7\" data-start=\"7060\" data-end=\"7105\"><strong data-start=\"7062\" data-end=\"7105\">M\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"140z29a\" data-start=\"7106\" data-end=\"7137\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rufcxc\" data-start=\"7138\" data-end=\"7155\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tm5iw3\" data-start=\"7156\" data-end=\"7202\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u m\u1ed1c quan tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1x42iot\" data-start=\"7203\" data-end=\"7257\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf y\u00eau v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"7259\" data-end=\"7408\">T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7288\" data-end=\"7329\">h\u1ed9p tre cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng t\u1eeb h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb b\u00ean trong.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7410\" data-end=\"7464\"><strong data-start=\"7410\" data-end=\"7464\">M\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu.<br data-start=\"7435\" data-end=\"7438\" \/>M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e2n qu\u00fd.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"xfbs21\" data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7498\">H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn S\u1eed D\u1ee5ng V\u00e0 B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7500\" data-end=\"7548\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7937\">\n<li data-section-id=\"mhiano\" data-start=\"7550\" data-end=\"7623\"><strong data-start=\"7552\" data-end=\"7574\">Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng<\/strong> v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t gi\u1eb7t d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9 d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"muwffc\" data-start=\"7624\" data-end=\"7666\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxve9m\" data-start=\"7667\" data-end=\"7697\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18i9a3i\" data-start=\"7698\" data-end=\"7725\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c xo\u1eafn kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1c8x352\" data-start=\"7726\" data-end=\"7780\">Nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng \u00e9p n\u01b0\u1edbc ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng kh\u0103n s\u1ea1ch th\u1ea5m b\u1edbt n\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyt2h4\" data-start=\"7781\" data-end=\"7831\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wn9kcq\" data-start=\"7832\" data-end=\"7878\">\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16hbu75\" data-start=\"7879\" data-end=\"7937\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"19oa1lu\" data-start=\"7939\" data-end=\"7966\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00e2u H\u1ecfi Th\u01b0\u1eddng G\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"148rriu\" data-start=\"7968\" data-end=\"8015\">KLTA ANGSENMAI c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8017\" data-end=\"8188\">C\u00f3. KLTA ANGSENMAI thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"8047\" data-end=\"8073\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk. \u0110\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1o t\u00e1c khi\u1ebfn \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vasso7\" data-start=\"8190\" data-end=\"8234\">KLTA ANGSENMAI \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8236\" data-end=\"8305\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"8261\" data-end=\"8280\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 75 cm.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8ptp0p\" data-start=\"8307\" data-end=\"8352\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00e0u s\u1eafc ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8354\" data-end=\"8505\">T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"8375\" data-end=\"8401\">s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng, xanh v\u00e0 h\u1ed3ng<\/strong>, trong \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0ng g\u1ee3i \u00e1nh b\u00ecnh minh, xanh g\u1ee3i m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 l\u00e1 sen, c\u00f2n h\u1ed3ng t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ur9z57\" data-start=\"8507\" data-end=\"8545\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8547\" data-end=\"8646\"><strong data-start=\"8547\" data-end=\"8558\">Hoa sen<\/strong>, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng l\u00e1 sen v\u00e0 n\u1ee5 sen trong m\u1ed9t b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c g\u1ee3i h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh h\u1ed3 sen d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh b\u00ecnh minh.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"gp1go6\" data-start=\"8648\" data-end=\"8696\">Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n c\u00f3 gi\u1ed1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8698\" data-end=\"8871\">Kh\u00f4ng. Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u th\u00f4ng qua qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u00e0u tr\u00ean m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi chuy\u1ec3n l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a. V\u00ec v\u1eady, m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11q000\" data-start=\"8873\" data-end=\"8924\">KLTA ANGSENMAI c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8926\" data-end=\"9097\">C\u00f3. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"8946\" data-end=\"9016\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n, h\u00ecnh t\u01b0\u1ee3ng hoa sen v\u00e0 t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n<\/strong> khi\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"jky14v\" data-start=\"9099\" data-end=\"9146\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9148\" data-end=\"9279\">C\u00f3. B\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u v\u00e0ng, xanh v\u00e0 h\u1ed3ng c\u00f9ng k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 75 cm gi\u00fap kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wshpr3\" data-start=\"9286\" data-end=\"9330\">SenSilk \u2013 Khi L\u1ee5a L\u01b0u Gi\u1eef M\u1ed9t Kho\u1ea3nh Kh\u1eafc<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"9332\" data-end=\"9505\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0o ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i, n\u01a1i ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n c\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9507\" data-end=\"9565\"><strong data-start=\"9507\" data-end=\"9522\">\u00c1ng Sen Mai<\/strong> l\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t bu\u1ed5i s\u1edbm tr\u00ean h\u1ed3 sen.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9567\" data-end=\"9668\">\u00c1nh v\u00e0ng v\u1eeba ch\u1ea1m m\u1eb7t n\u01b0\u1edbc.<br data-start=\"9594\" data-end=\"9597\" \/>Nh\u1eefng t\u00e0u l\u00e1 c\u00f2n \u0111\u1eabm h\u01a1i s\u01b0\u01a1ng.<br data-start=\"9628\" data-end=\"9631\" \/>Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a sen h\u1ed3ng b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ee9c gi\u1ea5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9670\" data-end=\"9710\">V\u00e0 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"9712\" data-end=\"9808\"><strong data-start=\"9712\" data-end=\"9808\">M\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc c\u1ee7a b\u00ecnh minh.<br data-start=\"9744\" data-end=\"9747\" \/>M\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n.<br data-start=\"9772\" data-end=\"9775\" \/>M\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a SenSilk.<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"4680000","regular_price":"4680000","sale_price":"4680000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">4.680.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20130,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Ang-Sen-Mai-Khan-Lua-Thuy-An-Ve-Tay-Doc-Ban.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/Ang-Sen-Mai-Khan-Lua-Thuy-An-Ve-Tay-Doc-Ban-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"\u00c1ng Sen Mai &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n","alt":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee