n Mai | Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1ee7y \u1ea4n V\u1ebd Tay \u0110\u1ed9c B\u1ea3n | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=20129","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/20129","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=20129&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20087,"name":"Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Nam Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk CAVAT20","slug":"cavat-nam-cao-cap-sensilk-cavat20","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/cavat-nam-cao-cap-sensilk-cavat20\/","sku":"CAVAT20","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"822\">Business Luxury Cho Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1209\">CAVAT20 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"951\">s\u1eafc navy s\u00e2u, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1ecdc ch\u00e9o Micro-pattern v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n menswear hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>. D\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi, suit ho\u1eb7c blazer, m\u1eabu c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t mang \u0111\u1ebfn di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o ch\u1ec9n chu, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1209\"><strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1113\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, CAVAT20 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1208\">t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n, s\u1ebfp nam ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fv11\" data-start=\"330\" data-end=\"351\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"812\">\n<li data-section-id=\"16fzh1f\" data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"380\"><strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"372\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> CAVAT20<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"486\"><strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"452\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"510\"><strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"501\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yv4wss\" data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"540\"><strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"527\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0rv3x\" data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"569\"><strong data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"558\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 153 \u00d7 8 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5pyjj9\" data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"622\"><strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"585\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> Navy h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1ecdc ch\u00e9o Micro-pattern<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"w43mpz\" data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"640\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Business Luxury \u00b7 Modern Gentleman<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yebphb\" data-start=\"676\" data-end=\"712\"><strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"690\">Ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3:<\/strong> Suit \u00b7 S\u01a1 mi \u00b7 Blazer<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12zywyl\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"747\"><strong data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"728\">Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n:<\/strong> K\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivguta\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"787\"><strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"763\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"812\"><strong data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"807\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fxugyu\" data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1320\">V\u00cc SAO CAVAT20 THU H\u00daT QU\u00dd \u00d4NG HI\u1ec6N \u0110\u1ea0I?<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1419\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng \u0111\u1ec1 cao <strong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1418\">s\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 phong th\u00e1i c\u00f3 gu<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1671\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft qu\u00e1 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, m\u1eabu c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1554\">s\u1eafc navy s\u00e2u, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 c\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i<\/strong>. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng suit ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, CAVAT20 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1673\" data-end=\"1771\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c th\u01b0\u1eddng nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng cu\u1ed9c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"u8ce7d\" data-start=\"1778\" data-end=\"1825\">THI\u1ebeT K\u1ebe NAVY S\u00c2U \u2013 H\u1eccA TI\u1ebeT S\u1eccC CH\u00c9O TINH T\u1ebe<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1979\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"1858\" data-end=\"1875\">xanh navy s\u00e2u<\/strong>, m\u1ed9t gam m\u00e0u kinh \u0111i\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi trang nam gi\u1edbi v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3 linh ho\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2211\">\u0110i\u1ec3m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a m\u1eabu l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2059\">h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1ecdc ch\u00e9o d\u1ea1ng Micro-pattern<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd tinh t\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n v\u1ea3i. Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t nh\u1ecf t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c v\u00e0 gi\u00fap b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t tr\u1edf n\u00ean sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u01a1n khi quan s\u00e1t \u1edf kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch g\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2283\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 l\u1edbn, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2333\"><strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2333\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf bi\u1ebft ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ach5cm\" data-start=\"2340\" data-end=\"2391\">BUSINESS LUXURY \u2013 PHONG TH\u00c1I C\u1ee6A QU\u00dd \u00d4NG HI\u1ec6N \u0110\u1ea0I<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2478\">CAVAT20 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng <strong data-start=\"2434\" data-end=\"2477\">\u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m, t\u1ef1 tin v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2666\">S\u1eafc navy mang n\u00e9t c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n, trong khi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Micro-pattern t\u1ea1o th\u00eam c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y gi\u00fap CAVAT20 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2793\"><strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2793\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, nh\u01b0ng lu\u00f4n bi\u1ebft c\u00e1ch xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00fang l\u00fac v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang phong th\u00e1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1fuupxs\" data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2832\">PH\u1ed0I C\u00d9NG SUIT, S\u01a0 MI &amp; BLAZER<\/h2>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"33o8c5\" data-start=\"2834\" data-end=\"2870\">M\u1ed9t Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf \u2013 Nhi\u1ec1u C\u00e1ch K\u1ebft H\u1ee3p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2973\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00f2a h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng trang ph\u1ee5c mang tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2941\" data-end=\"2972\">business v\u00e0 formal menswear<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y99n80\" data-start=\"2975\" data-end=\"2990\">S\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3081\">T\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u1ea3n thanh l\u1ecbch, gi\u00fap s\u1eafc navy tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n sang tr\u1ecdng trong t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"srclp8\" data-start=\"3083\" data-end=\"3102\">S\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3175\">Mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2ksmnx\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3190\">Suit navy<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3255\">T\u1ea1o t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7u, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hapccp\" data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3269\">Suit x\u00e1m<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3270\" data-end=\"3336\">S\u1eafc navy tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n gi\u00fap b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f3 th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fd86g4\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3348\">Blazer<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3349\" data-end=\"3445\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3372\" data-end=\"3391\">business casual<\/strong>, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n nh\u1eb9.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"km6v5a\" data-start=\"3452\" data-end=\"3462\">\u1ee8NG D\u1ee4NG<\/h2>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1gjuqrs\" data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3509\">T\u1eeb Ph\u00f2ng H\u1ecdp \u0110\u1ebfn Nh\u1eefng Cu\u1ed9c G\u1eb7p Quan Tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3511\" data-end=\"3531\">CAVAT20 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3785\">\n<li data-section-id=\"fx32y5\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3569\">C\u00f4ng s\u1edf v\u00e0 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"d620gl\" data-start=\"3570\" data-end=\"3598\">G\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12gybok\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3624\">H\u1ed9i h\u1ecdp v\u00e0 thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1lnyqb0\" data-start=\"3625\" data-end=\"3657\">H\u1ed9i ngh\u1ecb, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18frsvg\" data-start=\"3658\" data-end=\"3698\">K\u00fd k\u1ebft v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 quan tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"evq5on\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3730\">Ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wx4q02\" data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3785\">Nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9n chu<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3885\">M\u1ed9t m\u1eabu c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng cao nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xw9dj0\" data-start=\"3892\" data-end=\"3937\">K\u1eb8P C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T \u2013 CHI TI\u1ebeT HO\u00c0N THI\u1ec6N PHONG TH\u00c1I<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"4047\">CAVAT20 \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"3954\" data-end=\"3976\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf nh\u01b0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4168\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t, k\u1eb9p gi\u00fap \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t tr\u1edf n\u00ean g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng, ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o th\u00eam \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf tr\u00ean ph\u1ea7n th\u00e2n \u00e1o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4170\" data-end=\"4277\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng qu\u00fd \u00f4ng coi tr\u1ecdng <strong data-start=\"4224\" data-end=\"4276\">s\u1ef1 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eebng \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ecf trong phong c\u00e1ch<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o1p252\" data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4322\">L\u1ee4A JACQUARD \u2013 N\u1ec0N T\u1ea2NG CHO THI\u1ebeT K\u1ebe<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4415\">CAVAT20 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4356\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u1ee7a m\u1eabu.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4417\" data-end=\"4558\">B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u00e0 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho <strong data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4503\">h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Micro-pattern<\/strong>, gi\u00fap thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf navy gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4636\"><strong data-start=\"4560\" data-end=\"4636\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf m\u1edbi l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1 t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a CAVAT20.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p6i8y9\" data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4678\">QU\u00c0 T\u1eb6NG CAO C\u1ea4P D\u00c0NH CHO QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16kmfpf\" data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4710\">CAVAT20 \u2013 M\u1ed9t M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 C\u00f3 Gu<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4798\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1eeba mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4800\" data-end=\"4941\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"4829\" data-end=\"4870\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t set qu\u00e0 ch\u1ec9n chu d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dfz0we\" data-start=\"4943\" data-end=\"4965\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"5089\">\n<li data-section-id=\"jwvpdg\" data-start=\"4967\" data-end=\"4984\"><strong data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"4984\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c nam<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywpege\" data-start=\"4985\" data-end=\"5001\"><strong data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5001\">Doanh nh\u00e2n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1t6wot6\" data-start=\"5002\" data-end=\"5022\"><strong data-start=\"5004\" data-end=\"5022\">S\u1ebfp v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1roa4v\" data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5043\"><strong data-start=\"5025\" data-end=\"5043\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xytgfw\" data-start=\"5044\" data-end=\"5089\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5091\" data-end=\"5198\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5112\" data-end=\"5197\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5200\" data-end=\"5312\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n n\u00f3i l\u00ean <strong data-start=\"5284\" data-end=\"5311\">gu c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"18a512\" data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"751\">H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG V\u00c0 B\u1ea2O QU\u1ea2N<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"s797q1\" data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"769\">C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"972\">\n<li data-section-id=\"o5hywf\" data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"842\">Th\u1eaft c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i, ph\u1ea7n b\u1ea3n l\u1edbn k\u1ebft th\u00fac quanh v\u1ecb tr\u00ed th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rpbbx4\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"900\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"867\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn khi c\u1ea7n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1g9hu7f\" data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"972\">N\u1edbi l\u1ecfng n\u00fat th\u1eaft sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, tr\u00e1nh k\u00e9o m\u1ea1nh l\u00e0m bi\u1ebfn d\u1ea1ng phom.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ayc2td\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"986\">B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1312\">\n<li data-section-id=\"4p2k0o\" data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1043\">Th\u00e1o v\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1019\">treo ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n nh\u1eb9<\/strong> c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1omc0ul\" data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1119\">Tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac l\u00e2u v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m cao, n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa ho\u1eb7c h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wp6owy\" data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1154\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, v\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dmb02r\" data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1228\">Khi c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch, n\u00ean <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1227\">gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17968jx\" data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1312\">B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p khi ch\u01b0a s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf b\u1ee5i v\u00e0 gi\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lu\u00f4n ch\u1ec9n chu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1394\"><strong data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1324\">L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 \u00fd d\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0n \u1ee7i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kdx523\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5342\">\u0110I\u1ec2M NH\u1ea4N C\u1ee6A CAVAT20<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5429\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5346\" data-end=\"5377\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Navy Micro-pattern<\/strong> \u2013 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1ecdc ch\u00e9o tinh t\u1ebf, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5504\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5433\" data-end=\"5460\">S\u1eafc navy s\u00e2u sang tr\u1ecdng<\/strong> \u2013 gam m\u00e0u kinh \u0111i\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi trang nam gi\u1edbi<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5506\" data-end=\"5563\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5527\">Business Luxury<\/strong> \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5565\" data-end=\"5600\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5600\">D\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i suit, s\u01a1 mi v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5602\" data-end=\"5654\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5604\" data-end=\"5630\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u2013 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n phong th\u00e1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5718\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5658\" data-end=\"5674\">L\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong> \u2013 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5720\" data-end=\"5769\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5722\" data-end=\"5749\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong> \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p bi\u1ebfu t\u1eb7ng<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5771\" data-end=\"5836\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5773\" data-end=\"5836\">L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v8jy0o\" data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5867\">C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T CAO C\u1ea4P SENSILK<\/h2>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1xnhr9i\" data-start=\"5869\" data-end=\"5905\">M\u1ed9t Ph\u1ea7n Trong Phong C\u00e1ch SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5907\" data-end=\"6012\">SenSilk x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 xuy\u00ean su\u1ed1t: <strong data-start=\"5957\" data-end=\"6011\">tinh t\u1ebf, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec1 cao gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6221\">B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh nh\u1eefng d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang, <strong data-start=\"6062\" data-end=\"6088\">C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong> m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng phong c\u00e1ch \u1ea5y sang th\u1eddi trang nam \u2014 n\u01a1i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6223\" data-end=\"6257\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho tinh th\u1ea7n \u1ea5y:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6259\" data-end=\"6362\"><strong data-start=\"6259\" data-end=\"6362\">Thanh l\u1ecbch nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7u.<br data-start=\"6293\" data-end=\"6296\" \/>Sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<br data-start=\"6330\" data-end=\"6333\" \/>C\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6364\" data-end=\"6551\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"6427\" data-end=\"6443\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong> c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u2014 n\u01a1i gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n qua <strong data-start=\"6492\" data-end=\"6550\">gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9, s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nv2rfj\" data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6584\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00c2U H\u1eceI TH\u01af\u1edcNG G\u1eb6P<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vrnos2\" data-start=\"6586\" data-end=\"6625\">CAVAT20 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6740\">CAVAT20 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"6647\" data-end=\"6684\">Business Luxury, Modern Gentleman<\/strong> v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nam thanh l\u1ecbch, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d754o0\" data-start=\"6742\" data-end=\"6785\">CAVAT20 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6787\" data-end=\"6884\">CAVAT20 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"6807\" data-end=\"6832\">s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong>, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, navy v\u00e0 x\u00e1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1tu1j53\" data-start=\"6886\" data-end=\"6939\">CAVAT20 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6941\" data-end=\"7091\">C\u00f3. V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111i k\u00e8m v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk, CAVAT20 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"7040\" data-end=\"7090\">\u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n, s\u1ebfp nam v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1d7ddy0\" data-start=\"7093\" data-end=\"7129\">CAVAT20 c\u00f3 k\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7131\" data-end=\"7212\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"7151\" data-end=\"7173\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, gi\u00fap ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kqej6h\" data-start=\"7214\" data-end=\"7252\">CAVAT20 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7254\" data-end=\"7362\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"7279\" data-end=\"7306\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nhu c\u1ea7u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"16uuskq\" data-start=\"7364\" data-end=\"7397\">CAVAT20 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7399\" data-end=\"7432\">CAVAT20 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"7415\" data-end=\"7431\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ua3o9e\" data-start=\"7434\" data-end=\"7489\">CAVAT20 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7491\" data-end=\"7629\">C\u00f3. CAVAT20 l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"7527\" data-end=\"7628\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n doanh nh\u00e2n, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11wciyq\" data-start=\"7636\" data-end=\"7664\">CAVAT20 \u2013 QU\u00dd \u00d4NG HI\u1ec6N \u0110\u1ea0I<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7666\" data-end=\"7716\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n b\u1ed9 suit.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7718\" data-end=\"7803\">N\u00f3 g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean <strong data-start=\"7738\" data-end=\"7802\">\u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, phong th\u00e1i v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 t\u1ef1 tin c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7805\" data-end=\"8016\">V\u1edbi s\u1eafc navy s\u00e2u, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft s\u1ecdc ch\u00e9o tinh t\u1ebf, kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3 linh ho\u1ea1t c\u00f9ng k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk, <strong data-start=\"7921\" data-end=\"7932\">CAVAT20<\/strong> l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng qu\u00fd \u00f4ng coi tr\u1ecdng t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft trong di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8018\" data-end=\"8081\"><strong data-start=\"8018\" data-end=\"8081\">CAVAT20 \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"8083\" data-end=\"8125\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"8083\" data-end=\"8125\" data-is-last-node=\"\">SenSilk \u2013 Tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"850000","regular_price":"960000","sale_price":"850000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">960.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 960.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 850.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20089,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Ca-Vat-Nam-Cao-Cap-\u2013-Business-Luxury-Style-SenSilk.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Ca-Vat-Nam-Cao-Cap-\u2013-Business-Luxury-Style-SenSilk-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1112px) 100vw, 1112px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Nam Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 Business Luxury Style SenSilk","alt":"Qu\u00fd \u00f4ng m\u1eb7c s\u01a1 mi ph\u1ed1i c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t nam cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk phong c\u00e1ch business luxury hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i"},{"id":20092,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Ca-Vat-Lua-Cao-Cap-Luxury-Gentleman.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Ca-Vat-Lua-Cao-Cap-Luxury-Gentleman-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","