scription":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Nam Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk CAVAT20&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=20087","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/20087","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=4929"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=20087&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":20081,"name":"C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk \u2013 Tinh Th\u1ea7n L\u1ecbch L\u00e3m CAVAT19","slug":"cavat-nam-cao-cap-sensilk-tinh-than-lich-lam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/cavat-nam-cao-cap-sensilk-tinh-than-lich-lam\/","sku":"CAVAT19","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"704\"><strong data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"704\">C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk CAVAT19 \u2013 Tinh Th\u1ea7n L\u1ecbch L\u00e3m Cho Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p\">CAVAT19 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi\u00a0<span class=\"15\">n\u1ec1n xanh navy s\u00e2u c\u00f9ng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc Micro-pattern<\/span>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi, suit ho\u1eb7c blazer, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p t\u1eeb m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng cu\u1ed9c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"p\"><span class=\"15\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/span>, CAVAT19 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng\u00a0<span class=\"15\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, s\u1ebfp nam v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/span>.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fv11\" data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"356\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"832\">\n<li data-section-id=\"16fzh0p\" data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"385\"><strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"377\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> CAVAT19<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"491\"><strong data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"457\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"515\"><strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"506\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yv4wss\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"545\"><strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"532\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0rv3x\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"574\"><strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"563\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 153 \u00d7 8 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ytueml\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"641\"><strong data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"590\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc Micro-pattern tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n xanh navy<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l17jy4\" data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"695\"><strong data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"659\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Business Luxury \u00b7 Classic Gentleman<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"43up0f\" data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"732\"><strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"710\">Ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3:<\/strong> S\u01a1 mi \u00b7 Suit \u00b7 Blazer<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12zywyl\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"748\">Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n:<\/strong> K\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivguta\" data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"807\"><strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"783\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"832\"><strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"827\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>","description":"<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"19p9nj3\" data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1654\">CAVAT19 \u2013 V\u1eba \u0110\u1eb8P \u0110\u1ebeN T\u1eea NH\u1eeeNG \u0110\u01af\u1edcNG N\u00c9T TINH T\u1ebe<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1772\">CAVAT19 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1704\">xanh navy s\u00e2u<\/strong>, mang v\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m v\u00e0 nam t\u00ednh \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi trang nam cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"2042\">\u0110i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n n\u1eb1m \u1edf h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng <strong data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1834\">h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc Micro-pattern<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed d\u00e0y nh\u01b0ng ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf. Nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf li\u00ean k\u1ebft v\u1edbi nhau t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u, \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7u khi nh\u00ecn g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch khi nh\u00ecn t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2117\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ki\u1ec3u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00e0ng quan s\u00e1t k\u1ef9 c\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn ra nhi\u1ec1u chi ti\u1ebft th\u00fa v\u1ecb.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2176\"><strong data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2176\">Tinh t\u1ebf \u1edf kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch g\u1ea7n, sang tr\u1ecdng trong t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"w8up7m\" data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2223\">DESIGN IDENTITY \u2013 NAVY MICRO GEOMETRIC<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwvhdb\" data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2278\">H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft H\u00ecnh H\u1ecdc Mang Tinh Th\u1ea7n Classic Gentleman<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2280\" data-end=\"2333\">CAVAT19 kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u1ed9t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft l\u1edbn l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2335\" data-end=\"2468\">Thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, <strong data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2379\">nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc nh\u1ecf<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i c\u00f3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u00edch, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1ecbp \u0111i\u1ec7u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng tr\u00ean to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 th\u00e2n c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2470\" data-end=\"2608\">N\u1ec1n navy gi\u00fap c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft tr\u1edf n\u00ean tr\u1ea7m v\u00e0 s\u00e2u h\u01a1n, trong khi c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft t\u1ea1o ra c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tinh t\u1ebf khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2660\">Ch\u00ednh s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1 t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a CAVAT19:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2778\"><strong data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2778\">C\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u0169.<br data-start=\"2687\" data-end=\"2690\" \/>C\u00f3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<br data-start=\"2725\" data-end=\"2728\" \/>L\u1ecbch l\u00e3m nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"krdftw\" data-start=\"2785\" data-end=\"2833\">BUSINESS LUXURY \u2013 PHONG TH\u00c1I C\u1ee6A QU\u00dd \u00d4NG C\u00d3 GU<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2925\">CAVAT19 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng y\u00eau th\u00edch <strong data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2924\">s\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft c\u00f3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u00edch<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"3048\">Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n m\u00e0u s\u1eafc qu\u00e1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft qu\u00e1 l\u1edbn, CAVAT19 t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n b\u1eb1ng ch\u00ednh c\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3203\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 suit v\u1eeba v\u1eb7n, chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f3 th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u00f5 phong th\u00e1i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3278\"><strong data-start=\"3205\" data-end=\"3278\">M\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng mu\u1ed1n l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m theo c\u00e1ch ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"gnr8kw\" data-start=\"3285\" data-end=\"3317\">PH\u1ed0I C\u00d9NG S\u01a0 MI, SUIT &amp; BLAZER<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"z5wfnh\" data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3366\">CAVAT19 \u2013 Linh Ho\u1ea1t Trong Phong C\u00e1ch Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng<\/h3>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"y99n80\" data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3383\">S\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3505\">L\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch nh\u1ea5t. N\u1ec1n s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng gi\u00fap s\u1eafc navy c\u00f9ng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc c\u1ee7a CAVAT19 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"srclp8\" data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3526\">S\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3600\">T\u1ea1o t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2ksmnx\" data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3615\">Suit navy<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3617\" data-end=\"3671\">Mang \u0111\u1ebfn di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7u, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"hapccp\" data-start=\"3673\" data-end=\"3685\">Suit x\u00e1m<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3791\">Gi\u00fap CAVAT19 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n r\u00f5 h\u01a1n trong t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u00e1c cu\u1ed9c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fd86g4\" data-start=\"3793\" data-end=\"3803\">Blazer<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3934\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng blazer gi\u00fap thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u1edf n\u00ean linh ho\u1ea1t h\u01a1n, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3874\" data-end=\"3893\">business casual<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 formal.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"km6v5a\" data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3951\">\u1ee8NG D\u1ee4NG<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vhmdyi\" data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3999\">T\u1eeb C\u00f4ng S\u1edf \u0110\u1ebfn Nh\u1eefng Cu\u1ed9c G\u1eb7p G\u1ee1 Quan Tr\u1ecdng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4037\">CAVAT19 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4306\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1vdil2g\" data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4072\"><strong data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4072\">\u0110i l\u00e0m v\u00e0 g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yg1x5d\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4093\"><strong data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4093\">G\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"u3nzy6\" data-start=\"4094\" data-end=\"4121\"><strong data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4121\">H\u1ed9i h\u1ecdp, thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q0aoc6\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4160\"><strong data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4160\">H\u1ed9i ngh\u1ecb v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"98bbdp\" data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4192\"><strong data-start=\"4163\" data-end=\"4192\">K\u00fd k\u1ebft, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 quan tr\u1ecdng<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rb71ya\" data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4226\"><strong data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4226\">Ti\u1ec7c v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lo433y\" data-start=\"4227\" data-end=\"4254\"><strong data-start=\"4229\" data-end=\"4254\">Trang ph\u1ee5c doanh nh\u00e2n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"eda8y2\" data-start=\"4255\" data-end=\"4306\"><strong data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4306\">Nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, ch\u1ec9n chu<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4408\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ee7 trang tr\u1ecdng cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 linh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"95fprd\" data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4451\">K\u1eb8P C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T \u2013 HO\u00c0N THI\u1ec6N PHONG TH\u00c1I<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4547\">CAVAT19 \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"4468\" data-end=\"4490\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o th\u00eam m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4549\" data-end=\"4646\">K\u1eb9p gi\u00fap c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t gi\u1eef v\u1ecb tr\u00ed ngay ng\u1eafn, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng h\u01a1n khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u01a1 mi.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4756\">M\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf, nh\u01b0ng ch\u00ednh nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft nh\u01b0 v\u1eady t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong phong c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t qu\u00fd \u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yn2dec\" data-start=\"4763\" data-end=\"4777\">L\u1ee4A JACQUARD<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"94w0am\" data-start=\"4779\" data-end=\"4812\">N\u1ec1n T\u1ea3ng Cho Hi\u1ec7u \u1ee8ng H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4814\" data-end=\"4900\">CAVAT19 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4846\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"5018\">B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t gi\u00fap c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft Micro-pattern t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u00ean th\u00e2n c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5020\" data-end=\"5139\">\u1ede CAVAT19, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 th\u1ee9 c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 di\u1ec5n; n\u00f3 \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 <strong data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5138\">l\u00e0m n\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ec3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n c\u00e1 t\u00ednh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"p6i8y9\" data-start=\"5146\" data-end=\"5181\">QU\u00c0 T\u1eb6NG CAO C\u1ea4P D\u00c0NH CHO QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"uu6lr8\" data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5221\">CAVAT19 \u2013 M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 C\u1ee7a S\u1ef1 Tr\u00e2n Tr\u1ecdng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5405\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng r\u1ea5t ri\u00eang d\u00e0nh cho nam gi\u1edbi \u2014 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng kinh doanh v\u00e0 giao ti\u1ebfp chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5542\">CAVAT19 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5477\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ch\u1ec9n chu ngay t\u1eeb h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dfz0we\" data-start=\"5544\" data-end=\"5566\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"5568\" data-end=\"5657\">\n<li data-section-id=\"6yh2qe\" data-start=\"5568\" data-end=\"5581\"><strong data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5581\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywpege\" data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5598\"><strong data-start=\"5584\" data-end=\"5598\">Doanh nh\u00e2n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1furtpy\" data-start=\"5599\" data-end=\"5612\"><strong data-start=\"5601\" data-end=\"5612\">S\u1ebfp nam<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16b7nre\" data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5636\"><strong data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5636\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1roa4v\" data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5657\"><strong data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5657\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5659\" data-end=\"5757\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5756\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5759\" data-end=\"5878\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00f3 gu kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG V\u00c0 B\u1ea2O QU\u1ea2N<\/h2>\n<p><b>C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u1eaft c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i, ph\u1ea7n b\u1ea3n l\u1edbn k\u1ebft th\u00fac quanh v\u1ecb tr\u00ed th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <b>k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t<\/b> \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn khi c\u1ea7n.<\/li>\n<li>N\u1edbi l\u1ecfng n\u00fat th\u1eaft sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, tr\u00e1nh k\u00e9o m\u1ea1nh l\u00e0m bi\u1ebfn d\u1ea1ng phom.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u00e1o v\u00e0 <b>treo ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n nh\u1eb9<\/b> c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac l\u00e2u v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m cao, n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa ho\u1eb7c h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, v\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Khi c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch, n\u00ean <b>gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/b>.<\/li>\n<li>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p khi ch\u01b0a s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf b\u1ee5i v\u00e0 gi\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lu\u00f4n ch\u1ec9n chu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/b> Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 \u00fd d\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0n \u1ee7i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kdx50x\" data-start=\"5885\" data-end=\"5908\">\u0110I\u1ec2M NH\u1ea4N C\u1ee6A CAVAT19<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5910\" data-end=\"5974\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5912\" data-end=\"5936\">Navy Micro Geometric<\/strong> \u2013 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc nh\u1ecf t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5976\" data-end=\"6034\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"5978\" data-end=\"5999\">N\u1ec1n xanh navy s\u00e2u<\/strong> \u2013 nam t\u00ednh, \u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6099\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6070\">Phong c\u00e1ch Classic Gentleman<\/strong> \u2013 l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m v\u00e0 v\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u1eddi gian<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6101\" data-end=\"6161\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6103\" data-end=\"6122\">Business Luxury<\/strong> \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh doanh nh\u00e2n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6163\" data-end=\"6198\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6165\" data-end=\"6198\">D\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6200\" data-end=\"6228\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6202\" data-end=\"6228\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6230\" data-end=\"6259\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6232\" data-end=\"6259\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6261\" data-end=\"6325\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"6263\" data-end=\"6325\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v8jy0o\" data-start=\"6332\" data-end=\"6356\">C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T CAO C\u1ea4P SENSILK<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4hevbt\" data-start=\"6358\" data-end=\"6399\">Tinh Th\u1ea7n L\u1ecbch L\u00e3m Trong T\u1eebng Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6401\" data-end=\"6494\">C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong h\u1ec7 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6496\" data-end=\"6697\">M\u1ed7i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u01b0\u1edbng theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang, t\u1eeb m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c \u2014 \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n m\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh <strong data-start=\"6653\" data-end=\"6696\">m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong phong th\u00e1i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6699\" data-end=\"6730\">CAVAT19 \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho tinh th\u1ea7n:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6777\"><strong data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6777\">L\u1ecbch l\u00e3m.<br data-start=\"6743\" data-end=\"6746\" \/>\u0110i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m.<br data-start=\"6755\" data-end=\"6758\" \/>Tinh t\u1ebf.<br data-start=\"6766\" data-end=\"6769\" \/>C\u00f3 gu.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6779\" data-end=\"6925\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"6832\" data-end=\"6848\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong> c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u2014 \u0111\u1ec1 cao s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf thay v\u00ec ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nv2rfj\" data-start=\"6932\" data-end=\"6958\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00c2U H\u1eceI TH\u01af\u1edcNG G\u1eb6P<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"a1ixnc\" data-start=\"6960\" data-end=\"6999\">CAVAT19 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7001\" data-end=\"7113\">CAVAT19 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7021\" data-end=\"7059\">Classic Gentleman, Business Luxury<\/strong> v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nam l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kq87i1\" data-start=\"7115\" data-end=\"7142\">CAVAT19 c\u00f3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7144\" data-end=\"7264\">CAVAT19 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"7160\" data-end=\"7195\">h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc Micro-pattern<\/strong> tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n xanh navy, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf cho thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"xjmep1\" data-start=\"7266\" data-end=\"7302\">CAVAT19 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7304\" data-end=\"7389\">CAVAT19 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"7325\" data-end=\"7388\">s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, s\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t, suit navy, suit x\u00e1m v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"4pkrgt\" data-start=\"7391\" data-end=\"7444\">CAVAT19 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7446\" data-end=\"7581\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"7473\" data-end=\"7514\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, s\u1ebfp nam v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1hbat2q\" data-start=\"7583\" data-end=\"7619\">CAVAT19 c\u00f3 k\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7621\" data-end=\"7664\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"7641\" data-end=\"7663\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wohl2r\" data-start=\"7666\" data-end=\"7704\">CAVAT19 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7706\" data-end=\"7807\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"7731\" data-end=\"7758\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xlnglc\" data-start=\"7809\" data-end=\"7842\">CAVAT19 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7844\" data-end=\"7877\">CAVAT19 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"7860\" data-end=\"7876\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11rfws8\" data-start=\"7879\" data-end=\"7934\">CAVAT19 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7936\" data-end=\"8051\">C\u00f3. CAVAT19 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"7960\" data-end=\"8050\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"n7drh8\" data-start=\"8058\" data-end=\"8088\">CAVAT19 \u2013 TINH TH\u1ea6N L\u1ecaCH L\u00c3M<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"8090\" data-end=\"8130\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb s\u1ef1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8132\" data-end=\"8215\">Ch\u00fang \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"8145\" data-end=\"8214\">c\u00e1ch m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf cho ch\u00ednh m\u00ecnh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"8217\" data-end=\"8399\">CAVAT19 v\u1edbi n\u1ec1n navy s\u00e2u v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc tinh t\u1ebf mang \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u \u2014 t\u1eeb ph\u00f2ng h\u1ecdp, nh\u1eefng cu\u1ed9c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"8401\" data-end=\"8483\"><strong data-start=\"8401\" data-end=\"8483\">CAVAT19 \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk cho phong th\u00e1i l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices