Nam cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"480\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"480\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"1589\">. <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"501\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI18 SENLACVIET<br data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"522\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"593\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"630\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"644\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"656\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"676\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"717\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"754\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"768\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"784\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"803\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"816\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa sen v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0110\u00f4ng S\u01a1n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"891\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"905\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Lam t\u00edm \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 H\u1ed3ng sen \u2013 Ng\u00e0 kem \u2013 Xanh lam<br data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"963\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"978\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"996\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1013\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1050\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1065\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1194\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1209\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1396\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1508\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1523\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1565\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1567\" data-end=\"1584\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h1>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In K\u1ef9 Thu\u1eadt S\u1ed1 Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t 65x65cm \u2013 Printed Silk Scarf<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"749\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t thu\u1ed9c BST Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Kh\u0103n vu\u00f4ng th\u1eddi trang 65x65cm \u2013 printed silk scarf thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ya7i36\" data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1062\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t \u2013 Vietnamese Lotus Printed Silk Scarf<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1268\"><strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1111\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong> l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt thu\u1ed9c <strong data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1177\">BST Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong>, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a l\u00e2u \u0111\u1eddi c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1437\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1358\">c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i (digital printing)<\/strong> tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1390\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1609\">The design combines elegant lotus flowers with a soft blue background, creating a refined <strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1551\">printed silk scarf<\/strong> that reflects both traditional beauty and modern fashion.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1719\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1641\">k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 65x65cm<\/strong>, l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1667\">silk square scarf<\/strong> linh ho\u1ea1t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-7\" cla