 d\u1ee5ng theo nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1978\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vhsbs5\" data-start=\"1832\" data-end=\"1868\">\n<p data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1868\">Th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 thanh l\u1ecbch c\u00f9ng \u00e1o s\u01a1 mi<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16f8h3t\" data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1906\">\n<p data-start=\"1871\" data-end=\"1906\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1904\">\u00e1o d\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mcdvz2\" data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1944\">\n<p data-start=\"1909\" data-end=\"1944\">Trang tr\u00ed <strong data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1942\">t\u00fai x\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"k0729o\" data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1978\">\n<p data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1978\">L\u00e0m <strong data-start=\"1951\" data-end=\"1978\">head scarf \/ hair scarf<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2109\">The lightweight silk fabric drapes beautifully, making it a versatile <strong data-start=\"2050\" data-end=\"2072\">fashion silk scarf<\/strong> for daily wear or special occasions.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"93std9\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2158\">M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p \u2013 Luxury Silk Gift<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2312\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, <strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2226\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong> c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2272\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng<\/strong> d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2396\">A <strong data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2342\">luxury silk scarf gift<\/strong> is always a graceful choice for meaningful occasions.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2398\" data-end=\"2421\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2559\">\n<li data-section-id=\"134eko5\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2453\">\n<p data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2453\"><strong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2440\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"um65r6\" data-start=\"2454\" data-end=\"2488\">\n<p data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2488\"><strong data-start=\"2456\" data-end=\"2475\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef<\/strong> sang tr\u1ecdng<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1spgyix\" data-start=\"2489\" data-end=\"2521\">\n<p data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2521\"><strong data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2511\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong> tinh t\u1ebf<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11hf23r\" data-start=\"2522\" data-end=\"2559\">\n<p data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2559\"><strong data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2559\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sinh nh\u1eadt ho\u1eb7c k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2681\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t trong <strong data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2631\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean trang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"18wofqc\" data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3022\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u2013 Care Instructions<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3118\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1n97ein\" data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3054\">\n<p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3054\">Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1nnzl\" data-start=\"3055\" data-end=\"3073\">\n<p data-start=\"3057\" data-end=\"3073\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lj3yil\" data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3097\">\n<p data-start=\"3076\" data-end=\"3097\">Ph\u01a1i n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hcn611\" data-start=\"3098\" data-end=\"3118\">\n<p data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3118\">\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\" data-section-id=\"v4eqtp\" data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"197\">C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"383\">SenSilk l\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u chuy\u00ean <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"256\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"346\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong> l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"3125\" data-end=\"3166\">\ud83d\udcde <strong data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3140\">Hotline:<\/strong> 0976722736 \u2013 0963545166<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3258\">\ud83c\udfe0 <strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3190\">Showroom H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i: <\/strong>B15-08A, Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, M\u1ef9 \u0110\u00ecnh, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3358\">\ud83c\udfe0 <strong data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3287\">Showroom H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh: <\/strong>20\/1A1 Nguy\u1ec5n Thi\u1ec7n Thu\u1eadt, ph\u01b0\u1eddng 14, qu\u1eadn B\u00ecnh Th\u1ea1nh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3395\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3374\">Website: <\/strong><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"3377\" data-en