","slug":"silksquarescarf","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silksquarescarf\/"}],"brands":[{"id":2869,"name":"Sen Silk","slug":"sen-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/thuong-hieu\/sen-silk\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"65x65cm","slug":"65x65cm"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam","slug":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam"}]},{"id":0,"name":"B\u1ed9 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"H\u1ed9p, t\u00fai, thi\u1ec7p","slug":"H\u1ed9p, t\u00fai, thi\u1ec7p"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 68 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"300","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"8"},"formatted_weight":"300 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 8 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Sen L\u1ea1c Vi\u1ec7t &#8211; SenSilk | Printed Silk Scarf&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=19904","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/19904","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=19904&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":19879,"name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen 180\u00d765cm | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-an-hong-sen","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-an-hong-sen\/","sku":"KLDI07 ANHONGSEN","short_description":"<p><strong>Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thu\u1ed9c <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong>, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen h\u1ed3ng. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong>c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng. V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, form kh\u0103n d\u00e0i mang \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, thanh l\u1ecbch khi qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI07 ANHONGSEN<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"378\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ho\u1ea1 Mi\u00ean<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> h\u1ed3ng sen, kem<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2>An H\u1ed3ng Sen \u2013 V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng t\u1eeb hoa sen<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ghi nh\u1edb.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa sen \u2013 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 cao qu\u00fd trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n th\u1ec3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng <strong>c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c thanh tho\u00e1t c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Gam <strong>h\u1ed3ng sen k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc kem nh\u1eb9<\/strong> mang \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u trang nh\u00e3, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<\/p>\n<p class=\"\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i: <strong>\u0111\u01b0a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ee5a mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf t\u1eeb BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong> l\u00e0 b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o t\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u1ec1 hoa sen \u2013 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Trong b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp, <strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> mang m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc th\u00e1i ri\u00eang: nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 thanh tao.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen h\u1ed3ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng n\u1ec1n m\u00e0u kem gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 cho trang ph\u1ee5c m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng d\u00e0i t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 cho ph\u00e9p bi\u1ebfn h\u00f3a nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5<\/strong> t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Cho\u00e0ng vai<\/strong> ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/strong> gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean tinh t\u1ebf h\u01a1n.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Kho\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 khi \u0111i ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c du l\u1ecbch<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 v\u1eeba ti\u1ec7n d\u1ee5ng v\u1eeba gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c phong c\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-8\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19874#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/23.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19874\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19874\">\n\t\t\t\tAn H\u1ed3ng Sen\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19872#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Sen-Suong-Mai-200x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19872\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19872\">\n\t\t\t\tSen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19871#main\"><img width=\"215\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Nguyet-Ha-Sen-215x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19871\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19871\">\n\t\t\t\tNguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19870#main\"><img width=\"206\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-SenSilk-Sen-Lam-Chieu-206x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19870\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19870\">\n\t\t\t\tSen Lam Chi\u1ec1u\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19873#main\"><img width=\"168\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Silk-Printed-Scarf-SenSilk-168x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19873\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19873\">\n\t\t\t\tS\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19865#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc SenSilk k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180x62cm\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-8-19865\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-8-19865\">\n\t\t\t\tTh\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2>L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a <strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a <strong>l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 <strong>in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in gi\u00fap th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen v\u1edbi m\u00e0u s\u1eafc r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c cho thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1edf n\u00ean sinh \u0111\u1ed9ng theo t\u1eebng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 gi\u1eefa <strong>ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n v\u1eeba gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u1eeba d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<h2>M\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">An H\u1ed3ng Sen ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nh\u1edd b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen thanh tho\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Thanh l\u1ecbch:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>N\u1eef t\u00ednh:<\/strong> Cho\u00e0ng h\u1edd tr\u00ean vai c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c v\u00e1y.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng:<\/strong> K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Trang tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 ho\u1eb7c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n duy nh\u1ea5t. N\u00f3 ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n phong c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h1>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p t\u1eeb SenSilk<\/h1>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nh\u01b0ng khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, n\u00f3 c\u00f2n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh <strong>m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch g\u1eedi g\u1eafm t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m v\u00e0 l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng sen thanh tao, <strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/strong> trong sinh nh\u1eadt, ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau<\/strong> v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef<\/strong> trang nh\u00e3, l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong> mang t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong> nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">SenSilk c\u00f3 <strong>b\u1ed9 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, gi\u00fap ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m t\u1eeb l\u00fac nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ebfn kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc m\u1edf h\u1ed9p.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn, SenSilk h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng nhu c\u1ea7u.<\/p>\n<h2>V\u00ec sao An H\u1ed3ng Sen l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf?<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">B\u1edfi hoa sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Hoa sen c\u00f2n g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn <strong>s\u1ef1 thanh khi\u1ebft, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9<\/strong> \u2013 nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb khi\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh n\u00e0y lu\u00f4n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">An H\u1ed3ng Sen \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, v\u1eeba mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a ph\u00eda sau \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng <strong>v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a c\u1ee7a m\u00f3n qu\u00e0<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a, SenSilk khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t gi\u1eb7t d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9 d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t ho\u1eb7c v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng g\u1eaft.<\/li>\n<li>Khi \u1ee7i, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean \u1ee7i m\u1eb7t tr\u00e1i.<\/li>\n<li>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 v\u1eadt s\u1eafc nh\u1ecdn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>FAQ<\/h2>\n<h3>Kh\u0103n An H\u1ed3ng Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">An H\u1ed3ng Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u00ean <strong>n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h3>Kh\u0103n An H\u1ed3ng Sen c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, thu\u1ed9c ki\u1ec3u kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng d\u00e0i, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai v\u00e0 linh ho\u1ea1t v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o ki\u1ec3u.<\/p>\n<h3>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong>c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>, gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng, chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3>An H\u1ed3ng Sen thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">An H\u1ed3ng Sen thu\u1ed9c <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong>, b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa sen.<\/p>\n<h3>Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong> v\u00e0 gam m\u00e0u h\u1ed3ng sen \u2013 kem nh\u1eb9 gi\u00fap kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u \u00e1o d\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3>Kh\u0103n An H\u1ed3ng Sen c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn thanh l\u1ecbch cho <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, s\u1ebfp n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3>SenSilk c\u00f3 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. SenSilk c\u00f3 <strong>b\u1ed9 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nhu c\u1ea7u t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h3>L\u00e0m th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t gi\u1eb7t d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp. Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<h2>L\u1eddi nh\u1eafn t\u1eeb SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">T\u1eeb h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen quen thu\u1ed9c, SenSilk k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n m\u1edbi tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a \u2013 nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng h\u01a1n, \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i h\u01a1n nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong> kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong>l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n kho\u00e1c l\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec1u mang theo m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat thanh tao.<\/p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>SenSilk \u2013 \u0110\u1eb9p t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a, s\u00e2u c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n t\u1eeb t\u01a1.<\/strong><\/p><\/blockquote>\n<p data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2315\">","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1880000","regular_price":"2300000","sale_price":"1880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.300.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.300.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.880.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins