dividually":false,"weight":"300","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"8"},"formatted_weight":"300 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 8 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen 180\u00d765cm | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=19879","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/19879","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=19879&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":19864,"name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Hoa Sen Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc 180x65cm \u2013 SenSilk","slug":"khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc\/","sku":"KLDI08 THAILIENNGOC","short_description":"<h2 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\"><strong style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\" data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"724\">Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D hoa sen Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc<\/strong><span style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\"> thu\u1ed9c <\/span><strong style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"763\">BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong><span style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\">, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 thanh cao trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1072\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"959\">\u0111\u00f3a sen tr\u1eafng tinh kh\u00f4i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u00e1 sen xanh ng\u1ecdc<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1020\">c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong> gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc s\u00e2u v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI08 THAILIENNGOC<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"378\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ho\u1ea1 Mi\u00ean<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> xanh ng\u1ecdc, v\u00e0ng, lam<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h1 data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"874\">Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc 180x65cm<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"874\"><strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"724\">Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D hoa sen Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc<\/strong> thu\u1ed9c <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"763\">BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong>, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 thanh cao trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"1072\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"959\">\u0111\u00f3a sen tr\u1eafng tinh kh\u00f4i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u00e1 sen xanh ng\u1ecdc<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"980\" data-end=\"1020\">c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong> gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc s\u00e2u v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1261\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1106\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9, m\u00e1t v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i khi ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o. Khi cho\u00e0ng l\u00ean vai, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-9\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19870#main\"><img width=\"206\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-SenSilk-Sen-Lam-Chieu-206x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19870\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19870\">\n\t\t\t\tSen Lam Chi\u1ec1u\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19874#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/23.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19874\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19874\">\n\t\t\t\tAn H\u1ed3ng Sen\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19872#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Sen-Suong-Mai-200x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19872\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19872\">\n\t\t\t\tSen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19871#main\"><img width=\"215\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Nguyet-Ha-Sen-215x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19871\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19871\">\n\t\t\t\tNguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19865#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc SenSilk k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180x62cm\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19865\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19865\">\n\t\t\t\tTh\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19873#main\"><img width=\"168\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Silk-Printed-Scarf-SenSilk-168x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-9-19873\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text gallery-caption\" id=\"gallery-9-19873\">\n\t\t\t\tS\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"m08qtb\" data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"885\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt t\u1eeb BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"1010\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp <strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"914\">Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o t\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng hoa sen \u2013 lo\u00e0i hoa t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 cao qu\u00fd.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1166\">M\u1eabu <strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1034\">Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc<\/strong> mang phong c\u00e1ch nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf v\u1edbi gam m\u00e0u xanh ng\u1ecdc thanh l\u1ecbch, d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1252\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 <strong data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1202\">k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 x 65 cm<\/strong>, form d\u00e0i m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u cho\u00e0ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<li data-section-id=\"kfbrl0\" data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1278\">Cho\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 thanh l\u1ecbch<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18d6b4t\" data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1305\">\n<p data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1305\">Cho\u00e0ng vai khi d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"hpbggp\" data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1339\">\n<p data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1339\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ytv3k8\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1381\">\n<p data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1381\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi v\u00e1y ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cfh33d\" data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"298\">M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"300\" data-end=\"463\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang thanh l\u1ecbch, <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"376\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc SenSilk<\/strong> c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"423\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a<\/strong> d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"677\">V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"501\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i<\/strong>, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf <strong data-start=\"512\" data-end=\"534\">hoa sen ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong> c\u00f9ng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p trang nh\u00e3, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"870\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1u54dpx\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"730\">\n<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"730\"><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"696\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/strong> trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5 ho\u1eb7c sinh nh\u1eadt<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fumcxv\" data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"779\">\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"779\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"752\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mcr65w\" data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"825\">\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"802\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong> trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rbwk9c\" data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"870\">\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"870\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"870\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m ho\u1eb7c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"1011\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t trong <strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"946\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng h\u01a1n khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ybg8fm\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2505\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2543\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef kh\u0103n lu\u00f4n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2659\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1n97ein\" data-start=\"2545\" data-end=\"2575\">\n<p data-start=\"2547\" data-end=\"2575\">Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1nnzl\" data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2594\">\n<p data-start=\"2578\" data-end=\"2594\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"k5onr7\" data-start=\"2595\" data-end=\"2638\">\n<p data-start=\"2597\" data-end=\"2638\">Ph\u01a1i n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng g\u1eaft<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hcn611\" data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2659\">\n<p data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2659\">\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1865\">C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1824\" data-end=\"1865\">\ud83d\udcde <strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1839\">Hotline:<\/strong> 0976722736 \u2013 0963545166<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1959\">\ud83c\udfe0 <strong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1891\">Chi nh\u00e1nh H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i: <\/strong>B15-08A, Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, M\u1ef9 \u0110\u00ecnh, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2061\">\ud83c\udfe0 <strong data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1990\">Chi nh\u00e1nh H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh: <\/strong>20\/1A1 Nguy\u1ec5n Thi\u1ec7n Thu\u1eadt, ph\u01b0\u1eddng 14, qu\u1eadn B\u00ecnh Th\u1ea1nh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2101\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong data-start=\"2066\" data-end=\"2078\">Website:<\/strong><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2099\">https:\/\/sensilk.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2816\" data-end=\"2900\">#SenSilk #Kh\u0103nL\u1ee5aV\u1ebdTay #Qu\u00e0T\u1eb7ngCaoC\u1ea5p #Kh\u0103nL\u1ee5aC\u00e1Nh\u00e2nH\u00f3a #Kh\u0103nT\u1eb7ngS\u1ebfp #Kh\u0103nT\u1eb7ng\u0110\u1ed1iT\u00e1c<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1880000","regular_price":"2250000","sale_price":"1880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.250.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.880.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.880.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":19865,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc 180x62cm SenSilk","alt":"Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc SenSilk k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180x62cm"},{"id":19869,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/khan-lua-to-tam-hoa-sen-thai-lien-ngoc.jpg","thumbnail"