g":"sen-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/thuong-hieu\/sen-silk\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 76 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","formatted_dimensions":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Boho Sen \u2013 SenSilk | Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p In 3D&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=17570","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/17570","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=17570&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":17559,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p In 3D Vi\u1ec7t Nam Trong T\u00f4i \u2013 SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-cao-cap-in-3d-viet-nam-oi","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-cao-cap-in-3d-viet-nam-oi\/","sku":"KLVI16 VIETNAMOI","short_description":"<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p in 3D Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u01a0i \u2013 SenSilk. M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tinh t\u1ebf, g\u00f3i tr\u1ecdn h\u1ed3n Vi\u1ec7t trong t\u1eebng s\u1ee3i l\u1ee5a. Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sang tr\u1ecdng, \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"480\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"480\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"1616\">. <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"501\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI16 VIETNAMTRONGTOI<br data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"527\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"598\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"635\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"649\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"661\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"681\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"705\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"722\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"759\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"773\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"789\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"808\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"821\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Danh lam th\u1eafng c\u1ea3nh, v\u0103n h\u00f3a, \u1ea9m th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"929\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> \u0110a s\u1eafc \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1 \u2013 Xanh lam \u2013 \u0110\u1ecf \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u2013 Cam \u2013 Tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0<br data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"990\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1005\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1023\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1040\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1077\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1092\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1236\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1408\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1423\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1550\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1592\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1611\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"962\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111i c\u00f9ng n\u0103m th\u00e1ng, kh\u1eafc s\u00e2u trong tr\u00e1i tim m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi con \u0111\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t: t\u00e0 \u00e1o d\u00e0i th\u01b0\u1edbt tha, ru\u1ed9ng b\u1eadc thang Sapa xanh m\u01b0\u1edbt, v\u1ecbnh H\u1ea1 Long h\u00f9ng v\u0129, ph\u1ed1 c\u1ed5 H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i b\u00ecnh d\u1ecb\u2026 T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh k\u00fd \u1ee9c, ni\u1ec1m t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o, v\u00e0 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk t\u1ea1o n\u00ean <strong data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"959\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p In 3D \u201cVi\u1ec7t Nam \u01a0i\u201d<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1231\">\ud83c\udf38 Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1004\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng qua c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i. M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t, m\u1ed7i s\u1eafc m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ec1u t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n ch\u00e2n th\u1ef1c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, nh\u01b0 \u0111\u01b0a b\u1ea1n tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 v\u1edbi ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ed9i qua t\u1eebng s\u1ee3i t\u01a1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1407\">\u2728 \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a.<br data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1274\" \/>\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1309\">l\u1eddi nh\u1eafc nh\u1edb v\u1ec1 qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/strong>, l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1335\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n<\/strong>, l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1404\">t\u00ecnh y\u00eau \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc g\u00f3i tr\u1ecdn trong ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-11\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17566#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"272\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-viet-nam-oi-sensilk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17562#main\"><img width=\"218\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/e500c74ca271292f7060115_result.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1446\"><strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1444\">\u0110i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<li data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1496\">\n<p data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1496\">\ud83d\udcd0 K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 65x65cm \u2013 v\u1eeba v\u1eb7n, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1578\">\n<p data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1578\">\ud83e\uddf5 Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m th\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u1ea1ng, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u00e1t nh\u1eb9, n\u00e2ng niu l\u00e0n da.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1636\">\n<p data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1636\">\ud83c\udfa8 C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7: In 3D k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, m\u00e0u b\u1ec1n l\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<p data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1690\">\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u: SenSilk \u2013 L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Thu\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1725\"><strong data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1723\">\u00dd ngh\u0129a &amp; Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1972\">\n<li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1792\">\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1792\"><strong data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1749\">Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n cao c\u1ea5p:<\/strong> \u0110i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch cho m\u1ecdi phong c\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1882\">\n<p data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1882\"><strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1819\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sang tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> Thay l\u1eddi tri \u00e2n g\u1eedi \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1972\">\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1972\"><strong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1907\">Th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o:<\/strong> Kho\u00e1c chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u201cVi\u1ec7t Nam \u01a0i\u201d l\u00e0 kho\u00e1c c\u1ea3 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2025\"><strong data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2023\">\u0110\u1eb7t mua ngay \u2013 S\u1edf h\u1eefu tinh hoa Vi\u1ec7t:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2126\">\ud83d\udc49 H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u1edf trong tim, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n tr\u00ean t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc ch\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2307\">\ud83c\udf81 <strong data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2151\">\u01afu \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p k\u00e8m theo cho m\u1ecdi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<br data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2197\" \/>\ud83d\ude9a <strong data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2223\">Giao h\u00e0ng to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c<\/strong>, nhanh 24h t\u1ea1i H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i &amp; TP.HCM.<br data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2258\" \/>\ud83d\udcb3 Thanh to\u00e1n linh ho\u1ea1t: COD ho\u1eb7c chuy\u1ec3n kho\u1ea3n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2350\"><strong data-start=\"2318\" data-end=\"2348\">Th\u00f4ng tin li\u0