g","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/17559","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=17559&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":17515,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen \u2013 Best Seller | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-nang-tho-sen","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-nang-tho-sen\/","sku":"KLVI18 NANGTHOSEN","short_description":"<h4 data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"396\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"206\">N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen \u2013 b\u1ea3n t\u00ecnh ca c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"440\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng 65x65cm <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"105\">N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen<\/strong> thu\u1ed9c BST <strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"136\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<\/strong>, in 3D tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen, thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t trong t\u00e0 \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 n\u00f3n l\u00e1, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1nh b\u01b0\u1edbm c\u00f9ng s\u1eafc xanh ng\u1ecdc, h\u1ed3ng sen v\u00e0 v\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"377\">Vietnamese Heritage<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"467\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"467\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"1584\">. <strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"488\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI18 NANGTHOSEN<br data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"509\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"580\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"617\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"631\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"643\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"663\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"687\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"704\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"741\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"771\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"790\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"803\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa sen, thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 n\u00f3n l\u00e1 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"897\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Xanh ng\u1ecdc \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1 \u2013 H\u1ed3ng sen \u2013 Tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim<br data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"973\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"991\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1008\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1045\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1060\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1189\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1204\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1376\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1391\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1503\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1518\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1560\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1562\" data-end=\"1579\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h1 data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1093\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen \u2013 SenSilk (65x65cm)<\/h1>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D tinh x\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1093\">T\u1eeb s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh y\u00eau<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1323\">\u1ede SenSilk, m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n. \u201cN\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen\u201d ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 l\u1eddi k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng, thanh tao c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef Vi\u1ec7t. N\u00f3 g\u1ee3i nh\u1edb \u0111\u1ebfn \u00e1nh m\u1eaft bi\u1ebft n\u00f3i, n\u1ee5 c\u01b0\u1eddi e \u1ea5p, v\u00e0 c\u1ea3 nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc b\u00ecnh y\u00ean b\u00ean t\u00e1ch tr\u00e0 bu\u1ed5i s\u1edbm.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1558\">Kh\u00f4ng d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i \u1edf th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1397\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a. M\u1ed7i h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 bao g\u1ed3m kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y handmade v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p, mang tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eedi trao cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 hay \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1604\">SenSilk \u2013 n\u01a1i gi\u1eef g\u00ecn h\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1605\" data-end=\"1865\">T\u1ef1 h\u00e0o v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1648\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/strong>, SenSilk cam k\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng. Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 b\u00e1n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a, SenSilk c\u00f2n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm trong \u0111\u00f3 ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u1edbi v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t \u2013 n\u01a1i hoa sen ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o l\u1ee5a, v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u00e1i tim.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-12\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17522#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-ky-thuat-so-sen-silk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17516#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/100-silk-printed-scarf-200x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17520#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/khan-lua-thoi-trang-in-3d-Sen-Silk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1104\">\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<li data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1200\">\n<p data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1200\"><strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1121\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c cao c\u1ea5p, m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0 th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1308\">\n<p data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1308\"><strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1218\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65x65cm, d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea5u nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch (qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, c\u1ed9t t\u00f3c, l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n t\u00fai x\u00e1ch\u2026).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1405\">\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1405\"><strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1325\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7:<\/strong> In 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, m\u00e0u in nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u, b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p, kh\u00f4ng phai m\u00e0u sau nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n gi\u1eb7t.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1563\">\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1563\"><strong data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1421\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> Full box sang tr\u1ecdng g\u1ed3m kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p t\u1eb7ng k\u00e8m \u2013 th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m <strong data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1520\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1663\">\n<p data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1663\"><strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1582\">Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u:<\/strong> SenSilk \u2013 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd S\u1edf h\u1eefu Tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1690\"><strong data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1678\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1731\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1787\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef g\u00ecn \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng \u1ea3 v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"2001\">\n<li data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1837\">\n<p data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1837\">Gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh, tr\u00e1nh ng\u00e2m qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1838\" data-end=\"1903\">\n<p data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1903\">D\u00f9ng v\u00e0i gi\u1ecdt d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh pha lo\u00e3ng \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eb7t.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1960\">\n<p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1960\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft xo\u1eafn, ch\u1ec9 gi\u0169 nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 ph\u01a1i n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1961\" data-end=\"2001\">\n<p data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"2001\">\u1ee6i khi kh\u0103n c\u00f2n \u1ea9m \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"216\">\ud83c\udf38 <strong data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"211\">S\u1edf h\u1eefu ngay B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau \u2013 SenSilk<\/strong> \ud83c\udf38<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"550\">\u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf l\u1ee1 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i mang v\u1ec1 cho m\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u01a1ng nh\u1eefng m\u1eabu <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"337\">kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c in 3D cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> trong b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a SenSilk.<br data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"380\" \/>V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh t\u1ebf, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u0103n h\u00f3a, m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, x\u1ee9ng \u0111\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn cho b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n hay trao g\u1eedi y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2420\">Th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean h\u1ec7 \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1933\">\ud83d\udccd <strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1931\">C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"2223\">\n<li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1983\">\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1983\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1953\">Hotline\/Zalo:<\/strong> 0976 722 736 \u2013 0963 545 166<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1984\" data-end=\"2025\">\n<p data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2025\"><strong data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"1996\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\">duyquang.sensilk@gmail.com<\/a><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2083\">\n<p data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2083\"><strong data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2040\">Website:<\/strong> <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2081\">https:\/\/sensilk.vn<\/a><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2084\" data-end=\"2157\">\n<p data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2157\"><strong data-start=\"2086\" data-end=\"2106\">Showroom H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i:<\/strong> B15-08A, Vinhomes Gardenia, Violet 3, P. T\u1eeb Li\u00eam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2223\">\n<p data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2223\"><strong data-start=\"2160\" data-end=\"2180\">Showroom TP.HCM:<\/strong> 20\/1A1 Nguy\u1ec5n Thi\u1ec7n Thu\u1eadt, P. B\u00ecnh Th\u1ea1nh<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2225\" data-end=\"2376\">\ud83d\udc49 H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"2235\" data-end=\"2274\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng N\u00e0ng Th\u01a1 Sen SenSilk<\/strong> tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u201cn\u1ed1t nh\u1ea1c\u201d trong b\u1ea3n giao h\u01b0\u1edfng th\u1eddi trang c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u2013 d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng, l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm ch\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"pri