{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"upsells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=16572,13114"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=16674&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":16572,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a \u2013 In K\u1ef9 Thu\u1eadt S\u1ed1 Hoa Sen 3D | SenSilk","slug":"sac-lien-xua-khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/sac-lien-xua-khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d\/","sku":"KLDI05 SACLIENXUA","short_description":"<p><strong data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"415\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n, c\u1ea3 tr\u1eddi k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<\/strong><br data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"418\" \/>\u201cS\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a\u201d l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1eb1m trong b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp <em data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"493\">Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/em> c\u1ee7a SenSilk \u2013 n\u01a1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p hoa sen h\u00f2a quy\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 h\u1ed3n x\u01b0a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p>Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tr\u1ea7m l\u1eafng. V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180\u00d765cm, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch, gi\u00e0u ch\u1ea5t th\u01a1 v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI05 SACLIENXUA<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"378\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ho\u1ea1 Mi\u00ean<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> v\u00e0ng &#8211; cam<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang:\u00a0Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 \u00b7 Cho\u00e0ng vai \u00b7 Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i \u00b7 V\u00e1y \u00b7 Trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"jigkpr\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2150\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a \u2013 M\u1ed9t \u00e1ng th\u01a1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2303\"><em data-start=\"2152\" data-end=\"2303\">T\u1ef1a nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u00e1ng th\u01a1 l\u1eb7ng l\u1ebd, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n g\u1ee3i l\u00ean h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh sen ng\u1ea3 b\u00f3ng b\u00ean h\u1ed3, b\u1ea3ng l\u1ea3ng kh\u00f3i lam chi\u1ec1u, g\u1ee3i nh\u1edb v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c \u0111\u00e3 xa.<\/em><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2368\"><strong data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2321\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> kh\u00f4ng k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 hoa sen b\u1eb1ng v\u1ebb r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2551\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc th\u00e1i tr\u1ea7m h\u01a1n \u2013 n\u01a1i hoa sen hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean gi\u1eefa kh\u00f4ng gian t\u0129nh l\u1eb7ng, g\u1ee3i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c th\u00e2n thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n qu\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t, c\u1ee7a m\u1eb7t h\u1ed3 y\u00ean \u1ea3 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i chi\u1ec1u ch\u1eadm r\u00e3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2584\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 b\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2639\">M\u1ed9t v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00e0ng nh\u00ecn l\u00e2u c\u00e0ng th\u1ea5y nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2814\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"2682\" data-end=\"2713\">c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>, \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh sen mang chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, thanh tho\u00e1t c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-16\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19230#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sac-lien-xua-in-ky-thuat-so-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19232#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sen-lam-chieu-in-ky-thuat-so-sensilk-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19218#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sen-suong-mai-in-ky-thuat-so.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% \u2013 BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean SenSilk\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19228#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-nguyet-ha-sen-in-ky-thuat-so-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"cf3nnc\" data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2872\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u2013 K\u00fd \u1ee9c c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t th\u1eddi thanh b\u00ecnh<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2983\">Kh\u00e1c v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa sen mang s\u1eafc th\u00e1i t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, <strong data-start=\"2931\" data-end=\"2947\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n v\u00e0 n\u1ec1n n\u00e3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2985\" data-end=\"3099\">Hoa sen kh\u00f4ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u00e0 mang v\u1ebb <strong data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3051\">t\u0129nh t\u1ea1i, tr\u1ea7m l\u1eafng<\/strong>, nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh b\u01b0\u1edbc ra t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng trang k\u00fd \u1ee9c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3191\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 m\u00e1i \u0111\u00ecnh, m\u1eb7t h\u1ed3, l\u00e0n kh\u00f3i lam chi\u1ec1u hay \u00e1nh nh\u00ecn c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi thi\u1ebfu n\u1eef b\u00ean ao sen.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3249\">Nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i theo c\u00e1ch tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3384\">Ch\u00fang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ee3i l\u00ean b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"3275\" data-end=\"3309\">m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c<\/strong> \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed7i ng\u01b0\u1eddi khi nh\u00ecn v\u00e0o c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c c\u1ee7a ri\u00eang m\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3386\" data-end=\"3455\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3431\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> trong BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-17\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20167#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-an-hong-sen-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu cho\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen h\u1ed3ng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20166#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/nguoi-mau-quang-khan-lua-sen-nha-lam.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu ph\u1ed1i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch sang tr\u1ecdng\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20390#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4742pz\" data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3507\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u2013 S\u1ee3i t\u01a1 mang h\u1ed3n \u0111\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3639\"><strong data-start=\"3509\" data-end=\"3525\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"3542\" data-end=\"3570\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3810\">Ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a <strong data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3672\">B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u m\u00e0 SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i \u2013 \u0111\u01b0a nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3812\" data-end=\"3996\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a \u1ea5y, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 <strong data-start=\"3839\" data-end=\"3860\">in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong> gi\u00fap t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 s\u1eafc n\u00e9t v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft cho m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4136\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4068\">ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong> \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ec3 theo m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef m\u1edbi.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"kgrfk3\" data-start=\"4143\" data-end=\"4182\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u2013 nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4278\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4211\">180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn h\u00f3a theo nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4364\"><strong data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4292\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5<\/strong><br data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4295\" \/>T\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng cho s\u01a1 mi, \u00e1o blouse ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4450\"><strong data-start=\"4366\" data-end=\"4380\">Cho\u00e0ng vai<\/strong><br data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4383\" \/>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m, v\u00e1y v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 ho\u1eb7c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4546\"><strong data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4467\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/strong><br data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4470\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4655\"><strong data-start=\"4548\" data-end=\"4575\">Ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/strong><br data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4578\" \/>M\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ee7 t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4758\"><strong data-start=\"4657\" data-end=\"4685\">Kho\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch<\/strong><br data-start=\"4685\" data-end=\"4688\" \/>V\u1eeba c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, v\u1eeba mang theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ofse8z\" data-start=\"4765\" data-end=\"4822\">\ud83c\udf81 S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a \u2013 M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang theo m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4861\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edb v\u00ec gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4900\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edb v\u00ec c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4936\"><strong data-start=\"4902\" data-end=\"4918\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3 hai.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"5094\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen c\u00f9ng c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 k\u00fd \u1ee9c Vi\u1ec7t khi\u1ebfn chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau <strong data-start=\"5054\" data-end=\"5093\">l\u1ee5a, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5096\" data-end=\"5108\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5491\">\n<li data-section-id=\"zoxpry\" data-start=\"5110\" data-end=\"5153\"><strong data-start=\"5112\" data-end=\"5127\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9<\/strong> trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"h37ab2\" data-start=\"5154\" data-end=\"5227\"><strong data-start=\"5156\" data-end=\"5190\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef th\u00e2n y\u00eau<\/strong> mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10kjhrf\" data-start=\"5228\" data-end=\"5271\"><strong data-start=\"5230\" data-end=\"5249\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng s\u1ebfp n\u1eef<\/strong> trang nh\u00e3, kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1escel0\" data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5332\"><strong data-start=\"5274\" data-end=\"5308\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong> th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxpix0\" data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5411\"><strong data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5360\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1exo7j2\" data-start=\"5412\" data-end=\"5491\"><strong data-start=\"5414\" data-end=\"5440\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong> mang theo h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"mh2mr7\" data-start=\"5493\" data-end=\"5516\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5518\" data-end=\"5568\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5701\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"5584\" data-end=\"5603\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a<\/strong> \u2013 n\u01a1i ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam g\u1eb7p nhau trong m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5703\" data-end=\"5855\">SenSilk ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5734\" data-end=\"5761\">b\u1ed9 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb ch\u1ec9n chu \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng ngay t\u1eeb kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc m\u1edf h\u1ed9p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5857\" data-end=\"5981\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p ho\u1eb7c s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn, SenSilk h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u00e1n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x3kfn7\" data-start=\"5988\" data-end=\"6021\">V\u00ec sao S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t?<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6097\"><strong data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6097\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a h\u00f4m nay.<br data-start=\"6055\" data-end=\"6058\" \/>M\u00e0 l\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p khi\u1ebfn ta nh\u1edb v\u1ec1 h\u00f4m qua.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6099\" data-end=\"6266\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u \u2013 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00f4ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ef1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u1ea5t th\u1eddi, m\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb <strong data-start=\"6236\" data-end=\"6265\">b\u1ec1n, \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6268\" data-end=\"6309\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kho\u00e1c l\u00ean vai.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6385\">Nh\u01b0ng \u0111i\u1ec1u \u1edf l\u1ea1i c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"6338\" data-end=\"6384\">m\u1ed9t c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c, m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ej44sv\" data-start=\"6392\" data-end=\"6422\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6424\" data-end=\"6488\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, SenSilk khuy\u1ebfn ngh\u1ecb:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6777\">\n<li data-section-id=\"14tunnx\" data-start=\"6490\" data-end=\"6524\">Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14sfwj0\" data-start=\"6525\" data-end=\"6566\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t gi\u1eb7t d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9 d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qgzioe\" data-start=\"6567\" data-end=\"6593\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1iujzgq\" data-start=\"6594\" data-end=\"6624\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t ho\u1eb7c v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xbjujo\" data-start=\"6625\" data-end=\"6666\">Tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng g\u1eaft.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mlzmjl\" data-start=\"6667\" data-end=\"6722\">Khi \u1ee7i, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean \u1ee7i m\u1eb7t tr\u00e1i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yetl6m\" data-start=\"6723\" data-end=\"6777\">B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 v\u1eadt s\u1eafc nh\u1ecdn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14qv2yp\" data-start=\"6784\" data-end=\"6810\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xc2z2v\" data-start=\"6812\" data-end=\"6854\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6856\" data-end=\"6947\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"6881\" data-end=\"6909\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kahr6j\" data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"6990\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6992\" data-end=\"7087\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7011\" data-end=\"7023\">180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, thu\u1ed9c ki\u1ec3u kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng d\u00e0i, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 v\u00e0 cho\u00e0ng vai.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mf6dn7\" data-start=\"7089\" data-end=\"7144\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7146\" data-end=\"7255\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"7182\" data-end=\"7213\">c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed9 r\u00f5 n\u00e9t v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lgqjq0\" data-start=\"7257\" data-end=\"7295\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7297\" data-end=\"7381\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c <strong data-start=\"7312\" data-end=\"7344\">BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/strong>, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa sen.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"f4k9qz\" data-start=\"7383\" data-end=\"7426\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7560\">Kh\u00f4ng. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"7455\" data-end=\"7480\">l\u1ee5a in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D<\/strong>. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7562\" data-end=\"7600\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7602\" data-end=\"7728\">C\u00f3. K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7617\" data-end=\"7629\">180\u00d765cm<\/strong> v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng hoa sen gi\u00fap S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u00e1o d\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xrlw9h\" data-start=\"7730\" data-end=\"7777\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7779\" data-end=\"7930\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau <strong data-start=\"7820\" data-end=\"7873\">l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t, hoa sen, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9pn6me\" data-start=\"7932\" data-end=\"7974\">SenSilk c\u00f3 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7976\" data-end=\"8112\">C\u00f3. SenSilk c\u00f3 <strong data-start=\"7991\" data-end=\"8018\">b\u1ed9 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 v\u1edbi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x326f4\" data-start=\"8119\" data-end=\"8141\">L\u1eddi nh\u1eafn t\u1eeb SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"8143\" data-end=\"8190\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u thu\u1ed9c v\u1ec1 k\u00fd \u1ee9c kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n g\u1ecdi t\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8192\" data-end=\"8289\">Ch\u1ec9 m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc sen, m\u1ed9t l\u00e0n kh\u00f3i chi\u1ec1u hay m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t h\u1ed3 y\u00ean \u1ea3 c\u0169ng \u0111\u1ee7 khi\u1ebfn ta nh\u1edb v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t mi\u1ec1n r\u1ea5t xa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8291\" data-end=\"8449\"><strong data-start=\"8291\" data-end=\"8307\">S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb ch\u00ednh c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u1ea5y \u2013 \u0111\u1ec3 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa sen, c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng mi\u1ec1n k\u00fd \u1ee9c x\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef trong m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"8451\" data-end=\"8500\">\n<p data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8500\"><strong data-start=\"8453\" data-end=\"8500\">SenSilk \u2013 \u0110\u1eb9p t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a, s\u00e2u c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n t\u1eeb t\u01a1.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1880000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"1880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.200.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.200.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.880.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.880.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":19587,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Silk-Printed-Scarf-SenSilk-1.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Silk-Printed-Scarf-SenSilk-1-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 718px) 100vw, 718px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p in SenSilk S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a","alt":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p in SenSilk S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a"},{"id":17227,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/0b9fc50bdb365068092787_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/0b9fc50bdb365068092787_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 936px) 100vw, 936px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"0b9fc50bdb365068092787_result","alt":""},{"id":17229,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/44974800563ddd63842c94_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/44974800563ddd63842c94_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 868px) 100vw, 868px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"44974800563ddd63842c94_result","alt":""},{"id":16583,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e40a19d1502ad974803b27.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/e40a19d1502ad974803b27-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 998px) 100vw, 998px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"e40a19d1502ad974803b27","alt":""},{"id":16577,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2a552f85667eef20b66f26.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/2a552f85667eef20b66f26-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1008px) 100vw, 1008px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"2a552f85667eef20b66f26","alt":""},{"id":16575,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/40f47f2736dcbf82e6cd28.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/40f47f2736dcbf82e6cd28-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 994px) 100vw, 994px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"40f47f2736dcbf82e6cd28","alt":""},{"id":16671,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Pink-Fashion-New-Collection-Instagram-Post-3.png","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Pink-Fashion-New-Collection-Instagram-Post-3-247x296.png","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1215px) 100vw, 1215px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in hoa sen vi\u1ec7t nam","alt":""},{"id":16691,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Khan-lua-cao-cap-in-ky-thuat-so-Sen-Silk-4.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Khan-lua-cao-cap-in-ky-thuat-so-Sen-Silk-4-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 851px) 100vw, 851px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 Sen Silk (4)","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":2873,"name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D","slug":"khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-in\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d\/"},{"id":2120,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a in 3D","slug":"khan-lua-in","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-in\/"}],"tags":[{"id":703,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"khan-lua-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-cao-cap\/"},{"id":2740,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3d","slug":"khan-lua-in-3d","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-in-3d\/"},{"id":1792,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng","slug":"khan-lua-qua-tang","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-qua-tang\/"},{"id":2881,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-in-ky-thuat-so","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-ky-thuat-so\/"},{"id":2880,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m s\u1eafc li\u00ean x\u01b0a","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-sac-lien-xua","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-to-tam-sac-lien-xua\/"},{"id":564,"name":"Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"qua-tang-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-cao-cap\/"},{"id":566,"name":"qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c","slug":"qua-tang-doi-tac","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-doi-tac\/"},{"id":114,"name":"sensilk","slug":"sensilk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/sensilk\/"},{"id":2124,"name":"silk printed","slug":"silk-printed","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silk-printed\/"},{"id":919,"name":"Vietnam Silk","slug":"vietnam-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/vietnam-silk\/"}],"brands":[{"id":2869,"name":"Sen Silk","slug":"sen-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/thuong-hieu\/sen-silk\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"B\u1ed9 S\u01b0u T\u1eadp","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean","slug":"Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Size","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"180x60cm","slug":"180x60cm"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, Vi\u1ec7t Nam","slug":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, Vi\u1ec7t Nam"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 57 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"29","width":"15","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"29 \u00d7 15 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a \u2013 In K\u1ef9 Thu\u1eadt S\u1ed1 Hoa Sen 3D | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=16572","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/16572","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"cross_sells":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?include=14351"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=16572&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":16457,"name":"C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk \u2013 Phong C\u00e1ch Doanh Nh\u00e2n CAVAT17","slug":"ca-vat-cao-cap-phong-cach-doanh-nhan","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/ca-vat-cao-cap-phong-cach-doanh-nhan\/","sku":"CAVAT17","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"560\">CAVAT17 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"441\">n\u1ec1n xanh navy s\u00e2u<\/strong>, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t <strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"501\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc ch\u00ecm<\/strong> v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n nh\u1ecf s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb nam t\u00ednh, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"731\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u khi nh\u00ecn g\u1ea7n, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer trong m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"862\"><strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"778\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, CAVAT17 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng qu\u00fd \u00f4ng, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fv11\" data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"332\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"813\">\n<li data-section-id=\"16fzh0n\" data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"361\"><strong data-start=\"336\" data-end=\"353\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> CAVAT17<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"467\"><strong data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"433\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"491\"><strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"482\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yv4wss\" data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"521\"><strong data-start=\"494\" data-end=\"508\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0rv3x\" data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"550\"><strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"539\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 153 \u00d7 8 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ul1c8n\" data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"623\"><strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"566\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> V\u00e2n h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc d\u1ec7t ch\u00ecm tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n navy, \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u1ea5m s\u00e1ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"w43mpz\" data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"676\"><strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"641\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Business Luxury \u00b7 Modern Gentleman<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"43up0f\" data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"713\"><strong data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"691\">Ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3:<\/strong> S\u01a1 mi \u00b7 Suit \u00b7 Blazer<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12zywyl\" data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"748\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"729\">Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n:<\/strong> K\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivguta\" data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"788\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"764\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"813\"><strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"808\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"ho9jmo\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1363\">DESIGN IDENTITY \u2013 NAVY GEOMETRIC JACQUARD<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15yy5g6\" data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1406\">V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p \u0110\u1ebfn T\u1eeb Chi\u1ec1u S\u00e2u C\u1ee7a Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1457\">CAVAT17 kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft l\u1edbn.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1601\">\u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u1eb1m \u1edf <strong data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1541\">b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t Jacquard v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t ch\u00ecm<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1724\">Nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea5m s\u00e1ng nh\u1ecf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n navy, v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb \u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1825\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ki\u1ec3u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng y\u00eau th\u00edch nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft <strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1824\">tinh t\u1ebf nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 ch\u1ee7 \u00fd<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1887\"><strong data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1887\">N\u1ec1n navy s\u00e2u.<br data-start=\"1842\" data-end=\"1845\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf.<br data-start=\"1863\" data-end=\"1866\" \/>Phong th\u00e1i r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1muyjmm\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1936\"><\/h2>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1muyjmm\" data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1936\">BUSINESS LUXURY \u2013 PHONG C\u00c1CH DOANH NH\u00c2N<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"2028\">CAVAT17 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2027\">ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 t\u1ef1 tin trong giao ti\u1ebfp<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2163\">N\u1ec1n navy gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u00f2a v\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c nam gi\u1edbi, trong khi b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t Jacquard t\u1ea1o th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2285\">Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft qu\u00e1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, CAVAT17 v\u1eabn t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n nh\u1edd s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2284\">m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac d\u1ec7t<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2299\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2461\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1oulc5m\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2321\">Trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15lb692\" data-start=\"2322\" data-end=\"2341\">G\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"20mlq5\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2370\">L\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c v\u00e0 g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wy9w72\" data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2394\">H\u1ed9i h\u1ecdp, thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8xknki\" data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2417\">S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1oecydm\" data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2461\">Nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, ch\u1ec9n chu<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nyau43\" data-start=\"2468\" data-end=\"2501\">PH\u1ed0I C\u00d9NG S\u01a0 MI, SUIT &amp; BLAZER<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"g0k4zr\" data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2544\">CAVAT17 \u2013 D\u1ec5 Ph\u1ed1i Trong T\u1ee7 \u0110\u1ed3 Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2619\"><strong data-start=\"2546\" data-end=\"2561\">S\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng<\/strong><br data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2564\" \/>L\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt s\u1eafc navy v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 s\u1ea1ch s\u1ebd, nam t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2707\"><strong data-start=\"2621\" data-end=\"2640\">S\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t<\/strong><br data-start=\"2640\" data-end=\"2643\" \/>Mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2764\"><strong data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2722\">Suit navy<\/strong><br data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2725\" \/>T\u1ea1o di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7u, s\u00e2u v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2826\"><strong data-start=\"2766\" data-end=\"2778\">Suit x\u00e1m<\/strong><br data-start=\"2778\" data-end=\"2781\" \/>Gi\u00fap s\u1eafc navy tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n r\u00f5 n\u00e9t h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2900\"><strong data-start=\"2828\" data-end=\"2838\">Blazer<\/strong><br data-start=\"2838\" data-end=\"2841\" \/>Mang \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn linh ho\u1ea1t cho phong c\u00e1ch business casual.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2eymt\" data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2942\">K\u1eb8P C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T \u2013 CHI TI\u1ebeT HO\u00c0N THI\u1ec6N<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2944\" data-end=\"3050\">CAVAT17 \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"2959\" data-end=\"2981\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, gi\u00fap gi\u1eef c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3052\" data-end=\"3170\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi v\u00e0 suit, chi\u1ebfc k\u1eb9p tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf nh\u01b0ng g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3224\"><strong data-start=\"3172\" data-end=\"3224\">M\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 cho phong c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a qu\u00fd \u00f4ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"181cs47\" data-start=\"3231\" data-end=\"3246\">L\u1ee4A JACQUARD<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1kodw4n\" data-start=\"3248\" data-end=\"3292\">Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u T\u1ea1o N\u00ean Chi\u1ec1u S\u00e2u Cho Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3294\" data-end=\"3396\">CAVAT17 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3326\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>, trong \u0111\u00f3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb ch\u00ednh c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac d\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3513\">Nh\u1edd v\u1eady, c\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc kh\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t l\u1edbp h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1eb7t l\u00ean tr\u00ean m\u00e0 h\u00f2a v\u00e0o t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3515\" data-end=\"3651\">Khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t Jacquard t\u1ea1o ra nh\u1eefng s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 kh\u00e1c nhau, gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n khi quan s\u00e1t \u1edf kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch g\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3653\" data-end=\"3736\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m l\u00e0m n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a CAVAT17: <strong data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3736\">tinh t\u1ebf thay v\u00ec ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"16rubci\" data-start=\"3743\" data-end=\"3779\">QU\u00c0 T\u1eb6NG CAO C\u1ea4P D\u00c0NH CHO QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"zhs83u\" data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3830\">M\u1ed9t L\u1ef1a Ch\u1ecdn C\u00f3 Gu Cho Ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0110\u00e0n \u00d4ng Hi\u1ec7n \u0110\u1ea1i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3983\">C\u00e0 v\u1ea1t l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng cao nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 trang tr\u1ecdng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c trong m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng kinh doanh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3985\" data-end=\"4103\">CAVAT17 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4055\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dfz0we\" data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4127\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4219\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywpege\" data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4145\"><strong data-start=\"4131\" data-end=\"4145\">Doanh nh\u00e2n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6yh2qe\" data-start=\"4146\" data-end=\"4159\"><strong data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4159\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mw78sg\" data-start=\"4160\" data-end=\"4176\"><strong data-start=\"4162\" data-end=\"4176\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1furtpy\" data-start=\"4177\" data-end=\"4190\"><strong data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4190\">S\u1ebfp nam<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"44b5h4\" data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4219\"><strong data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4219\">Qu\u00fd \u00f4ng trong gia \u0111\u00ecnh<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4221\" data-end=\"4311\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"4242\" data-end=\"4310\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4422\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 h\u1eefu d\u1ee5ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG V\u00c0 B\u1ea2O QU\u1ea2N<\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><strong><b>C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/b><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u1eaft c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i, ph\u1ea7n b\u1ea3n l\u1edbn k\u1ebft th\u00fac quanh v\u1ecb tr\u00ed th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng\u00a0<strong><b>k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t<\/b><\/strong>\u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn khi c\u1ea7n.<\/li>\n<li>N\u1edbi l\u1ecfng n\u00fat th\u1eaft sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, tr\u00e1nh k\u00e9o m\u1ea1nh l\u00e0m bi\u1ebfn d\u1ea1ng phom.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400\"><strong><b>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/b><\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u00e1o v\u00e0\u00a0<strong><b>treo ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n nh\u1eb9<\/b><\/strong>c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac l\u00e2u v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m cao, n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa ho\u1eb7c h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, v\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Khi c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch, n\u00ean\u00a0<strong><b>gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/b><\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p khi ch\u01b0a s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf b\u1ee5i v\u00e0 gi\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lu\u00f4n ch\u1ec9n chu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4422\"><strong><b>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/b><\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">\u00a0Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 \u00fd d\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0n \u1ee7i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1n37gd8\" data-start=\"4429\" data-end=\"4453\">\u0110I\u1ec2M NH\u1ea4N C\u1ee6A CAVAT17<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4455\" data-end=\"4511\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4484\">Navy Geometric Jacquard<\/strong> \u2013 b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc d\u1ec7t ch\u00ecm<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4568\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4515\" data-end=\"4536\">N\u1ec1n xanh navy s\u00e2u<\/strong> \u2013 nam t\u00ednh, \u0111i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4570\" data-end=\"4621\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4598\">\u0110i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea5m s\u00e1ng tinh t\u1ebf<\/strong> \u2013 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4623\" data-end=\"4679\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4656\">Phong c\u00e1ch Modern Gentleman<\/strong> \u2013 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9n chu<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4681\" data-end=\"4734\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4683\" data-end=\"4702\">Business Luxury<\/strong> \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4736\" data-end=\"4771\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4771\">D\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4801\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4775\" data-end=\"4801\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4832\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4832\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1v8jy0o\" data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4863\">C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T CAO C\u1ea4P SENSILK<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ar7hxa\" data-start=\"4865\" data-end=\"4914\">Phong Th\u00e1i \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c T\u1ea1o N\u00ean T\u1eeb Nh\u1eefng Chi Ti\u1ebft Nh\u1ecf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4916\" data-end=\"5073\">C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i \u2014 n\u01a1i m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5106\">CAVAT17 \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho tinh th\u1ea7n:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5153\"><strong data-start=\"5108\" data-end=\"5153\">\u0110i\u1ec1m \u0111\u1ea1m.<br data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5122\" \/>Nam t\u00ednh.<br data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5134\" \/>Tinh t\u1ebf.<br data-start=\"5142\" data-end=\"5145\" \/>C\u00f3 gu.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5206\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n qu\u00e1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1nv2rfj\" data-start=\"5213\" data-end=\"5239\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00c2U H\u1eceI TH\u01af\u1edcNG G\u1eb6P<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w4q3me\" data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5280\">CAVAT17 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5393\">CAVAT17 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5302\" data-end=\"5339\">Business Luxury, Modern Gentleman<\/strong> v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nam l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2r6zcn\" data-start=\"5395\" data-end=\"5422\">CAVAT17 c\u00f3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5424\" data-end=\"5527\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"5441\" data-end=\"5480\">v\u00e2n h\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc d\u1ec7t ch\u00ecm tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n navy<\/strong>, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ea5m s\u00e1ng nh\u1ecf t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"pj2azv\" data-start=\"5529\" data-end=\"5565\">CAVAT17 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5567\" data-end=\"5648\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"5584\" data-end=\"5647\">s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, s\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t, suit navy, suit x\u00e1m v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5d7ukl\" data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5692\">CAVAT17 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5694\" data-end=\"5818\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5755\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00fd \u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t2c73w\" data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5856\">CAVAT17 c\u00f3 k\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5858\" data-end=\"5901\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5900\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"kta8cd\" data-start=\"5903\" data-end=\"5941\">CAVAT17 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5943\" data-end=\"6039\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5968\" data-end=\"5995\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1efawjy\" data-start=\"6041\" data-end=\"6074\">CAVAT17 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6076\" data-end=\"6109\">CAVAT17 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"6092\" data-end=\"6108\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"eicjw6\" data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6166\">CAVAT17 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6168\" data-end=\"6282\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf trang nh\u00e3 c\u00f9ng h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n \u0111i k\u00e8m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6281\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1km8nfn\" data-start=\"6289\" data-end=\"6322\">CAVAT17 \u2013 PHONG C\u00c1CH DOANH NH\u00c2N<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6324\" data-end=\"6391\">Kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00fac n\u00e0o s\u1ef1 l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m c\u0169ng c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6393\" data-end=\"6482\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"6408\" data-end=\"6481\">m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n navy s\u00e2u, m\u1ed9t c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac d\u1ec7t tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3 v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6484\" data-end=\"6632\">CAVAT17 mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i ch\u1ec9n chu cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i \u2014 t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1i v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed9c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c hay nh\u1eefng s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6706\"><strong data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6706\">CAVAT17 \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk cho phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"850000","regular_price":"1000000","sale_price":"850000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.000.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.000.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 850.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":16779,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Cao-Cap-Sen-Silk-5-e1769796952448.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Cao-Cap-Sen-Silk-5-e1769796952448-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 873px) 100vw, 873px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p Sen Silk (5)","alt":""},{"id":16781,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Nam-Cao-Cap-SenSilk-6.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Nam-Cao-Cap-SenSilk-6-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 860px","thumbnail_srcs