a-vat-nam-cao-cap","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/dau-an-quy-ong-ca-vat-nam-cao-cap\/","sku":"CAVAT16","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"517\">CAVAT16 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"435\">n\u1ec1n xanh navy c\u00f9ng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed tinh t\u1ebf<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o nam t\u00ednh, ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"669\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"565\">s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong>, t\u1eeb m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o l\u1ecbch l\u00e3m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"810\"><strong data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"716\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, CAVAT16 l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"809\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, s\u1ebfp nam v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1fv11\" data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"148\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"613\">\n<li data-section-id=\"16fzh0m\" data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"177\"><strong data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"169\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> CAVAT16<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"283\"><strong data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"249\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"307\"><strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"298\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yv4wss\" data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"337\"><strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"324\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1o0rv3x\" data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"366\"><strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"355\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 153 \u00d7 8 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gzaspd\" data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"382\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf:<\/strong> H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft d\u1ec7t tinh t\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n xanh navy<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l17jy4\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"476\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"440\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Business Luxury \u00b7 Classic Gentleman<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"43up0f\" data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"513\"><strong data-start=\"479\" data-end=\"491\">Ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3:<\/strong> S\u01a1 mi \u00b7 Suit \u00b7 Blazer<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12zywyl\" data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"548\"><strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"529\">Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n:<\/strong> K\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ivguta\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"588\"><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"564\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"613\"><strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"608\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1r5k5nn\" data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1287\">THI\u1ebeT K\u1ebe \u2013 D\u1ea4U \u1ea4N C\u1ee6A QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1427\">CAVAT16 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn <strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1323\">n\u1ec1n xanh navy<\/strong> l\u00e0m m\u00e0u ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa s\u1ef1 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1550\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 l\u1edbn, gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb ch\u1ec9n chu khi nh\u00ecn t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n khi quan s\u00e1t g\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1678\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ki\u1ec3u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e0n \u00f4ng y\u00eau th\u00edch <strong data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1642\">s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gu<\/strong>, thay v\u00ec nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1727\"><strong data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1727\">M\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n phong th\u00e1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-18\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16792#main\"><img width=\"216\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Top-Ca-Vat-Viet-Nam-7.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16775#main\"><img width=\"230\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/f1522451-cb9e-4d35-a3a3-a84fb6997b3f.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16788#main\"><img width=\"218\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Cao-Cap-Sen-Silk-6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1pxq05n\" data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1758\">PHONG C\u00c1CH BUSINESS LUXURY<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1879\">CAVAT16 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1807\">qu\u00fd \u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng kinh doanh v\u00e0 giao ti\u1ebfp chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1985\">N\u1ec1n navy d\u1ec5 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng cho trang ph\u1ee5c, trong khi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean \u0111\u01a1n \u0111i\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2016\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2143\">\n<li data-section-id=\"105v0d6\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2027\">C\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15lb692\" data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2047\">G\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1459xjl\" data-start=\"2048\" data-end=\"2064\">G\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wy9w72\" data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2088\">H\u1ed9i h\u1ecdp, thuy\u1ebft tr\u00ecnh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8xknki\" data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2111\">S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jinxh0\" data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2143\">Ti\u1ec7c v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trang tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10ghur7\" data-start=\"2145\" data-end=\"2181\">D\u1ec4 PH\u1ed0I C\u00d9NG S\u01a0 MI, SUIT &amp; BLAZER<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2246\"><strong data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2199\">S\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng:<\/strong> t\u1ea1o t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 s\u1ea1ch s\u1ebd, nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2299\"><strong data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2268\">S\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t:<\/strong> mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2350\"><strong data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2315\">Suit navy:<\/strong> t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u0111i\u1ec7u v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2415\"><strong data-start=\"2352\" data-end=\"2365\">Suit x\u00e1m:<\/strong> gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n r\u00f5 n\u00e9t h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2502\"><strong data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2428\">Blazer:<\/strong> ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch business casual v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 th\u00e2n m\u1eadt h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k2eymt\" data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2539\">K\u1eb8P C\u00c0 V\u1ea0T \u2013 CHI TI\u1ebeT HO\u00c0N THI\u1ec6N<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2541\" data-end=\"2647\">CAVAT16 \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"2556\" data-end=\"2578\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, gi\u00fap c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o th\u00eam \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2765\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t v\u00e0 k\u1eb9p mang \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 g\u1ecdn g\u00e0ng, ch\u1ec9n chu h\u01a1n \u2014 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch doanh nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ow1f72\" data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2786\">QU\u00c0 T\u1eb6NG QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u5j2\" data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2846\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2976\">C\u00e0 v\u1ea1t l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh cho nam gi\u1edbi, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, suit ho\u1eb7c blazer.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"3098\">CAVAT16 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3040\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, v\u00ec v\u1eady c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng ngay trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"dfz0we\" data-start=\"3100\" data-end=\"3122\">Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3238\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywpege\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3140\"><strong data-start=\"3126\" data-end=\"3140\">Doanh nh\u00e2n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6yh2qe\" data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3154\"><strong data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3154\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1furtpy\" data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3168\"><strong data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3168\">S\u1ebfp nam<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16b7nre\" data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3192\"><strong data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3192\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1roa4v\" data-start=\"3193\" data-end=\"3213\"><strong data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3213\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong><\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qseam\" data-start=\"3214\" data-end=\"3238\"><strong data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3238\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3240\" data-end=\"3330\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3329\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2><b>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG V\u00c0 B\u1ea2O QU\u1ea2N<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><b>C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u1eaft c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i, ph\u1ea7n b\u1ea3n l\u1edbn k\u1ebft th\u00fac quanh v\u1ecb tr\u00ed th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <b>k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t<\/b> \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ngay ng\u1eafn khi c\u1ea7n.<\/li>\n<li>N\u1edbi l\u1ecfng n\u00fat th\u1eaft sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, tr\u00e1nh k\u00e9o m\u1ea1nh l\u00e0m bi\u1ebfn d\u1ea1ng phom.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Th\u00e1o v\u00e0 <b>treo ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n nh\u1eb9<\/b> c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac l\u00e2u v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111\u1ed9 \u1ea9m cao, n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa ho\u1eb7c h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, v\u1eaft ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 x\u00e1t m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Khi c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m s\u1ea1ch, n\u00ean <b>gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4 theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/b>.<\/li>\n<li>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p khi ch\u01b0a s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf b\u1ee5i v\u00e0 gi\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lu\u00f4n ch\u1ec9n chu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/b> Kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 \u00fd d\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao ho\u1eb7c b\u00e0n \u1ee7i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1x1e0ih\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3352\">\u0110I\u1ec2M NH\u1ea4N CAVAT16<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3354\" data-end=\"3395\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3373\">N\u1ec1n xanh navy<\/strong> \u2013 nam t\u00ednh v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3397\" data-end=\"3446\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3423\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf tinh t\u1ebf<\/strong> \u2013 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3503\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3482\">Phong c\u00e1ch Classic Gentleman<\/strong> \u2013 ch\u1ec9n chu, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3505\" data-end=\"3561\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3507\" data-end=\"3526\">Business Luxury<\/strong> \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3563\" data-end=\"3598\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3598\">D\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i s\u01a1 mi, suit v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3628\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3628\">K\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3630\" data-end=\"3659\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3659\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3661\" data-end=\"3697\">\u2726 <strong data-start=\"3663\" data-end=\"3697\">Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng qu\u00fd \u00f4ng<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2tixng\" data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3726\">FAQ \u2013 C\u00c2U H\u1eceI TH\u01af\u1edcNG G\u1eb6P<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"klboqk\" data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3750\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 m\u00e0u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3811\">CAVAT16 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"3768\" data-end=\"3785\">n\u1ec1n xanh navy<\/strong> v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"prti6o\" data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3852\">CAVAT16 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3935\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"3871\" data-end=\"3934\">s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, s\u01a1 mi xanh nh\u1ea1t, suit navy, suit x\u00e1m v\u00e0 blazer<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"yv1qec\" data-start=\"3937\" data-end=\"3979\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3981\" data-end=\"4112\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4042\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, s\u1ebfp nam v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5c7frx\" data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4150\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 k\u00e8m k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4195\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111i k\u00e8m <strong data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4194\">k\u1eb9p c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1xfz21o\" data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4235\">CAVAT16 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4237\" data-end=\"4333\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4289\">h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"m53pd6\" data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4371\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4373\" data-end=\"4410\">CAVAT16 c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"4395\" data-end=\"4409\">153 \u00d7 8 cm<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"94pwjz\" data-start=\"4412\" data-end=\"4445\">CAVAT16 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4480\">CAVAT16 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4479\">l\u1ee5a Jacquard<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1j60fbf\" data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4509\">CAVAT16 \u2013 D\u1ea4U \u1ea4N QU\u00dd \u00d4NG<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4567\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t thi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i th\u1eadt n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4569\" data-end=\"4668\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, <strong data-start=\"4578\" data-end=\"4640\">m\u1ed9t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc \u0111\u00fang, m\u1ed9t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i tinh t\u1ebf<\/strong> \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ee7 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4670\" data-end=\"4808\">CAVAT16 mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u1ea5y \u2014 <strong data-start=\"4698\" data-end=\"4735\">nam t\u00ednh, ch\u1ec9n chu v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng<\/strong>, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00fd \u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4854\"><strong data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4854\">D\u1ea5u \u1ea4n Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk.<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"850000","regular_price":"960000","sale_price":"850000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">960.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 960.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 850.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":16788,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Cao-Cap-Sen-Silk-6.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Ca-Vat-Cao-Cap-Sen-Silk-6-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 932px) 100vw, 932px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Cao C\u1ea5p Sen Silk (6)","alt":""},{"id":16790,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Top-Ca-Vat-Viet-Nam-3.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Top-Ca-Vat-Viet-Nam-3-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 948px) 100vw, 948px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Top C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Vi\u1ec7t Nam (3)","alt":""},{"id":16792,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Top-Ca-Vat-Viet-Nam-7.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Top-Ca-Vat-Viet-Nam-7-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 920px) 100vw, 920px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Top C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Vi\u1ec7t Nam (7)","alt":""},{"id":16454,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/e33f83a3-0ace-44bf-a486-b9420e0818d7.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/e33f83a3-0ace-44bf-a486-b9420e0818d7.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1062px) 100vw, 1062px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"e33f83a3-0ace-44bf-a486-b9420e0818d7","alt":""},{"id":16448,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/d970621c-30af-4947-bd21-f9fbb6794fa5.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/d970621c-30af-4947-bd21-f9fbb6794fa5-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","siz