is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 58 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","formatted_dimensions":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;D\u1ea5u \u1ea4n Qu\u00fd \u00d4ng \u2013 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t Nam Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk CAVAT16&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=16441","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/16441","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=16441&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":16223,"name":"Kh\u0103n In Cao C\u1ea5p 100% L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m C\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng | SenSilk","slug":"khan-in-cao-cap-100-lua-to-tam-cuc-vang-de-vuong","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-in-cao-cap-100-lua-to-tam-cuc-vang-de-vuong\/","sku":"KLVI15 CUC VANG","short_description":"<p>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf <strong>\u201cC\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng\u201d<\/strong>, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh x\u1ea3o m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ef1ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a phong th\u1ee7y t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho quy\u1ec1n l\u1ef1c, ph\u00fa qu\u00fd v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/p>\n<p>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng d\u00e0nh cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng cao c\u1ea5p, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u00edch c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p mang \u0111\u1eadm n\u00e9t v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"448\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"448\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"1535\">. <strong data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"469\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI15 CUCVANGDEVUONG<br data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"494\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"496\" data-end=\"565\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"602\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"616\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"628\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"648\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"672\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"689\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"726\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"756\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"775\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"788\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"836\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"850\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> V\u00e0ng kim \u2013 V\u00e0ng c\u00fac \u2013 Xanh ng\u1ecdc \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1 \u0111\u1eadm \u2013 Ng\u00e0 kem<br data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"909\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"924\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"942\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"959\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"996\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1011\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1140\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1155\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1342\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1454\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1469\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1511\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1530\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","description":"<h3><strong>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In Cao C\u1ea5p SenSilk &#8211; Bi\u1ec3u T\u01b0\u1ee3ng C\u1ee7a S\u1ef1 Sang Tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 Tinh T\u1ebf<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Kh\u0103n in cao c\u1ea5p 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u1ee7a SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3><strong>T\u1ea1i Sao N\u00ean Ch\u1ecdn Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In 100% T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m SenSilk?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m T\u1ef1 Nhi\u00ean 100%<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong>l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u01b0u.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf \u0110\u1ed9c \u0110\u00e1o \u201cC\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng\u201d<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u00fac v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c in b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn, gi\u00fap gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00e0u s\u1eafc r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 v\u00e0 s\u1eafc n\u00e9t. M\u1ed7i chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u0103m ch\u00fat k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u00dd Ngh\u0129a Phong Th\u1ee7y<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng bi\u1ec3u tr\u01b0ng cho <strong>s\u1ef1 tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1ecd, gi\u00e0u sang v\u00e0 th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0o c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m hay tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m Th\u1ee7 C\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>SenSilk t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ef1ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau m\u1ebfn v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Vi\u1ec7t ra th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3><strong>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In Cao C\u1ea5p &#8211; M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 Tuy\u1ec7t V\u1eddi Cho M\u1ecdi D\u1ecbp<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a <strong>\u201cC\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng\u201d<\/strong> l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p Cao C\u1ea5p:<\/strong> T\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Ng\u01b0\u1eddi Th\u00e2n Y\u00eau:<\/strong> T\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi b\u1ea1n.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ph\u1ee5 Ki\u1ec7n Th\u1eddi Trang \u0110\u1ed9c \u0110\u00e1o:<\/strong> T\u00f4n l\u00ean phong c\u00e1ch qu\u00fd ph\u00e1i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-19\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16234#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/84320bca66abddf584ba43-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16228#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/46ebb1bddbdc608239cd3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16236#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/fbfa04066967d2398b7640-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u1eabn B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In 100% T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, ph\u01a1i kh\u0103n n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li>L\u00e0 kh\u0103n \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p v\u1edbi m\u1eb7t tr\u00e1i c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>Mua Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In Cao C\u1ea5p \u1ede \u0110\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>SenSilk t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o l\u00e0 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m <strong>\u201cC\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng\u201d<\/strong> hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 m\u1eb7t t\u1ea1i showroom v\u00e0 tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i.<\/p>\n<p>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p n\u00e0y!<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Website:<\/strong> <a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\">Sensilk.vn<\/a><\/li>\n<li><strong>Hotline:<\/strong> 0963545166<\/li>\n<li><strong>Showroom:<\/strong> B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, C\u1ea7u Di\u1ec5n, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>T\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh trong b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li>Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng phong th\u1ee7y<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 th\u1eddi trang<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao c\u1ea5p, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh x\u1ea3o v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a phong th\u1ee7y s\u00e2u s\u1eafc, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in cao c\u1ea5p <strong>\u201cC\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ebf V\u01b0\u01a1ng\u201d<\/strong> t\u1eeb SenSilk l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ai t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1260000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.260.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.260.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.100.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\