":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-in-3d-rose-gold\/","sku":"KLVI12 HOAHONG","short_description":"<blockquote><p>B\u1ea1n \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, \u0111\u1eadm ch\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t Nam? B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D c\u1ee7a SenSilk l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc.<\/p><\/blockquote>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"430\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"430\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"1518\">. <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"451\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI12 HOAHONG<br data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"469\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"471\" data-end=\"540\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"577\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"591\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"623\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"664\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"684\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"701\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"715\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"731\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"750\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"763\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"812\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"826\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> V\u00e0ng champagne \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 Xanh ng\u1ecdc \u2013 Xanh \u0111en \u2013 Ng\u00e0 kem<br data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"892\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"907\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"925\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"942\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"979\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"994\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1138\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1310\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1325\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1452\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1494\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1513\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h3><strong>1. \u0110i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D Rose Gold KLVI12<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>: H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft <strong>Rose Gold<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c in 3D s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, tinh t\u1ebf, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng, gi\u00fap t\u00f4n l\u00ean phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong>: Mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng khi ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi an to\u00e0n cho l\u00e0n da nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m.<\/li>\n<li><strong>C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in l\u1ee5a ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn<\/strong>: T\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t tr\u00ean kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt in l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u0110a d\u1ee5ng, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3<\/strong>: D\u00f9 l\u00e0 kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u1ed9t t\u00f3c hay l\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho t\u00fai x\u00e1ch, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1eabn lu\u00f4n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-20\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16217#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-5.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16219#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-6-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16213#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<hr \/>\n<h3><strong>2. Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D Rose Gold KLVI12 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong>m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 t\u00e2m h\u1ed3n Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong>. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong>: Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Gia \u0111\u00ecnh, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8<\/strong>: T\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n y\u00eau trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 sinh nh\u1eadt, 8\/3, 20\/10.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Du kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>: Mang \u0111\u1eadm tinh hoa th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u01b0u ni\u1ec7m tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h3><strong>3. V\u00ec sao ch\u1ecdn SenSilk?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u uy t\u00edn<\/strong>: SenSilk cam k\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p, gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i sang tr\u1ecdng<\/strong>: M\u1ed7i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t trong h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<li><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a<\/strong>: In logo, l\u1eddi ch\u00fac ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u00eam ph\u1ea7n \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h3><strong>4. H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a lu\u00f4n \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0 m\u1edbi, b\u1ea1n h\u00e3y l\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh ho\u1eb7c ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi.<\/li>\n<li>L\u00e0 \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng kh\u0103n l\u00f3t b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D Rose Gold KLVI12 t\u1eeb SenSilk l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho nh\u1eefng ai \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba sang tr\u1ecdng, v\u1eeba mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/p>\n<p><strong>\u0110\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng ngay h\u00f4m nay<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu si\u00eau ph\u1ea9m kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p n\u00e0y!<\/p>\n<p><em>SenSilk &#8211; V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean.<\/em><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1250000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.250.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.100.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.100.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":16211,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-2.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-2-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in SenSilk Rose Gold (2)","alt":""},{"id":16217,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-5.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-SenSilk-Rose-Gold-5-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in SenSilk Rose Gold (5)","alt":""},{"id":16209,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-co