gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-21\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16198#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/silk-printed-sensilk-gift-3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16196#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/silk-printed-sensilk-gift-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h4><strong>\u0110i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>:\n<ul>\n<li>\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong>100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong>, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a KLVI11 mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0 nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 ph\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mai v\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o<\/strong>:\n<ul>\n<li>H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong>hoa mai v\u00e0ng<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c in s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 may m\u1eafn, ph\u00fa qu\u00fd v\u00e0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0\u01a1i m\u1edbi.<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong d\u1ecbp T\u1ebft c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh t\u1ebf, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>:\n<ul>\n<li>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng linh ho\u1ea1t: l\u00e0m kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, kh\u0103n c\u00e0i t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u00ed t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang, t\u1eeb thanh l\u1ecbch, c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h4><strong>T\u1ea1i sao Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a SenSilk KLVI11 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u00dd ngh\u0129a v\u0103n h\u00f3a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc<\/strong>: Mai v\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 sum h\u1ecdp, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n v\u00e0 th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp t\u1eb7ng qu\u00e0<\/strong>: T\u1eeb qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft, qu\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m.<\/li>\n<li><strong>S\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a<\/strong>: M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ec1u mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h4><strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef kh\u0103n lu\u00f4n b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li>Tr\u00e1nh v\u00f2 m\u1ea1nh, kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e1y gi\u1eb7t.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u01a1i kh\u0103n n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li>\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u1ea3i l\u00f3t \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><strong>Mua ngay Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a SenSilk KLVI11<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in <strong>100% Natural Silk Printed Scarf &#8211; Vietnamese Gift with Mai V\u00e0ng Design &#8211; SenSilk KLVI11<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong t\u1ee7 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Website: <a href=\"#\" rel=\"noopener\">www.sensilk.vn<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Hotline: 0976722736<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: B15-08A, Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/li>\n<\/ul>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1280000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.280.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.280.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.100.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.100.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":16204,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/up