c7n v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p><\/blockquote>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"374\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"352\" data-end=\"374\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"1459\">. <strong data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"395\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI10 HOADAO<br data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"412\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"483\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"520\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"534\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"546\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"566\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"590\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"607\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"627\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"644\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"674\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"693\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"706\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 s\u1eafc m\u00e0u T\u1ebft Vi\u1ec7t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"769\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"783\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ecf son \u2013 V\u00e0ng kim \u2013 H\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 Tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 \u2013 \u0110en<br data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"833\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"848\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"866\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"868\" data-end=\"883\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"920\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"935\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1064\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1079\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1266\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1378\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1393\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1435\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1454\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1eddi Trang Tinh T\u1ebf V\u00e0 \u0110\u1eb3ng C\u1ea5p<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang Nh\u00e0 Sen in Hoa \u0110\u00e0o<\/strong> l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt in \u1ea5n \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam cao c\u1ea5p. V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc vu\u00f4ng 65x65cm, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang cho c\u00e1c qu\u00fd c\u00f4. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng<\/strong> d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf thanh l\u1ecbch \u0111\u1ebfn phong c\u00e1ch d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-22\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16165#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-sensilk-6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16169#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"249\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-sensilk-10.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16167#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/khan-lua-cao-cap-in-sensilk-8.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Phi\u00ean B\u1ea3n Gi\u1edbi H\u1ea1n &#8211; Gi\u00e1 Tr\u1ecb T\u1eeb Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf \u0110\u1ed9c \u0110\u00e1o<\/h3>\n<p>\u0110i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Nh\u00e0 Sen in Hoa \u0110\u00e0o<\/strong> ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 <strong>phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n<\/strong>. M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang. V\u1edbi ho\u1ea1 ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n v\u00e0 t\u00e0i l\u1ed9c, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf, may m\u1eafn cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111eo.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p \u0110\u1eb3ng C\u1ea5p &#8211; 100% L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h3>\n<p>V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh x\u1ea3o, <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Nh\u00e0 Sen<\/strong> in Hoa \u0110\u00e0o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng. C\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0y nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0y t\u1ecf s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, v\u1eeba mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">V\u00ec Sao Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u1eddi Trang Nh\u00e0 Sen L\u00e0 L\u1ef1a Ch\u1ecdn H\u00e0ng \u0110\u1ea7u?<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p:<\/strong> \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111em l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Nh\u00e0 Sen l\u00e0 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft in Hoa \u0110\u00e0o tinh x\u1ea3o, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111eo n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li><strong>M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in Hoa \u0110\u00e0o l\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u00fd ngh\u0129a, mang \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7n c\u1ea3m t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udecd<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\"><strong>\u00a0https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\n<strong>\u260e\ufe0f(+84) 976722736 \u2013 963545166<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>\ud83d\udecd B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><\/p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img class=\"wp-image-15565 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" \/><\/figure>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1300000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"curren