s":{"length":"29","width":"15","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"29 \u00d7 15 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D 100% T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Sen M\u00f9a V\u00e0ng \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Th\u1ee7 C\u00f4ng&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=16134","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/16134","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=16134&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":15715,"name":"Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p &#8211; Set Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau | SenSilk","slug":"qua-tang-khan-tay-lua-theu-sensilk-mon-qua-tinh-te-cho-phai-dep-2","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/qua-tang-khan-tay-lua-theu-sensilk-mon-qua-tinh-te-cho-phai-dep-2\/","sku":"SET KHANTAYDOI","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"246\">Kh\u0103n tay SenSilk 35\u00d735cm t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n th\u00eau tay hoa c\u00fac h\u1ecda mi tinh t\u1ebf. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nh\u1ecf g\u1ecdn, thanh l\u1ecbch, mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t c\u00f9ng n\u00e9t tr\u1ebb trung v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"246\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh x\u1ea3o, v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc trong m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u00eau s\u1ebd l\u00e0m h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ai nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n&#8230;<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c1f7kl\" data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"269\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"1216\">. <strong data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"289\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> SET KHANTAYDOI<br data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"382\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"419\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"433\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"445\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"465\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Set Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng L\u1ee5a<br data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"486\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"503\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 35 \u00d7 35 cm<br data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"517\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"533\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"552\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"567\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> \u0111a d\u1ea1ng theo \u1ea3nh<br data-start=\"582\" data-end=\"585\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"608\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc kh\u0103n n\u1ec1n:<\/strong> Tr\u1eafng &#8211; Xanh Navy<br data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"617\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"632\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> Th\u00eau tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tinh x\u1ea3o<br data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"662\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"679\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Vietnamese Heritage tr\u1ebb trung, ti\u1ec7n d\u1ee5ng<br data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"738\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, kh\u0103n b\u1ecf t\u00fai, lau th\u1ea5m m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"856\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"871\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> \u00dd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1024\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1039\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1151\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1166\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> <strong>Set 2 kh\u0103n\/H\u1ed9p<\/strong>, T\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1190\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1209\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tinh x\u1ea3o, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p, n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau tay t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm ch\u1ea5t truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<h3>T\u1ea1i Sao Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau SenSilk L\u00e0 M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 L\u00fd T\u01b0\u1edfng Cho Ph\u00e1i \u0110\u1eb9p?<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p:<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n cao, gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m lu\u00f4n gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1edbi v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf qua th\u1eddi gian.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o:<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau c\u1ee7a SenSilk \u0111\u1ec1u l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau tay \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1edfi nh\u1eefng ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n l\u00e0nh ngh\u1ec1, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng kim m\u0169i ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o. C\u00e1c hoa v\u0103n tr\u00ean kh\u0103n th\u01b0\u1eddng mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a phong th\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch v\u00e0 s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u1ee7a ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u0110a d\u1ea1ng m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 m\u1eabu m\u00e3:<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau SenSilk c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng t\u00f4ng m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng s\u1eafc m\u00e0u n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, b\u1ea1n g\u00e1i, ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li><strong>M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a:<\/strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, Ng\u00e0y c\u1ee7a M\u1eb9, hay l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div id=\"gallery-27\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15767#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/0af94893ae4e0e10575f47-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15769#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/0bf98d466c9bccc5958a60-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15771#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/0d5887fb6626c6789f3777-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15773#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/0e476f2d8ef02eae77e167-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15775#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/0fbadede3803985dc11258-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15777#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/03f0de9a38479819c15642-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15779#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/6ff4d8913e4c9e12c75d50-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15781#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/8ca72318c2c5629b3bd474-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15783#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/1954963f70e2d0bc89f356-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3>C\u00e1ch B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau \u0110\u1ec3 Gi\u1eef \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0110\u1ed9 B\u1ec1n V\u00e0 \u0110\u1eb9p<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef cho kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a lu\u00f4n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb x\u00f9 l\u00f4ng, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh v\u1edbi x\u00e0 ph\u00f2ng d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9. Tr\u00e1nh v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m h\u1ecfng s\u1ee3i l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ph\u01a1i n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t:<\/strong> Tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00ec nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t m\u00e0u v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a s\u1ee3i l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u1ee6i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p:<\/strong> N\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n \u1ee7i, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng b\u00e0n \u1ee7i h\u01a1i n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u1ee7i t\u1eeb m\u1eb7t trong c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau lu\u00f4n s\u00e1ng b\u00f3ng.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau SenSilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o khi b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh cho ph\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh x\u1ea3o, v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc trong m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u00eau s\u1ebd l\u00e0m h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 ai nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m t\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef quan tr\u1ecdng trong cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi b\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/ba32889c-1609-4b51-a36b-d6c563ab753f.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-15716 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/ba32889c-1609-4b51-a36b-d6c563ab753f-1024x726.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"402\" height=\"285\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h3><strong>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN \u0110\u1eb6T H\u00c0NG<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4><strong>C\u00c1CH 1:<\/strong>\u00a0B\u1ea1n zalo ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nhanh nh\u1ea5t: 0976722736<\/h4>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<h4><strong>C\u00c1CH 2:<\/strong>\u00a0vui l\u00f2ng l\u00e0m theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u1ea1<\/h4>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o \u201cADD TO CART\u201d, sau \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0o \u201cCART\u201d nh\u1eadp s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng Set qu\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1eb7t. <strong>L\u01afU \u00dd: 1 set\/2 chi\u1ebfc (xanh+tr\u1eafng)<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Ti\u1ebfp theo t\u1ea1i \u00f4 \u201cTH\u00d4NG TIN TH\u00caM\u201d B\u1ea1n ghi ch\u00fa M\u00c3 KH\u0102N + S\u1ed0 L\u01af\u1ee2NG mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1eb7t. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: 1-1 (M\u1eabu 1, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng 1 set)<\/li>\n<li><strong>L\u01afU \u00dd: C\u1ed9t t\u00f3c nh\u00e0 Sen l\u00e0m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n, n\u00ean s\u1ebd giao ng\u1eabu nhi\u00ean \u1ea1!<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n, \u201c\u0110\u1eb6T H\u00c0NG\u201d<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd giao t\u1edbi Qu\u00fd Kh\u00e1ch trong th\u1eddi gian 2-5 ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 MI\u1ec4N PH\u00cd ship.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T 