-end=\"492\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n<br data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"516\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"533\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 55 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"563\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"582\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"596\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ecf \u0110\u00f4<br data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"630\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat t\u1ed1t, gi\u1eef m\u00e0u \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"741\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"855\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, n\u01a1 t\u00fai, th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 tay trang tr\u00ed, n\u01a1 c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng, cho\u00e0ng vai\u2026<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"948\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1102\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1214\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1229\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">Th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Trong v\u00f2ng 3-5 ng\u00e0y sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n.<br data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1463\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h4><strong>Tinh Hoa Th\u1eddi Trang T\u1eeb Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u Cao C\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk 55x55cm<\/strong> l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong t\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed3 c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau th\u00edch s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf. V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc vu\u00f4ng l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft d\u1ec7t t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n n\u00e0y mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h4><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt C\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/strong>: \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100%, kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng SenSilk c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o<\/strong>: V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc vu\u00f4ng 55x55cm, kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng bi\u1ebfn h\u00f3a trong nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, b\u0103ng \u0111\u00f4, \u0111\u1ebfn ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li><strong>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft d\u1ec7t tinh x\u1ea3o<\/strong>: H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t c\u00f4ng phu, mang l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n r\u00f5 gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-28\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15581#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Vuong-Det-Hoa-Hong-SenSilk-8-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15573#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Vuong-Det-Hoa-Hong-SenSilk-1-1-scaled-225x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15567#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Vuong-Det-Hoa-Hong-SenSilk-6-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h4><strong>Ph\u1ee5 Ki\u1ec7n Th\u1eddi Trang \u0110ang L\u00e0m M\u01b0a L\u00e0m Gi\u00f3<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk 55x55cm<\/strong> kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng xu h\u01b0\u1edbng &#8220;hot trend&#8221; hi\u1ec7n nay. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng trong c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c nhau, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng t\u00edn \u0111\u1ed3 th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h4><strong>Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u00dd Ngh\u0129a Cho Nh\u1eefng D\u1ecbp \u0110\u1eb7c Bi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n y\u00eau. V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tinh t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m ch\u00e2n th\u00e0nh, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, ho\u1eb7c l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h4><strong>Mua Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk \u1ede \u0110\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu <strong>Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk 55x55cm<\/strong>, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn t\u1ea1i website ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a SenSilk ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1i l\u00fd uy t\u00edn. V\u1edbi ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch giao h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng t\u1eadn t\u00e2m, Sensilk cam k\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho b\u1ea1n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span id=\"input_part_0\" class=\"emoji-sizer emoji-outer null\" data-name=\"\ud83d\udecd\">\ud83d\udecd<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\"><span id=\"input_part_1\" class=\"\" data-mention=\" \">\u00a0https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/<\/span><\/a><br \/>\n\u260e\ufe0f(+84) 976722736 \u2013 963545166<br \/>\n\ud83d\udecd B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-15565 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"199\" \/><\/a><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"650000","regular_price":"730000","sale_price":"650000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">730.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 730.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">650.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 650.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_