\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"444\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"458\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"470\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"490\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n<br data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"514\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"531\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"546\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"562\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"581\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"595\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> V\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"629\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat t\u1ed1t, gi\u1eef m\u00e0u \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"740\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"854\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, th\u1eaft t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1003\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1148\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1163\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1275\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1290\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1332\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1351\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h3 data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"364\"><strong data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"364\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk \u2013 Tinh Hoa Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Tr\u00ean Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u Cao C\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"662\"><strong data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"405\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0i h\u00f2a gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"469\">ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng<\/strong> v\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"501\">ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>. V\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa v\u0103n d\u1ec7t tinh x\u1ea3o, t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a, l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Det-Hoa-Hong-100-To-Tam-6-scaled.jpeg\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-15693 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Det-Hoa-Hong-100-To-Tam-6-225x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"720\"><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"720\">\u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt C\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<h4 data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"773\"><strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"771\">1. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean 100% cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"964\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"813\">t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m nguy\u00ean ch\u1ea5t<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u2013 m\u00e1t nh\u1eb9 \u2013 tho\u00e1ng kh\u00ed. T\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n cao, \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng gi\u1eef m\u00e0u v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i, gi\u00fap kh\u0103n gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1031\"><strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1029\">2. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa v\u0103n d\u1ec7t tinh x\u1ea3o, mang \u0111\u1eadm b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1252\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi hoa v\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. T\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1ec7t, t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 di s\u1ea3n Vi\u1ec7t Nam qua ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef hoa v\u0103n.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1296\">3. M\u00e0u s\u1eafc thanh l\u1ecbch \u2013 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u1ed3<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1519\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk c\u00f3 b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u trang nh\u00e3, sang tr\u1ecdng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng ho\u1eb7c ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c th\u01b0\u1eddng ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1599\"><strong data-start=\"1529\" data-end=\"1599\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p Cho M\u1ecdi D\u1ecbp<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1645\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1749\">\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1659\">\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1659\">Sinh nh\u1eadt<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1671\">\n<p data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1671\">K\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1696\">\n<p data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1696\">S\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1725\">\n<p data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1725\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1749\">\n<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1749\">D\u1ecbp l\u1ec5, T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1751\" data-end=\"1843\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n thay l\u1eddi ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng g\u1eedi \u0111i s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\" \/>\n<h4 data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1892\"><strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1892\">L\u00fd Do B\u1ea1n N\u00ean Ch\u1ecdn Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<h4 data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1941\"><strong data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1939\">\u2714 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cao c\u1ea5p \u2013 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"2047\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt ri\u00eang, kh\u00f4ng tr\u00f9ng l\u1eb7p, mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2087\"><strong data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2085\">\u2714 Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m ch\u1ee9ng<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2227\">SenSilk cam k\u1ebft t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 d\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ebfn quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n cao c\u1ea5p, mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p, tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h4 data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2276\"><strong data-start=\"2233\" data-end=\"2274\">\u2714 D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng t\u1eadn t\u00e2m<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2414\">SenSilk h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, g\u00f3i qu\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i tr\u1ea3 linh ho\u1ea1t \u2014 mang \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng nh\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2474\"><strong data-start=\"2424\" data-end=\"2474\">Mua Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk \u1ede \u0110\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2476\" data-end=\"2611\">B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1eb7t mua tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn ho\u1eb7c gh\u00e9 th\u0103m showroom ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c c\u1ee7a SenSilk \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft d\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2822\">