vang-sensilk\/","sku":"KLV75 SENVANG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"427\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Sen V\u00e0ng SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p tinh t\u1ebf gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"149\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a li\u00ean hoa tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a tr\u1eafng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf vu\u00f4ng 75 \u00d7 75 cm mang n\u00e9t thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng tinh t\u1ebf mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ak2r85\" data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"454\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"454\">TH\u00d4NG TIN S\u1ea2N PH\u1ea8M<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"1545\">. <strong data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"474\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLV75 SENVANG<br data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"491\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"562\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"599\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"613\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"625\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"645\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng V\u1ebd Tay 75x55cm<br data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"678\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"695\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 75 x 75 cm<br data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"725\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"744\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"746\" data-end=\"759\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen<br data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"778\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"793\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"853\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"932\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1042\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1068\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi:<\/strong> D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, n\u01a1 t\u00fai, th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 tay trang tr\u00ed, n\u01a1 c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng, cho\u00e0ng vai\u2026<br data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1146\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1161\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1335\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1350\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1462\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1477\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1538\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1151\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay Hoa Sen V\u00e0ng \u2013 M\u1eabu \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n d\u00f2ng th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1501\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay <strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1191\">Hoa Sen V\u00e0ng<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u c\u1ee7a SenSilk, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m <strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1325\">m\u1eabu \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1402\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c \u2013 L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/strong>, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1810\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1528\">hoa sen v\u00e0ng<\/strong> \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh cao, thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u2013 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng qua t\u1eebng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c trang nh\u00e3, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y l\u1eabn nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trang tr\u1ecdng. V\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1747\">k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 75 \u00d7 75 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1886\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m &amp; k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1888\" data-end=\"2213\">M\u1eabu Sen V\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd tr\u00ean <strong data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1941\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng b\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0 th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da. To\u00e0n b\u1ed9 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2089\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng b\u1edfi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng<\/strong>, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong data-start=\"2099\" data-end=\"2127\">m\u00e0u v\u1ebd cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u<\/strong>, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p nhu\u1ed9m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap kh\u0103n <strong data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2197\">b\u1ec1n m\u00e0u, kh\u00f4ng phai<\/strong> theo th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2399\">M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2282\">t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n<\/strong>, kh\u00f4ng tr\u00f9ng l\u1eb7p, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u SenSilk.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2515\">Tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p><\/p>\n<blockquote data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2557\">\n<p data-start=\"2519\" data-end=\"2557\">Video minh h\u1ecda quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n SenSilk. M\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i theo t\u1eebng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2856\">Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9, ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt cao. V\u1edbi m\u1eabu Hoa Sen V\u00e0ng, m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen m\u00e0 c\u00f2n truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i tinh th\u1ea7n v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u2013 \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m in c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2927\">T\u1eeb m\u1eabu Sen V\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"3305\">Hoa Sen V\u00e0ng l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3007\">d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay SenSilk<\/strong>, d\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. T\u1eeb m\u1eabu Sen V\u00e0ng, SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n nhi\u1ec1u thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay kh\u00e1c v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhi\u1ec1u gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3395\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong data-start=\"3310\" data-end=\"3362\">Xem th\u00eam c\u00e1c m\u1eabu <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-vuong-ve-tay\/\"><em data-start=\"3329\" data-end=\"3352\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay<\/em><\/a> SenSilk<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1250000","regular_price":"1420000","sale_price":"1250000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.420.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.420.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.250.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20104,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-lua-sensilk-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-sen.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-lua-sensilk-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-sen-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a sensilk cao c\u1ea5p v\u1ebd tay hoa sen","alt":""},{"id":20102,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-lua-ve-tay-sen-vang-sensilk.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-lua-ve-tay-sen-vang-sensilk-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","thumb