alink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-vuong-cao-cap-det-hoa-van-sensilk-dinh-cao-cua-su-tinh-te\/","sku":"KLVDHVN VANG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"280\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk 55\u00d755cm t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u trang ph\u1ee5c, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang ho\u1eb7c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"c1f7kl\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"303\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p class=\"\" dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"1470\">. <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"323\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVDHV XANH<br data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"338\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"409\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"446\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"460\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"472\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"492\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n<br data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"516\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"533\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 55 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"563\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"582\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"596\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong>\u00a0V\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"630\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat t\u1ed1t, gi\u1eef m\u00e0u \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"741\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"855\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, n\u01a1 t\u00fai, th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 tay trang tr\u00ed, n\u01a1 c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng, cho\u00e0ng vai\u2026<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"948\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1102\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1214\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1229\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">Th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Trong v\u00f2ng 3-5 ng\u00e0y sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n.<br data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1463\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p d\u1ec7t hoa v\u0103n SenSilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa v\u0103n \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o. \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n gu th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h4>1. <strong>V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p Tinh T\u1ebf C\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng Sen Silk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, c\u00e1c h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa v\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tinh x\u1ea3o, mang \u0111\u1eadm n\u00e9t v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-29\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15585#main\"><img width=\"219\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Vuong-Lua-Det-Hoa-Tiet-SenSilk-1-1-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15587#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Vuong-Lua-Det-Hoa-Tiet-SenSilk-2-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15595#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Vuong-Lua-Det-Hoa-Tiet-SenSilk-8-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h4>2. <strong>V\u00ec Sao Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n Sensilk \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c Y\u00eau Th\u00edch?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng gi\u1eef nhi\u1ec7t t\u1ed1t, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i t\u1ed1i \u0111a cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Hoa v\u0103n d\u1ec7t tinh x\u1ea3o:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 v\u00e0 kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o cho t\u1eebng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Phong c\u00e1ch \u0111a d\u1ea1ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u lo\u1ea1i trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i ti\u1ec7c sang tr\u1ecdng, gi\u00fap t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 t\u1ef1 tin c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>3. <strong>C\u00e1ch Ph\u1ed1i \u0110\u1ed3 V\u1edbi Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Phong c\u00e1ch c\u00f4ng s\u1edf:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk qu\u1ea5n quanh c\u1ed5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o s\u01a1 mi v\u00e0 ch\u00e2n v\u00e1y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Phong c\u00e1ch d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1:<\/strong> Bu\u1ed9c kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk tr\u00ean t\u00fai x\u00e1ch ho\u1eb7c qu\u1ea5n quanh c\u1ed5 tay \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang, mang l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i tr\u1ebb trung v\u00e0 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi v\u00e1y d\u1ea1 h\u1ed9i ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 quy\u1ebfn r\u0169.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h4>4. <strong>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n Sensilk &#8211; M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 Tinh T\u1ebf V\u00e0 Sang Tr\u1ecdng<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng SenSilk kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t. V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf sang tr\u1ecdng, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 hoa v\u0103n tinh x\u1ea3o, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n n\u00e0y ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h4>5. <strong>Mua Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng Cao C\u1ea5p D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n Sensilk \u1ede \u0110\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm mua <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p d\u1ec7t hoa v\u0103n Sen Silk<\/strong> t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng ho\u1eb7c tr\u00ean c\u00e1c trang th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed uy t\u00edn. SenSilk cam k\u1ebft cung c\u1ea5p s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cao, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 gi\u1eef g\u00ecn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span id=\"input_part_0\" class=\"emoji-sizer emoji-outer null\" data-name=\"\ud83d\udecd\">\ud83d\udecd<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\"><span id=\"input_part_1\" class=\"\" data-mention=\" \">\u00a0https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/<\/span><\/a><br \/>\n\u260e\ufe0f(+84) 976722736 \u2013 963545166<br \/>\n\ud83d\udecd B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk.jpg\"><img class=\"wp-image-15565 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"199\" \/><\/a><\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"650000","regular_price":"760000","sale_price":"650000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_t