u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u trang ph\u1ee5c, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang ho\u1eb7c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9.<\/p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"c1f7kl\" data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"300\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"1358\">. <strong data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"321\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDDHV DO<br data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"336\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"407\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"444\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"458\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"470\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"490\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n<br data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"514\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"531\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"546\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"562\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"581\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"595\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> V\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"603\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"629\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat t\u1ed1t, gi\u1eef m\u00e0u \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"723\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"740\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"838\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"854\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, th\u1eaft t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"988\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1003\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1148\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1163\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1272\" data-end=\"1275\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1290\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1332\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1351\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tinh t\u1ebf, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i. V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o, SenSilk mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho b\u1ea1n s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch trong t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u Cao C\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean 100%, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi l\u00e0n da, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n lu\u00f4n c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft \u0110\u1ed9c \u0110\u00e1o<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tinh x\u1ea3o, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean Vi\u1ec7t Nam. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen, bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ph\u1ee5 Ki\u1ec7n Th\u1eddi Trang \u0110\u1eb3ng C\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft SenSilk kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u trang ph\u1ee5c kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean phong c\u00e1ch ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat.<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u00dd Ngh\u0129a<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c. V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a s\u00e2u s\u1eafc, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u00e0y ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd l\u00e0m h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-30\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15469#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Det-Hoa-Van-Gold-SenSilk-KLDD-GOLD-6-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15636#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Patterned-Silk-Scarf-by-SenSilk-Vietnam-4-scaled-225x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-to-tam-det-hoa-van-sensilk-qua-tang-thien-nhien-tinh-te\/khan-lua-det-hoa-hong-100-to-tam-1\/#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Det-Hoa-Hong-100-To-Tam-1-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00e1ch B\u1ea3o Qu\u1ea3n Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m cao c\u1ea5p, do \u0111\u00f3, vi\u1ec7c b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch s\u1ebd gi\u00fap kh\u0103n gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n l\u00e2u d\u00e0i:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gi\u1eb7t tay<\/strong>: Lu\u00f4n gi\u1eb7t kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc \u1ea5m. Tr\u00e1nh s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y r\u1eeda m\u1ea1nh, n\u00ean d\u00f9ng v\u00e0i gi\u1ecdt d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh pha lo\u00e3ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp<\/strong>: Khi ph\u01a1i kh\u0103n, tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, v\u00ec tia UV c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m phai m\u00e0u v\u00e0 l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li><strong>L\u00e0 \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n l\u00e0 kh\u0103n, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 l\u00e0 \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p, v\u00e0 l\u00e0 kh\u0103n khi c\u00f2n \u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh l\u00e0m ch\u00e1y l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li><strong>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 r\u00e1o<\/strong>: Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, h\u00e3y c\u1ea5t kh\u0103n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 r\u00e1o, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t. C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00fai v\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n kh\u0103n, tr\u00e1nh ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac v\u1edbi c\u00e1c v\u1eadt s\u1eafc nh\u1ecdn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span id=\"input_part_0\" class=\"emoji-sizer emoji-outer null\" data-name=\"\ud83d\udecd\">\ud83d\udecd<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\"><span id=\"input_part_1\" class=\"\" data-mention=\" \">\u00a0https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/<\/span><\/a><br \/>\n\