 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"446\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"460\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"472\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"474\" data-end=\"492\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a D\u1ec7t Hoa V\u0103n<br data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"516\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"533\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 55 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"563\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"582\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"596\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Xanh<br data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"604\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"630\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m:<\/strong> M\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, m\u1ecbn nh\u1eb9, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat t\u1ed1t, gi\u1eef m\u00e0u \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"741\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trend th\u1eddi trang; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng c\u00e1c ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"855\">C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> D\u00e2y bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c, n\u01a1 t\u00fai, th\u1eaft c\u1ed5 tay trang tr\u00ed, n\u01a1 c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft l\u01b0ng, cho\u00e0ng vai\u2026<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"948\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft, tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1087\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1102\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1214\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1229\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1347\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1373\">Th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Trong v\u00f2ng 3-5 ng\u00e0y sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n.<br data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1444\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1463\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p>N\u0103m 2024, <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft<\/strong> \u0111ang tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, <strong>SenSilk<\/strong> mang \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h4>1. <strong>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft Sen Silk &#8211; S\u1ef1 L\u1ef1a Ch\u1ecdn Ho\u00e0n H\u1ea3o Cho Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft SenSilk<\/strong> n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt b\u1edfi s\u1ef1 tinh x\u1ea3o, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cao. Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trang ph\u1ee5c, n\u00f3 c\u00f2n ch\u1ee9a \u0111\u1ef1ng th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h4>2. <strong>Xu H\u01b0\u1edbng Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng 2024: Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng SenSilk<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>N\u0103m 2024, th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ch\u1ee9ng ki\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 l\u00ean ng\u00f4i c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft<\/strong>. V\u1edbi kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, t\u1eeb th\u1eddi trang c\u00f4ng s\u1edf \u0111\u1ebfn phong c\u00e1ch d\u1ea1o ph\u1ed1, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a SenSilk tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 &#8220;must-have&#8221; trong m\u00f9a l\u1ec5 h\u1ed9i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h4>3. <strong>V\u00ec Sao Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng SenSilk L\u00e0m N\u00ean Kh\u00e1c Bi\u1ec7t?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng tuy\u1ec7t h\u1ea3o:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec7t n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n vu\u00f4ng SenSilk, mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 v\u00e0 tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o:<\/strong> M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ec7t tinh x\u1ea3o, ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh s\u1ef1 s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 tay ngh\u1ec1 \u0111i\u00eau luy\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li><strong>\u0110a d\u1ea1ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 trang tr\u00ed, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ea7y \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-31\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15567#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Lua-Vuong-Det-Hoa-Hong-SenSilk-6-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15571#main\"><img width=\"226\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Square-Silk-Scarf-Patterned-SenSilk-7-scaled-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15569#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Khan-Vuong-Lua-Det-Hoa-Tiet-SenSilk-4-scaled-225x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h4>4. <strong>C\u00e1ch S\u1eed D\u1ee5ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk L\u00e0m Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n:<\/strong> M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Sen Silk<\/strong> s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng cho m\u1eb9, ch\u1ecb g\u00e1i, hay b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eddi trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 sinh nh\u1eadt, l\u1ec5 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kinh doanh, kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, gi\u00fap g\u1eafn k\u1ebft m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tinh x\u1ea3o s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u00fa v\u1ecb d\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n b\u00e8, v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u1eeba mang l\u1ea1i ni\u1ec1m vui cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4>5. <strong>Mua Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft SenSilk \u1ede \u0110\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h4>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng d\u1ec7t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft SenSilk<\/strong> tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1eb9p, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gh\u00e9 th\u0103m c\u00e1c c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng ho\u1eb7c mua s\u1eafm tr\u1ef1c tuy\u1ebfn qua website c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i. SenSilk cam k\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1ea5t, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span id=\"input_part_0\" class=\"emoji-sizer emoji-outer null\" data-name=\"\ud83d\udecd\">\ud83d