ue,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 54 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"29","width":"15","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"29 \u00d7 15 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m D\u1ec7t H\u1ecda Ti\u1ebft V\u00e0ng &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng M\u1eb9 | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=15460","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/15460","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=15460&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":15365,"name":"Set C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Kh\u00e1ch H\u00e0ng | SenSilk","slug":"set-ca-vat-va-khan-tay-lua-theu-lua-chon-tinh-te-cho-dip-dac-biet-best-silk-gift-2","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/set-ca-vat-va-khan-tay-lua-theu-lua-chon-tinh-te-cho-dip-dac-biet-best-silk-gift-2\/","sku":"SETCAVAT-KHANTAY","short_description":"<div>C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau &#8211; s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau tinh x\u1ea3o, set qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7n \u00edch m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n phong c\u00e1ch v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng. Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"c1f7kl\" data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"298\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"1272\">. <strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"318\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> SETCAVAT-KHANTAY<br data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"337\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"408\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"445\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"459\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"491\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Set Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng L\u1ee5a<br data-start=\"509\" data-end=\"512\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"529\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u0103n tay:<\/strong> 35 \u00d7 35 cm<br data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"543\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"529\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t<\/strong><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"559\">:<\/strong> 153 x 8 cm<br data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"543\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"559\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m &#8211; Jacquard<br data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"593\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: <\/strong>\u0111a d\u1ea1ng theo \u1ea3nh.<br data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"760\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"775\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"893\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"908\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> \u00dd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1080\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1095\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1207\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1222\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong>\u00a0H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, T\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1265\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\" data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"1272\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>L\u01afU \u00dd: B\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1eabu n\u00e0o th\u00ec ch\u1ecdn theo S\u1ed1 ghi tr\u00ean \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 ghi ch\u00fa trong \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng nha. Thanks!<\/strong><\/span><\/p>","description":"<div>Khi t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, Set C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau tinh x\u1ea3o, set qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7n \u00edch m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n phong c\u00e1ch v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt c\u1ee7a C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau SenSilk<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div><strong>1.Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u Cao C\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>C\u00e0 v\u1ea1t v\u00e0 kh\u0103n tay trong set qu\u00e0 n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu. L\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n cao m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i su\u1ed1t c\u1ea3 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><strong>2. Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf Tinh X\u1ea3o<\/strong><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1edbi c\u00e1c h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tinh x\u1ea3o, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c. C\u00e1c h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0m t\u0103ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c v\u00e0 t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 trong t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft. C\u00e0 v\u1ea1t c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u d\u00e1ng trang ph\u1ee5c v\u00e0 d\u1ecbp kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><strong>3. S\u1ef1 K\u1ebft H\u1ee3p Ho\u00e0n H\u1ea3o<\/strong><\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa c\u00e0 v\u1ea1t v\u00e0 kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau trong c\u00f9ng m\u1ed9t set qu\u00e0 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp nh\u01b0 l\u1ec5 t\u00e2n, sinh nh\u1eadt, hay c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n quan tr\u1ecdng. S\u1ef1 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c v\u00e0 t\u00e2m huy\u1ebft c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"gallery-33\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15392#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/ce35f0480a95aacbf38414-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15390#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/8042a7205dfdfda3a4ec17-1-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15388#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/7a246a4a8f972fc9768629-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15384#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/1f64250fc0d2608c39c323-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15394#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/3e28c447219a81c4d88b32-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15396#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/31076e6c8bb12bef72a022-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>L\u1ee3i \u00cdch Khi Ch\u1ecdn Set C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>T\u1ea1o \u1ea4n T\u01b0\u1ee3ng M\u1ea1nh M\u1ebd: M\u1ed9t set qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf nh\u01b0 v\u1eady ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1ef1 \u0110a D\u1ea1ng Trong S\u1eed D\u1ee5ng: C\u00e0 v\u1ea1t v\u00e0 kh\u0103n tay l\u1ee5a th\u00eau c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i h\u1ecdp quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i ti\u1ec7c sang tr\u1ecdng. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y l\u00e0m cho m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 h\u1eefu \u00edch.<\/li>\n<li>Phong C\u00e1ch C\u00e1 Nh\u00e2n: M\u1ed7i set qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft theo s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a m\u00f3n qu\u00e0.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T\u1ea1i Sao N\u00ean Ch\u1ecdn Set C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div>Khi l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u quan tr\u1ecdng. Set C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t v\u00e0 Kh\u0103n Tay L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho nh\u1eefng ai mu\u1ed1n g\u1eedi g\u1eafm th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/96ce9028-9c68-4a2c-8e54-e3a82062c253.jpg\"><img class=\" wp-image-15375 alignright\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/96ce9028-9c68-4a2c-8e54-e3a82062c253-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"253\" data-wp-editing=\"1\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN \u0110\u1eb6T H\u00c0NG<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h4><strong>C\u00c1CH 1:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n zalo ho\u1eb7c g\u1ecdi \u0111i\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nhanh nh\u1ea5t: 0976722736<\/h4>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<h4><strong>C\u00c1CH 2:<\/strong> vui l\u00f2ng l\u00e0m theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u1ea1<\/h4>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o &#8220;ADD TO CART&#8221;, sau \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0o &#8220;CART&#8221; nh\u1eadp s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng Set qu\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1eb7t<\/li>\n<li>Ti\u1ebfp theo t\u1ea1i \u00f4 &#8220;TH\u00d4NG TIN TH\u00caM&#8221; B\u1ea1n ghi ch\u00fa m\u00e3 Kh\u0103n v\u00e0 C\u00e0 V\u1ea1t mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1eb7t. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: K1-C2<\/li>\n<li>Ch\u1ecdn ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c thanh to\u00e1n, &#8220;\u0110\u1eb6T H\u00c0NG&#8221;<\/li>\n<li>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd giao t\u1edbi Qu\u00fd Kh\u00e1ch trong th\u1eddi gian 2-5 ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 MI\u1ec4N PH\u00cd ship.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2764\ufe0fL\u1d0f\u1d20\u1d07 V\u026a\u1d07\u1d1b\u0274\u1d00\u1d0d, R\u1d07\u1d0d\u1d07\u1d0d\u0299\u1d07\u0280 S\u026a\u029f\u1d0b\u2764\ufe0f<br \/>\n\u2014 \u2014 \u2014 \u2014 \u2014 \u2014 \u2014<br \/>\nC\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br \/>\n\u260e\ufe0f(+84) 976722736 \u2013 963545166<br \/>\n\ud83d\udecd B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1180000","regular_price":"1450000","sale_price":"1180000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.450.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 1.450.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.180.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.180.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":15371,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/1814cc93364e9610cf5f18.j