\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"334\"><strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"325\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rcz75r\" data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"392\"><strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"355\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jy7cq3\" data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"410\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"455\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"439\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12s0bbu\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"471\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3a04\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"496\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"619\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"560\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohjkmt\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"634\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc kh\u0103n n\u1ec1n: c\u00f3 4 Tone m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn<\/strong>\u00a0V\u00e0ng nude &#8211; Tr\u1eafng &#8211; Xanh &#8211; H\u1ed3ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xjluuj\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"699\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, tinh t\u1ebf theo tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury; d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4msfod\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"838\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, th\u1eaft t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6k29c\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1115\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"985\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 T\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2hya4\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1131\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1190\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>L\u01afU \u00dd: B\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1eabu n\u00e0o th\u00ec ch\u1ecdn theo S\u1ed1 m\u00e3 ghi tr\u00ean \u1ea3nh (1-2-3-4-6) v\u00e0 ghi ch\u00fa trong \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng nha. Thanks!<\/strong><\/span><\/p>","description":"<div style=\"text-align: center\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa sen SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tinh x\u1ea3o. V\u1edbi thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen thanh nh\u00e3, SenSilk mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>T\u1ea1i Sao Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen L\u00e0 L\u1ef1a Ch\u1ecdn Tuy\u1ec7t V\u1eddi Cho Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch\u1ea5t Li\u1ec7u L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p: Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Sensilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang l\u1ea1i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ch\u1ecbu khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng. L\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1ec1n v\u00e0 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc l\u00e2u d\u00e0i, mang \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 qu\u00fd ph\u00e1i.<\/li>\n<li>Hoa V\u0103n V\u1ebd Tay Tinh X\u1ea3o: M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa sen SenSilk \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd tay t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9 b\u1edfi c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n t\u00e0i hoa. Hoa v\u0103n hoa sen bi\u1ec3u tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 thanh cao, tinh khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 y\u00ean b\u00ecnh, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u00f9 H\u1ee3p V\u1edbi M\u1ecdi D\u1ecbp: Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa sen Sen Silk l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho m\u1ecdi d\u1ecbp, t\u1eeb sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5, \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 \u0111\u00e1m c\u01b0\u1edbi, h\u1ed9i ngh\u1ecb. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m, t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0110i\u1ec3m N\u1ed5i B\u1eadt C\u1ee7a Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa Sen<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf \u0110\u1ed9c \u0110\u00e1o: M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1edbi hoa v\u0103n hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd tay t\u1ec9 m\u1ec9, mang l\u1ea1i n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/li>\n<li>\u0110a D\u1ea1ng M\u00e0u S\u1eafc: SenSilk cung c\u1ea5p nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc kh\u00e1c nhau, t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng gam m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng m\u00e0u s\u1eafc n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ecdi s\u1edf th\u00edch v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li>Ch\u1ea5t L\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0110\u1ea3m B\u1ea3o: S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1ec1n \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho da.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00e1ch Ch\u1ecdn Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen SenSilk L\u00e0m Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div><strong>1. Ch\u1ecdn M\u00e0u S\u1eafc Ph\u00f9 H\u1ee3p<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>Khi ch\u1ecdn kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa sen SenSilk l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng, h\u00e3y l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u00e0u s\u1eafc ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1edf th\u00edch v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn. Nh\u1eefng gam m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng, xanh ng\u1ecdc s\u1ebd l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 thanh nh\u00e3.<\/div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"gallery-34\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15350#main\"><img width=\"688\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Bo-suu-tap-khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15352#main\"><img width=\"691\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Bo-suu-tap-khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15354#main\"><img width=\"669\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Bo-suu-tap-khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-3.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15356#main\"><img width=\"669\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Bo-suu-tap-khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-4.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15360#main\"><img width=\"709\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Bo-suu-tap-khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<div><strong>2. Ki\u1ec3m Tra Ch\u1ea5t L\u01b0\u1ee3ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u1ed1t, kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i hay s\u1eddn r\u00e1ch. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch s\u1edd v\u00e0o b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0 c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk lu\u00f4n \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><strong>3. \u0110\u00f3ng G\u00f3i Sang Tr\u1ecdng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>M\u1ed9t set qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i. H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn nh\u1eefng h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1eaft v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng th\u00eam ph\u1ea7n gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb cho m\u00f3n qu\u00e0. SenSilk cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6945\"><strong>C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/strong><\/h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1vg4lz6\" data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"6993\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa sen l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6995\" data-end=\"7092\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7035\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"av9rb7\" data-start=\"7094\" data-end=\"7135\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7137\" data-end=\"7282\">\u0110\u00fang. Kh\u0103n thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"7176\" data-end=\"7216\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mai v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1033f3m\" data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7314\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u0103n bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7411\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7335\" data-end=\"7350\">180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft t\u00fai.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1w3s9h3\" data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7454\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7456\" data-end=\"7586\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trong <strong data-start=\"7489\" data-end=\"7535\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"8hep8x\" data-start=\"7588\" data-end=\"7638\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eb7ng kh\u0103n v\u00e0o d\u1ecbp 20\/10 ho\u1eb7c 8\/3 kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7640\" data-end=\"7782\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen tinh t\u1ebf, thanh nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp t\u1eb7ng qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7784\" data-end=\"7822\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7824\" data-end=\"7957\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, v\u00e0ng nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa sen SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf m\u00e0 c\u00f2n v\u00ec gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a m\u00e0 n\u00f3 mang l\u1ea1i. H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn ngay m\u1ed9t set qu\u00e0 kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa sen Sensilk \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 quan t\u00e2m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8.<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2900000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.900.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.900.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":15348,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/60e0acea-f5d4-4ae7-af79