],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=15347&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":15314,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Sen V\u00e0ng \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-hoa-sen-sensilk-qua-tang-doanh-nghiep-dang-cap","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-sensilk-qua-tang-doanh-nghiep-dang-cap\/","sku":"KLVT160 SENVANG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"644\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Sen V\u00e0ng l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0i h\u00f2a gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u <strong data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"492\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tinh t\u1ebf. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen v\u00e0ng mang s\u1eafc th\u00e1i thanh nh\u00e3, g\u1ee3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng trang tr\u1ecdng, thanh khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"926\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u00f9ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho <strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"841\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i<\/strong> d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"949\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"2068\">. <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"970\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 SENVANG<br data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"989\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1060\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1097\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1111\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1123\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1143\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1192\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1207\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1223\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1242\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1257\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa sen v\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1273\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1288\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1354\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1416\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1433\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1556\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1571\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1672\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1687\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1850\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1872\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2000\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2042\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2061\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"vb86kp\" data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2094\">C\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2376\">Hoa sen t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1eb9p trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, g\u1eafn v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 thanh khi\u1ebft, b\u00ecnh an v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u1eddi gian. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh <strong data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2272\">sen v\u00e0ng<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang nh\u00e3 m\u00e0 v\u1eabn c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2378\" data-end=\"2508\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa sen mang c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"gallery-35\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15328#main\"><img width=\"222\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-1-222x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15332#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-ve-hoa-sen-sensilk-24-scaled-225x300.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=15330#main\"><img width=\"209\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-7-209x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"2553\" data-end=\"2765\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2581\">l\u1ee5a <\/strong><strong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2581\">100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. Ch\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u hi\u1ec7n l\u00ean thanh tho\u00e1t, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2888\">M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t \u0111\u1ec1u mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ee3, gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a SenSilk.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2890\" data-end=\"2903\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"3147\"><strong data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2917\">Sen V\u00e0ng<\/strong> mang phong c\u00e1ch Art Luxury v\u1eeba ph\u1ea3i, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3110\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec1 cao s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf h\u01a1n l\u00e0 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3160\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3162\" data-end=\"3270\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3192\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3272\" data-end=\"3402\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong ng\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng, m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3423\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3607\"><strong data-start=\"3425\" data-end=\"3460\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Sen V\u00e0ng<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u0103n h\u00f3a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3606\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3793\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi doanh nghi\u1ec7p, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m <strong data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3721\">qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong>, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng qua m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"4067\">SenSilk c\u0169ng nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3813\" data-end=\"3866\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"4004\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4087\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4327\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"4105\" data-end=\"4159\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen v\u00e0ng mang t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, trong khi k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay \u0111em l\u1ea1i chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn ch\u00e2n th\u1ef1c v\u1ec1 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4471\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f4i b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4473\" data-end=\"4491\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4493\" data-end=\"4722\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4540\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf bao b\u00ec ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng quan tr\u1ecdng, t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4744\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4746\" data-end=\"4941\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, th\u1ea3 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, s\u1eafc sen v\u00e0ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4943\" data-end=\"4964\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5136\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5138\" data-end=\"5254\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"5256\" data-end=\"5262\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5373\"><strong data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5298\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5298\" data-end=\"5301\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"5318\" data-end=\"5337\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5375\" data-end=\"5495\"><strong data-start=\"5375\" data-end=\"5425\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u00ean kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5425\" data-end=\"5428\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5455\" data-end=\"5494\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5655\"><strong data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5549\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5549\" data-end=\"5552\" \/>C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5928\"><strong data-start=\"5657\" data-end=\"5715\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn l\u00e0m kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5715\" data-end=\"5718\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang, v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt nh\u01b0 <strong data-start=\"5807\" data-end=\"5854\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"6076\"><strong data-start=\"5930\" data-end=\"5968\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5968\" data-end=\"5971\" \/>C\u00f3. M\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen v\u00e0ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch kh\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6206\"><strong data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6113\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"6113\" data-end=\"6116\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"6141\" data-end=\"6183\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2250000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.250.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":15315,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-2.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-2-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 892px) 100vw, 892px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa sen (2)","alt":""},{"id":15325,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-3.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/khan-lua-hoa-sen-3-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 836px) 100vw, 836px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa sen (3)","alt":""},{"id