}]},{"id":0,"name":"Giao h\u00e0ng","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ship to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c","slug":"Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ship to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c"}]},{"id":0,"name":"\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, thi\u1ec7p sensilk, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y","slug":"Kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, thi\u1ec7p sensilk, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 28 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"","dimensions":{"length":"","width":"","height":""},"formatted_weight":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","formatted_dimensions":"Kh\u00f4ng \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Sen V\u00e0ng \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=15314","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/15314","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=15314&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14704,"name":"Art of Silk \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Mai Limited | SenSilk","slug":"art-of-silk-khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mai-sensilk-limited-qua-tang-dang-cap","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mai-sensilk-limited-qua-tang-dang-cap\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE HOAMAI","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"498\"><strong data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"266\">Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1eabu kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"348\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a nude kem m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0nh mai v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh nh\u00e3, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"655\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"524\" data-end=\"540\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>: kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3>Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"1195\">\n<li data-section-id=\"qr410o\" data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"204\"><strong data-start=\"163\" data-end=\"180\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE HOAMAI<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"310\"><strong data-start=\"207\" data-end=\"276\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"334\"><strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"325\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rcz75r\" data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"392\"><strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"355\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jy7cq3\" data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"410\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"455\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"439\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12s0bbu\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"471\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Mai v\u00e0ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3a04\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"496\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"619\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"560\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohjkmt\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"634\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Nude kem k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u00e0ng mai v\u00e0 s\u1eafc xanh t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xjluuj\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"699\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, tinh t\u1ebf theo tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury; d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4msfod\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"838\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, th\u1eaft t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6k29c\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1115\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"985\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 T\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2hya4\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1131\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1190\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1756\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1758\" data-end=\"1866\">Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1865\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"2086\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n nude kem nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0nh mai v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed v\u1edbi m\u1eadt \u0111\u1ed9 v\u1eeba ph\u1ea3i, \u0111\u1ec3 kho\u1ea3ng l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf. S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c, t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2262\">M\u1ed7i n\u00e9t v\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, v\u00ec v\u1eady v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf <strong data-start=\"2198\" data-end=\"2261\">\u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m, \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 v\u00e0 \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2418\">\u0110\u00f3 ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"2290\" data-end=\"2327\">Art of Silk \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>: bi\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1o31yxb\" data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2455\">V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa mai tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n nude<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2457\" data-end=\"2571\">Hoa mai l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2654\">Trong Art of Silk, hoa mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2804\"><strong data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2672\">N\u1ec1n nude kem<\/strong> t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c thanh l\u1ecbch.<br data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2700\" \/><strong data-start=\"2700\" data-end=\"2712\">Mai v\u00e0ng<\/strong> mang \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n \u1ea5m \u00e1p.<br data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2741\" \/><strong data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2768\">Nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0nh c\u00e2y m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i<\/strong> gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2952\">Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n trong kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft m\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qp32fl\" data-start=\"2954\" data-end=\"2989\">Phong c\u00e1ch Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2991\" data-end=\"3078\">Art of Silk ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p <strong data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3077\">thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng k\u00edn \u0111\u00e1o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e2c40m\" data-start=\"3080\" data-end=\"3100\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3189\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3128\" data-end=\"3188\">\u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, v\u00e0ng nh\u1ea1t, be ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3191\" data-end=\"3300\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 hai t\u00e0 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn v\u1ebb duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vi5bur\" data-start=\"3302\" data-end=\"3324\">Phong c\u00e1ch c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3326\" data-end=\"3469\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer, vest ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc, kh\u0103n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sm2036\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3498\">Phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3688\">N\u1ec1n nude trung t\u00ednh c\u00f9ng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mai v\u00e0ng ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf gi\u00fap Art of Silk d\u1ec5 h\u00f2a v\u00e0o phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3607\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong> \u2013 sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh gi\u1ea3n thay v\u00ec nh\u1eefng chi ti\u1ebft ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x94b71\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3716\">\u0110i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3821\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cu\u1ed9n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai, t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"3823\" data-end=\"3859\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3861\" data-end=\"3926\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, Art of Silk c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng linh ho\u1ea1t:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4212\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h5qtct\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"3949\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1szm44s\" data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"4000\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai khi \u0111i ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c d\u1ef1 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xj7d7a\" data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4020\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1r0hcv9\" data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4059\">Th\u1eaft kh\u0103n theo nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"x97yy5\" data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4089\">L\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"zpv8t3\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4121\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bhabuy\" data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4171\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jcjtyr\" data-start=\"4172\" data-end=\"4212\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4214\" data-end=\"4355\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng di\u1ec7n m\u1ea1o kh\u00e1c nhau m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e9t thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2zi21c\" data-start=\"4357\" data-end=\"4394\">Art of Silk \u2013 Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4396\" data-end=\"4501\">C\u00f3 nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1edb \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i v\u00ec gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t, m\u00e0 b\u1edfi <strong data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4500\">c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n n\u1eb1m ph\u00eda sau m\u00f3n qu\u00e0<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4658\">Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai mang trong m\u00ecnh c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 <strong data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4617\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa mai<\/strong> \u2013 m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1eb9p trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4660\" data-end=\"4769\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p khi anh\/ch\u1ecb mu\u1ed1n t\u00ecm m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"4717\" data-end=\"4768\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4771\" data-end=\"4800\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u00edch h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"5037\">\n<li data-section-id=\"pooant\" data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4821\">M\u1eb9 v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"iu37qk\" data-start=\"4822\" data-end=\"4854\">V\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5zboe1\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4868\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cmp01t\" data-start=\"4869\" data-end=\"4886\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i1s52d\" data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"4910\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15gpmwi\" data-start=\"4911\" data-end=\"4928\">\u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dmaxgv\" data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"4972\">Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"667k4m\" data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"5037\">Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf mu\u1ed1n mang theo m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5039\" data-end=\"5160\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp <strong data-start=\"5068\" data-end=\"5159\">8\/3, 20\/10, T\u1ebft, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5180\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5182\" data-end=\"5326\">Art of Silk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5214\" data-end=\"5256\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5328\" data-end=\"5449\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t trong h\u1ed9p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u00e0 c\u00f2n bi\u1ebfn qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh m\u1edf qu\u00e0 th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5451\" data-end=\"5555\"><strong data-start=\"5451\" data-end=\"5555\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<br data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5486\" \/>M\u1ed9t h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<br data-start=\"5515\" data-end=\"5518\" \/>M\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u1ec3 ghi nh\u1edb.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"643l1z\" data-start=\"5557\" data-end=\"5606\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Limited \u2013 Khi l\u1ee5a tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5743\">Kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t \u0111\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t so v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n b\u1eb1ng m\u00e1y m\u00f3c: <strong data-start=\"5704\" data-end=\"5742\">d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5745\" data-end=\"5841\">S\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 n\u1eb1m \u1edf \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t, \u0111\u1ed9 chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1ch h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5957\">V\u1edbi Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai, ch\u00ednh nh\u1eefng y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u1ea5y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"5956\">Limited<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5959\" data-end=\"6111\">SenSilk kh\u00f4ng h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m cho chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf n\u00ean c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 h\u01a1n, m\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn vi\u1ec7c gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i <strong data-start=\"6053\" data-end=\"6110\">s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6113\" data-end=\"6133\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6135\" data-end=\"6238\"><strong data-start=\"6135\" data-end=\"6148\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5:<\/strong> G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6240\" data-end=\"6309\"><strong data-start=\"6240\" data-end=\"6255\">Cho\u00e0ng vai:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c \u00e1o d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6377\"><strong data-start=\"6311\" data-end=\"6324\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai:<\/strong> Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6379\" data-end=\"6511\"><strong data-start=\"6379\" data-end=\"6395\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i:<\/strong> C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, v\u00e0ng nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6513\" data-end=\"6534\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6922\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vo5lta\" data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6578\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1823xro\" data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6617\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19m64vt\" data-start=\"6618\" data-end=\"6664\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxve9m\" data-start=\"6665\" data-end=\"6695\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyt2h4\" data-start=\"6696\" data-end=\"6746\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3olhy\" data-start=\"6747\" data-end=\"6780\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0\/\u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjkovm\" data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6850\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v1clai\" data-start=\"6851\" data-end=\"6922\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6945\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vg4lz6\" data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"6993\">Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6995\" data-end=\"7092\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7035\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"av9rb7\" data-start=\"7094\" data-end=\"7135\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7137\" data-end=\"7282\">\u0110\u00fang. Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"7176\" data-end=\"7216\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mai v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1033f3m\" data-start=\"7284\" data-end=\"7314\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u0103n bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7411\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7335\" data-end=\"7350\">180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft t\u00fai.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1w3s9h3\" data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7454\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7456\" data-end=\"7586\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trong <strong data-start=\"7489\" data-end=\"7535\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8hep8x\" data-start=\"7588\" data-end=\"7638\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eb7ng kh\u0103n v\u00e0o d\u1ecbp 20\/10 ho\u1eb7c 8\/3 kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7640\" data-end=\"7782\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft mai v\u00e0ng, n\u1ec1n nude thanh nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp t\u1eb7ng qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7784\" data-end=\"7822\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7824\" data-end=\"7957\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Art of Silk \u2013 Hoa Mai, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, v\u00e0ng nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2750000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.750.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.750.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":20658,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk-247x296.jpg","srcset":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk.jpg 1122w, https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk-240x300.jpg 240w, https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk-819x1024.jpg 819w, https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk-768x960.jpg 768w, https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-limited-sensilk-510x637.jpg 510w","sizes":"(max-width: 1122px) 100vw, 1122px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"art-of-silk-khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-mai-li