\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-thoi-trang-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-hong\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED XANH HOAHONGDO","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"595\"><strong data-start=\"295\" data-end=\"333\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng \u0110\u1ecf<\/strong> l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"397\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a xanh d\u1ecbu nh\u1eb9, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf v\u00e0 c\u00e0nh l\u00e1 xanh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 t\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ea7y cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat gi\u1eefa s\u1eafc xanh thanh nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 v\u1ebb n\u1ed3ng n\u00e0n c\u1ee7a hoa h\u1ed3ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"772\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"660\">th\u1eddi trang, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 Quiet Luxury<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau th\u00edch ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"795\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none\">\n<ul data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"1875\">\n<li data-section-id=\"udouob\" data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"840\"><strong data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"816\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED XANH HONGDO<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"843\" data-end=\"912\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"970\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"961\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rcz75r\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"991\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jy7cq3\" data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1058\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1046\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1075\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"txbzez\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1135\"><strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1107\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf v\u00e0 c\u00e0nh l\u00e1 xanh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3a04\" data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1187\"><strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1151\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1274\"><strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1215\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kqm2ra\" data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1338\"><strong data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1289\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Xanh nh\u1ea1t k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf v\u00e0 s\u1eafc xanh c\u1ee7a l\u00e1<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"glgafh\" data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1484\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1356\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Th\u1eddi trang, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch theo tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bk7szx\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1633\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1500\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; th\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5ybhpt\" data-start=\"1634\" data-end=\"1795\"><strong data-start=\"1636\" data-end=\"1649\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 tri \u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2hya4\" data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1850\"><strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1811\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1875\"><strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1870\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1917\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2018\">\u0110i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2017\">n\u1ec1n xanh d\u1ecbu m\u00e1t v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2268\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c m\u1ea3ng l\u00e1 xanh t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng. Tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m v\u00e0 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u ri\u00eang, gi\u00fap h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean thanh tho\u00e1t thay v\u00ec qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2393\">N\u1ec1n xanh \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3ng th\u1edf cho nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf, khi\u1ebfn t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2519\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2435\">Art of Silk<\/strong>: \u0111\u01b0a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda l\u00ean m\u1ed9t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u th\u1eddi trang c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7740\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/lua-ve-tay-SenSilk-hoa-mau-don-18-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"204\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"7gn93d\" data-start=\"2521\" data-end=\"2566\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf \u2013 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n c\u1ee7a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2666\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf lu\u00f4n g\u1ee3i li\u00ean t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn <strong data-start=\"2604\" data-end=\"2665\">v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p, t\u00ecnh y\u00eau, s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2822\">Tr\u00ean thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf SenSilk, hoa h\u1ed3ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed d\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c m\u00e0 tr\u1ea3i d\u1ecdc theo th\u00e2n kh\u0103n, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3ng chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u1eefa hoa, c\u00e0nh v\u00e0 n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2971\">Khi qu\u00e0ng l\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch v\u1ed1n c\u00f3 c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2973\" data-end=\"3158\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"2989\" data-end=\"3016\">xanh d\u1ecbu v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecf hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/strong> c\u0169ng gi\u00fap m\u1eabu kh\u0103n c\u00f3 c\u00e1 t\u00ednh th\u1eddi trang r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng h\u01a1n, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u00edch ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u00f3 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn mu\u1ed1n gi\u1eef v\u1ebb sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7746\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/02\/Rose-SenSilk-Silk-Painting-Scarf-3-1024x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"235\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"bbyeh1\" data-start=\"3160\" data-end=\"3199\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa H\u1ed3ng SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3201\" data-end=\"3269\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3233\" data-end=\"3268\">n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e2c40m\" data-start=\"3271\" data-end=\"3291\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3293\" data-end=\"3397\">N\u1ec1n xanh nh\u1ea1t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3396\">\u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh pastel, xanh nh\u1ea1t ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3399\" data-end=\"3492\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7, gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1edf n\u00ean n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt m\u00e0 v\u1eabn duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1n4gp6s\" data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3521\">Ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3670\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p kh\u0103n v\u1edbi s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer, vest ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ea7m \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc. C\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i n\u00e0y gi\u00fap trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1sm2036\" data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3699\">Phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3899\">V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3787\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ph\u1ed1i m\u00e0u ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf<\/strong>. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mvr6ao\" data-start=\"3901\" data-end=\"3923\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"4071\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cu\u1ed9n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf nh\u01b0ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u00fai c\u00f3 m\u00e0u tr\u1eafng, kem, be, xanh ho\u1eb7c n\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4073\" data-end=\"4109\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4169\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng linh ho\u1ea1t:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4410\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h5qtct\" data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4192\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7wektk\" data-start=\"4193\" data-end=\"4215\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xj7d7a\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4235\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4ptff\" data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4269\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s55cjm\" data-start=\"4270\" data-end=\"4294\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17ttm6y\" data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4321\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bhabuy\" data-start=\"4322\" data-end=\"4371\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14x3ek7\" data-start=\"4372\" data-end=\"4410\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4412\" data-end=\"4529\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea5u theo nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch, t\u1eeb thanh l\u1ecbch h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ebfn n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"pksucs\" data-start=\"4531\" data-end=\"4577\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay \u2013 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4669\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb9p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf <strong data-start=\"4630\" data-end=\"4668\">c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi g\u1eafm<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4671\" data-end=\"4886\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p khi mu\u1ed1n d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba th\u1eddi trang, v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"4917\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u00edch h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"5132\">\n<li data-section-id=\"pooant\" data-start=\"4919\" data-end=\"4938\">M\u1eb9 v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i7751n\" data-start=\"4939\" data-end=\"4959\">V\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4qfk8a\" data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"4984\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5zboe1\" data-start=\"4985\" data-end=\"4998\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r96t6v\" data-start=\"4999\" data-end=\"5023\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i1s52d\" data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5047\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15gpmwi\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5065\">\u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9f0la5\" data-start=\"5066\" data-end=\"5078\">Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12gge07\" data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5132\">Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf y\u00eau th\u00edch s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5250\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"5155\" data-end=\"5249\">8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, T\u1ebft, l\u1ec5 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5252\" data-end=\"5270\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5396\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5301\" data-end=\"5343\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng ngay trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5556\">Bao b\u00ec \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb l\u00fac trao t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ebfn khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn m\u1edf h\u1ed9p v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5650\"><strong data-start=\"5558\" data-end=\"5650\">M\u1ed9t t\u1ea5m l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c.<br data-start=\"5579\" data-end=\"5582\" \/>M\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 th\u01b0\u1edfng th\u1ee9c.<br data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5613\" \/>M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 trao g\u1eedi y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"qdrxu1\" data-start=\"5652\" data-end=\"5703\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Limited \u2013 D\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5815\">Kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay mang m\u1ed9t gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ri\u00eang b\u1edfi m\u1ed7i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5817\" data-end=\"5909\">\u0110\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a hoa, c\u00e1ch chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang cho thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5911\" data-end=\"6104\">V\u1edbi d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"5920\" data-end=\"5939\">SenSilk Limited<\/strong>, gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb kh\u00f4ng n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 m\u00e0 \u1edf vi\u1ec7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p <strong data-start=\"5989\" data-end=\"6050\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6106\" data-end=\"6126\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6231\"><strong data-start=\"6128\" data-end=\"6141\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5:<\/strong> G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6233\" data-end=\"6334\"><strong data-start=\"6233\" data-end=\"6248\">Cho\u00e0ng vai:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6415\"><strong data-start=\"6336\" data-end=\"6349\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai:<\/strong> Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6417\" data-end=\"6542\"><strong data-start=\"6417\" data-end=\"6433\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6544\" data-end=\"6565\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6567\" data-end=\"6953\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vo5lta\" data-start=\"6567\" data-end=\"6609\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1823xro\" data-start=\"6610\" data-end=\"6648\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19m64vt\" data-start=\"6649\" data-end=\"6695\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxve9m\" data-start=\"6696\" data-end=\"6726\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyt2h4\" data-start=\"6727\" data-end=\"6777\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3olhy\" data-start=\"6778\" data-end=\"6811\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0\/\u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjkovm\" data-start=\"6812\" data-end=\"6881\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v1clai\" data-start=\"6882\" data-end=\"6953\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"6955\" data-end=\"6976\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13v34fr\" data-start=\"6978\" data-end=\"7033\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa h\u1ed3ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7035\" data-end=\"7126\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"7056\" data-end=\"7075\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, mang \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7128\" data-end=\"7166\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7168\" data-end=\"7314\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"7194\" data-end=\"7234\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf v\u00e0 c\u00e0nh l\u00e1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7349\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7351\" data-end=\"7464\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7370\" data-end=\"7385\">180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"80dhjg\" data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7505\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7507\" data-end=\"7654\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"7540\" data-end=\"7582\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7656\" data-end=\"7694\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7696\" data-end=\"7821\">C\u00f3. N\u1ec1n xanh nh\u1ea1t k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt khi ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh pastel, kem ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5a6txs\" data-start=\"7823\" data-end=\"7867\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7869\" data-end=\"7975\">Kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2800000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.800.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.800.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14693,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/lua-ve-tay-SenSilk-hoa-mau-don-23-scal