v\u1edbi s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng thanh nh\u00e3, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u ch\u1ea5t ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"842\">L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u00e0o trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"746\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>: tinh gi\u1ea3n, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0o ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f9ng d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"865\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"1961\">\n<li data-section-id=\"86yisz\" data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"910\"><strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"886\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED HONG HOADAO<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1gta8jm\" data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1016\"><strong data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"982\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1040\"><strong data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1031\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rcz75r\" data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1098\"><strong data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1061\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jy7cq3\" data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1128\"><strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1116\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1161\"><strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1145\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1e1oy2g\" data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1185\"><strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1177\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3a04\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1237\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1201\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1324\"><strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1265\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15ezuj8\" data-start=\"1325\" data-end=\"1388\"><strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1339\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n h\u1ed3ng thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa \u0111\u00e0o nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ku1j5p\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1534\"><strong data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1406\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt theo tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jov0hq\" data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1683\"><strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1550\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1iqok8r\" data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1881\"><strong data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1699\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft, 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng mang b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2hya4\" data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1936\"><strong data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1897\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1937\" data-end=\"1961\"><strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1956\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2003\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2102\">Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m ch\u1ee7 th\u1ec3 cho m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2104\" data-end=\"2246\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u1eefa c\u00e0nh, hoa v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2427\">S\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a hoa kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 \u0111\u1eadm m\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb thanh tho\u00e1t. Khi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng ch\u1ea1m l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a s\u1ee3i t\u01a1 l\u00e0m m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2429\" data-end=\"2575\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2493\">t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong> \u2013 n\u01a1i ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft m\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"4pmbie\" data-start=\"2577\" data-end=\"2614\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2616\" data-end=\"2726\">Trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, hoa \u0111\u00e0o th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn <strong data-start=\"2668\" data-end=\"2725\">m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, s\u1ef1 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2728\" data-end=\"2914\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a theo c\u00e1ch nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng h\u01a1n, \u0111\u1ec3 hoa \u0111\u00e0o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u n\u0103m m\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u1eddi trang c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2916\" data-end=\"3022\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa nh\u1ecf, s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng d\u1ecbu v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00e0nh m\u1ec1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 n\u1eef t\u00ednh nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ng\u1ecdt ng\u00e0o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3024\" data-end=\"3204\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u00fd do m\u1eabu kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"3072\" data-end=\"3093\">Tinh Hoa Qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong>: mang m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"fj264o\" data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3244\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa \u0110\u00e0o SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3246\" data-end=\"3331\">Kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3330\">n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng k\u00edn \u0111\u00e1o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"e2c40m\" data-start=\"3333\" data-end=\"3353\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3454\">S\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"3393\" data-end=\"3453\">\u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem, be ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3553\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 hai t\u00e0 bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vi5bur\" data-start=\"3555\" data-end=\"3577\">Phong c\u00e1ch c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3579\" data-end=\"3727\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n tinh t\u1ebf, mang l\u1ea1i n\u00e9t n\u1eef t\u00ednh m\u00e0 v\u1eabn chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"5wuk91\" data-start=\"3729\" data-end=\"3745\">Quiet Luxury<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3916\">Khi \u0111i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh chi ti\u1ebft ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt tr\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3. V\u1ebb sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"3859\" data-end=\"3915\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf m\u00e0u s\u1eafc<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"x94b71\" data-start=\"3918\" data-end=\"3944\">\u0110i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"4044\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cu\u1ed9n g\u1ecdn kh\u0103n v\u00e0 th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai, t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ecf mang s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4082\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4142\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng linh ho\u1ea1t:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4385\">\n<li data-section-id=\"h5qtct\" data-start=\"4144\" data-end=\"4165\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7wektk\" data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4188\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xj7d7a\" data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4208\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m4ptff\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4242\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s55cjm\" data-start=\"4243\" data-end=\"4267\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17ttm6y\" data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4294\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bhabuy\" data-start=\"4295\" data-end=\"4344\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jcjtyr\" data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4385\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4519\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebfn t\u1ea5u theo nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch, gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean phong c\u00e1ch ri\u00eang m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2wrd24\" data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4560\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u2013 Tinh Hoa Qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4562\" data-end=\"4642\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t thi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i mang h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4644\" data-end=\"4800\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng <strong data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4752\">ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u qu\u00fd v\u00e0 ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tinh t\u1ebf<\/strong>, m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ec3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n r\u1ea5t ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4802\" data-end=\"4940\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa \u0110\u00e0o mang trong m\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t Nam, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4979\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5171\">\n<li data-section-id=\"pooant\" data-start=\"4981\" data-end=\"5000\">M\u1eb9 v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"iu37qk\" data-start=\"5001\" data-end=\"5033\">V\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5zboe1\" data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5047\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r96t6v\" data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5072\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i1s52d\" data-start=\"5073\" data-end=\"5096\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15gpmwi\" data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5114\">\u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9f0la5\" data-start=\"5115\" data-end=\"5127\">Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ml6z0h\" data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5171\">Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5173\" data-end=\"5290\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5289\">qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft, 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5310\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5312\" data-end=\"5429\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi <strong data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5383\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 ch\u1ec9n chu khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5545\">T\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a b\u00ean trong \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i, m\u1ed7i chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5547\" data-end=\"5637\"><strong data-start=\"5547\" data-end=\"5637\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eeb l\u1ee5a.<br data-start=\"5568\" data-end=\"5571\" \/>M\u1ed9t n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1eeb hoa \u0111\u00e0o.<br data-start=\"5594\" data-end=\"5597\" \/>M\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trao g\u1eedi.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"x71mfh\" data-start=\"5639\" data-end=\"5701\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Limited \u2013 Khi hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5703\" data-end=\"5811\">Kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang b\u1edfi t\u1eebng h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5813\" data-end=\"5888\">S\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t n\u1eb1m \u1edf \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t, c\u00e1ch chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u v\u00e0 b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng nh\u00e0nh hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5890\" data-end=\"6076\">V\u1edbi Art of Silk v\u00e0 d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"5914\" data-end=\"5952\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Limited<\/strong>, SenSilk h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u1eeba c\u00f3 t\u00ednh th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba mang tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6156\"><strong data-start=\"6078\" data-end=\"6156\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch mang ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t b\u00ean m\u00ecnh.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6158\" data-end=\"6178\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6283\"><strong data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6193\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5:<\/strong> G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6285\" data-end=\"6386\"><strong data-start=\"6285\" data-end=\"6300\">Cho\u00e0ng vai:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6388\" data-end=\"6467\"><strong data-start=\"6388\" data-end=\"6401\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai:<\/strong> Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6469\" data-end=\"6598\"><strong data-start=\"6469\" data-end=\"6485\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i:<\/strong> C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6600\" data-end=\"6621\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"7009\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vo5lta\" data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6665\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1823xro\" data-start=\"6666\" data-end=\"6704\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19m64vt\" data-start=\"6705\" data-end=\"6751\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxve9m\" data-start=\"6752\" data-end=\"6782\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyt2h4\" data-start=\"6783\" data-end=\"6833\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3olhy\" data-start=\"6834\" data-end=\"6867\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0\/\u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjkovm\" data-start=\"6868\" data-end=\"6937\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v1clai\" data-start=\"6938\" data-end=\"7009\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7011\" data-end=\"7032\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"oteamz\" data-start=\"7034\" data-end=\"7088\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa \u0111\u00e0o SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7090\" data-end=\"7187\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"7111\" data-end=\"7130\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7189\" data-end=\"7227\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7229\" data-end=\"7360\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong data-start=\"7255\" data-end=\"7295\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1033f3m\" data-start=\"7362\" data-end=\"7392\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u0103n bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7394\" data-end=\"7489\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7428\">180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft t\u00fai.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"lo6m1\" data-start=\"7491\" data-end=\"7529\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7531\" data-end=\"7715\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Hoa \u0111\u00e0o l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed T\u1ebft Vi\u1ec7t, trong khi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7717\" data-end=\"7755\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7757\" data-end=\"7854\">C\u00f3. S\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"7856\" data-end=\"7908\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7910\" data-end=\"8067\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o d\u1ecbp T\u1ebft v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2850000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.850.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-cur