:0,"name":"H\u1ed3ng, Nude, Xanh, Tr\u1eafng","slug":"H\u1ed3ng, Nude, Xanh, Tr\u1eafng"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 19 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hoa \u0110\u00e0o SenSilk &#8211; Tinh Hoa Qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14672","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14672","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14672&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14670,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Mugunghwa &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Kh\u00e1ch H\u00e0n | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-mugunghwa-quoc-hoa-han-quoc-qua-tang-khach-han","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-mugunghwa-quoc-hoa-han-quoc-qua-tang-khach-han\/","sku":"KLVT160 MUGUNGHWA","short_description":"<p data-start=\"61\" data-end=\"385\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Mugunghwa l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"129\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb Mugunghwa \u2013 lo\u00e0i hoa mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 v\u00e0 l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng quen thu\u1ed9c trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"677\">V\u1edbi s\u1eafc hoa thanh l\u1ecbch c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch t\u1eeb \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u00fd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"621\">kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c<\/strong>, nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 giao thoa v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u2013 H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"700\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"1822\">. <strong data-start=\"704\" data-end=\"721\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 MUGUNGHWA<br data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"742\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"813\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"864\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"876\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"896\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"928\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"945\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"960\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"976\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"995\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1010\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa Mugunghwa<br data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1027\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1042\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1081\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1108\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1170\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1187\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1310\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1325\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1441\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1604\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1626\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1739\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1754\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1796\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1815\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"2079\">Mugunghwa, hay hoa d\u00e2m b\u1ee5t Sharon, l\u00e0 lo\u00e0i hoa g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c. L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a lo\u00e0i hoa n\u00e0y, SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a Mugunghwa l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2081\" data-end=\"2230\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n giao thoa v\u0103n h\u00f3a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2272\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2475\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2302\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa Mugunghwa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. Ch\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u tr\u1edf n\u00ean thanh tho\u00e1t, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2632\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa Mugunghwa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba mang tinh th\u1ea7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, v\u1eeba c\u00f3 n\u00e9t giao thoa v\u0103n h\u00f3a tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2634\" data-end=\"2647\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2856\">Mugunghwa mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2700\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2839\" data-end=\"2855\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5522\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Hoa-Mugung-Han-Quoc-SenSilk-1-1024x767.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"227\" \/><\/p>\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div class=\"_1aa6\" style=\"text-align: left\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2858\" data-end=\"2869\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2871\" data-end=\"2991\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2901\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2993\" data-end=\"3146\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh giao l\u01b0u Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u2013 H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3148\" data-end=\"3167\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3419\">Kh\u0103n l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3293\">kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c, doanh nh\u00e2n, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Mugunghwa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a, trong khi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam mang \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a m\u00f3n qu\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3421\" data-end=\"3688\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3434\" data-end=\"3487\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3625\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5526\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Hoa-Mugung-Han-Quoc-SenSilk-3-1024x788.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"232\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3690\" data-end=\"3708\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3710\" data-end=\"3855\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3811\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3857\" data-end=\"4053\">\u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 giao thoa v\u0103n h\u00f3a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4055\" data-end=\"4073\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4075\" data-end=\"4290\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4122\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5524\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Hoa-Mugung-Han-Quoc-SenSilk-2-1024x767.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"227\" \/><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4292\" data-end=\"4312\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4314\" data-end=\"4507\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Mugunghwa c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4509\" data-end=\"4530\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4699\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4817\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4825\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4967\"><strong data-start=\"4827\" data-end=\"4851\">Mugunghwa l\u00e0 hoa g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4854\" \/>Mugunghwa l\u00e0 t\u00ean ti\u1ebfng H\u00e0n c\u1ee7a <strong data-start=\"4885\" data-end=\"4907\">hoa d\u00e2m b\u1ee5t Sharon<\/strong>, m\u1ed9t lo\u00e0i hoa c\u00f3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5078\"><strong data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5003\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5003\" data-end=\"5006\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5042\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5192\"><strong data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5135\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Mugunghwa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5135\" data-end=\"5138\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5152\" data-end=\"5191\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5375\"><strong data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5248\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch H\u00e0n Qu\u1ed1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5248\" data-end=\"5251\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Mugunghwa t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a, trong khi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam mang \u0111\u1ebfn d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang cho m\u00f3n qu\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5631\"><strong data-start=\"5377\" data-end=\"5436\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5439\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5517\" data-end=\"5564\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5633\" data-end=\"5761\"><strong data-start=\"5633\" data-end=\"5668\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5668\" data-end=\"5671\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5696\" data-end=\"5738\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.200.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.200.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":5530,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Hoa-Mugung-Han-Quoc-SenSilk-5.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/up