age=1&#038;add-to-cart=14648","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14648","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14648&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14626,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng Limited \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Ph\u1ee5 N\u1eef | SenSilk","slug":"qua-tang-phu-nu-khan-thoi-trang-cao-cap-ve-tay-rose-100-lua-to-tam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/qua-tang-phu-nu-khan-thoi-trang-cao-cap-ve-tay-rose-100-lua-to-tam\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED HONG HOAHONGDO","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"71\" data-end=\"364\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u00f3ng m\u1ec1m, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n chuy\u1ec3n th\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, n\u01a1i t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng l\u1ee5a c\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"669\">L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p ki\u00eau sa v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y c\u1ea3m x\u00fac c\u1ee7a hoa h\u1ed3ng, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury \u2013 sang tr\u1ecdng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, \u0111\u1ec1 cao ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9. M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trao g\u1eedi b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"692\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"1697\">\n<li data-section-id=\"5zhbay\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"733\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: KLVTLIMITED HONG HONGDO<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cie3wi\" data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"835\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a: C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"adaws1\" data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"855\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9: Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qmw6bj\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"909\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1h89l7v\" data-start=\"910\" data-end=\"935\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc: 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c71cgu\" data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"964\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u: 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pv8klw\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"985\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft: Hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxzaw4\" data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1033\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt: V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b626d3\" data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1116\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd: M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"g0dc41\" data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1197\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc: H\u1ed3ng ph\u1ea5n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa h\u1ed3ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u00e0 gam xanh t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l901a9\" data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1327\">Phong c\u00e1ch: Art Luxury, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ve252\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1470\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng: Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m6ylhu\" data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1625\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng: Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 tri \u00e2n.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"n2hccs\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1676\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i: H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ih9ok6\" data-start=\"1677\" data-end=\"1697\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t: 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"1699\" data-end=\"1739\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1831\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"2105\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e0u v\u1ebd chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac. C\u00e1c c\u00e1nh hoa, nh\u00e0nh c\u00e2y v\u00e0 t\u00e1n l\u00e1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd theo b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c c\u00f3 ch\u1ee7 \u00fd, \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1eeba n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1eeba gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3ng l\u1ee5a tho\u00e1ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2331\">B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eb7c. Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u00e0ng l\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c bu\u00f4ng theo th\u00e2n \u00e1o, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng nh\u01b0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u00f9ng t\u1eebng n\u1ebfp l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2491\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ed1t l\u00f5i c\u1ee7a d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt SenSilk: \u0111\u01b0a h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda ra kh\u1ecfi khung tranh v\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ek510k\" data-start=\"2493\" data-end=\"2540\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2620\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p, t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2784\">Trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf SenSilk, hoa h\u1ed3ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c khai th\u00e1c theo h\u01b0\u1edbng qu\u00e1 r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 m\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2902\">Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u1ed3ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt gi\u1eefa n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa n\u00e9t c\u1ed5 \u0111i\u1ec3n v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n th\u1eddi trang hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"3071\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u00fd do thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u2013 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1ec1 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mang theo m\u1ed9t th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-8815\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2021_05_22_17_36_IMG_5388-1-1024x872.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"305\" height=\"260\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3073\" data-end=\"3108\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3214\">Art Luxury \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n qua s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3216\" data-end=\"3443\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng s\u1ef1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c sang tr\u1ecdng. Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb n\u1eb1m \u1edf n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, nh\u1eefng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1eb1ng th\u1eddi gian, s\u1ef1 kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m quan ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3445\" data-end=\"3609\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef y\u00eau c\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng; y\u00eau nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ph\u00eda sau m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7648\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Rose-Paint-Silk-made-by-SenSilk-Vietnam-1-1-1024x785.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"232\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"8wlwn4\" data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3642\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa H\u1ed3ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3743\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3745\" data-end=\"3870\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh, s\u1eafc hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3872\" data-end=\"4008\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4010\" data-end=\"4177\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n quanh c\u1ed5, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4179\" data-end=\"4278\">Kh\u0103n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cu\u1ed9n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t chi ti\u1ebft th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5026\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Rose-Paint-Silk-made-by-SenSilk-Vietnam-7-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"309\" height=\"232\" \/><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4316\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4318\" data-end=\"4403\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4638\">\n<li data-section-id=\"dfnd8z\" data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4425\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dqujgm\" data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4447\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"362j08\" data-start=\"4448\" data-end=\"4466\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12cps39\" data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4499\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18zqmb0\" data-start=\"4500\" data-end=\"4523\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kp7ghg\" data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4549\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19jrzfo\" data-start=\"4550\" data-end=\"4598\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gqsqf1\" data-start=\"4599\" data-end=\"4638\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4640\" data-end=\"4785\">M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed5i theo nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch, t\u1eeb ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho nh\u1eefng bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4332\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Khan-Lua-Ve-Tay-SenSilk-Limited-Rose-Painting-Silk_result-1-1024x799.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"236\" \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1xl6cb7\" data-start=\"4787\" data-end=\"4849\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Ph\u1ee5 N\u1eef \u2013 Trao m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m, g\u1eedi m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4948\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi trao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"5076\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ba gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb: ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5231\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t trong h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh \u2013 t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m m\u1edf h\u1ed9p v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5233\" data-end=\"5260\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5455\">\n<li data-section-id=\"yhmq0s\" data-start=\"5262\" data-end=\"5266\">M\u1eb9<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15apr9n\" data-start=\"5267\" data-end=\"5290\">V\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1eddi<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ov73ur\" data-start=\"5291\" data-end=\"5302\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gljw1v\" data-start=\"5303\" data-end=\"5316\">Ch\u1ecb, em g\u00e1i<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"kapopa\" data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5328\">B\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"q0dttj\" data-start=\"5329\" data-end=\"5341\">\u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1a6vztt\" data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5357\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yzi3aj\" data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5380\">L\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"t8kx3w\" data-start=\"5381\" data-end=\"5397\">\u0110\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p n\u1eef<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ojy04z\" data-start=\"5398\" data-end=\"5409\">Gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1sgnizx\" data-start=\"5410\" data-end=\"5455\">Nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5457\" data-end=\"5598\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, ng\u00e0y c\u01b0\u1edbi, ng\u00e0y c\u1ee7a m\u1eb9, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5618\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5620\" data-end=\"5688\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5836\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n th\u00eam qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5838\" data-end=\"6020\">T\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a, t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y trong h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, m\u1ed7i chi ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tinh t\u1ebf, trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a SenSilk.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"14q46y2\" data-start=\"6022\" data-end=\"6070\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Limited \u2013 Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mang theo<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6072\" data-end=\"6139\">Kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay mang trong m\u00ecnh d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6141\" data-end=\"6290\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u01b0a h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i, ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n ph\u1ea3i c\u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6403\">Ch\u00ednh s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6405\" data-end=\"6534\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6536\" data-end=\"6556\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6558\" data-end=\"6657\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6659\" data-end=\"6756\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6758\" data-end=\"6822\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6824\" data-end=\"6961\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6963\" data-end=\"6984\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6986\" data-end=\"7372\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vo5lta\" data-start=\"6986\" data-end=\"7028\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1823xro\" data-start=\"7029\" data-end=\"7067\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19m64vt\" data-start=\"7068\" data-end=\"7114\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qxve9m\" data-start=\"7115\" data-end=\"7145\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cyt2h4\" data-start=\"7146\" data-end=\"7196\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l3olhy\" data-start=\"7197\" data-end=\"7230\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0\/\u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1hjkovm\" data-start=\"7231\" data-end=\"7300\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"v1clai\" data-start=\"7301\" data-end=\"7372\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7374\" data-end=\"7395\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"13v34fr\" data-start=\"7397\" data-end=\"7452\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a hoa h\u1ed3ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7454\" data-end=\"7547\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7549\" data-end=\"7587\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7589\" data-end=\"7742\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7744\" data-end=\"7777\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7779\" data-end=\"7880\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ca06sw\" data-start=\"7882\" data-end=\"7928\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7930\" data-end=\"8090\">R\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p. Hoa h\u1ed3ng mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m, v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"p5jjko\" data-start=\"8092\" data-end=\"8139\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 8\/3 v\u00e0 20\/10 kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8141\" data-end=\"8267\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u1eeba mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"8269\" data-end=\"8307\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8309\" data-end=\"8410\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh ho\u1eb7c pastel.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"8412\" data-end=\"8464\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8466\" data-end=\"8613\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5 d\u00e0nh cho ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2900000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.900.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.900.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14627,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/2021_05_22_17_36_IMG_5388.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/2021_05_22_17_36_IMG_5388-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1897px) 100vw, 1897px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"2021_05_22_17_36_IMG_5388","alt":""},{"id":14629,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/khan-lua-bao-loc-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-2-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/khan-lua-bao-loc-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-2-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1617px) 100vw, 1617px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"