 nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c.","slug":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c."}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 15 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Hand Painted Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14566","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14566","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14566&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14551,"name":"100% Silk Scarf &#8211;  Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen | SenSilk","slug":"100-silk-scarves-hand-painted-khan-thoi-trang-cao-cap-ve-sen-viet","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/100-silk-scarves-hand-painted-khan-thoi-trang-cao-cap-ve-sen-viet\/","sku":"KLVT160 HOASEN","short_description":"<p data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"399\">100% Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 h\u00f2a quy\u1ec7n gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"154\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"683\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen thanh l\u1ecbch, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"606\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, d\u00e0nh cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"706\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"1819\">. <strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"727\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 HOASEN<br data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"745\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"816\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"867\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"879\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"899\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"931\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"948\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"963\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"979\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"998\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1013\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa sen<br data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1024\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1039\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1078\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1105\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1167\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1184\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1307\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1322\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1438\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1601\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1623\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1736\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1738\" data-end=\"1751\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1793\" data-is-only-node=\"\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1812\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"font-size: 23.040001px;color: #333333\">C\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"2083\">Hoa sen l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh g\u1eafn b\u00f3 s\u00e2u s\u1eafc v\u1edbi v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 m\u1ef9 c\u1ea3m Vi\u1ec7t Nam. V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a sen tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c \u1ea5y l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2255\">T\u1eebng \u0111\u00f3a sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam nh\u01b0ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-37\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/dsc00314-copy_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/DSC00314-Copy_result-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/2023_09_12_19_25_img_1278_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2023_09_12_19_25_IMG_1278_result-scaled-300x200.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/b8000f2a66eea4b0fdff90_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"207\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/b8000f2a66eea4b0fdff90_result-300x207.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div class=\"_1aa6\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2297\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2514\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2327\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u tr\u1edf n\u00ean thanh tho\u00e1t, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2654\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2656\" data-end=\"2669\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2885\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa sen mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2729\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2884\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<div id=\"gallery-38\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-viet-nam-8\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-Viet-Nam-8-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-viet-nam-6\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-Viet-Nam-6-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-viet-nam-11\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-dep-nhat-Viet-Nam-11-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2898\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2900\" data-end=\"3020\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2915\" data-end=\"2930\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3022\" data-end=\"3140\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tham d\u1ef1 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3142\" data-end=\"3161\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3445\"><strong data-start=\"3163\" data-end=\"3216\">100% Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen<\/strong> l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang nh\u00e3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3249\" data-end=\"3318\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen mang \u0111\u1eadm d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3714\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3460\" data-end=\"3513\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3602\" data-end=\"3651\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3716\" data-end=\"3734\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3736\" data-end=\"3946\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3805\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Hoa sen l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, trong khi t\u1eebng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3948\" data-end=\"4085\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 mong mu\u1ed1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4087\" data-end=\"4105\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4107\" data-end=\"4323\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4134\" data-end=\"4154\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Bao b\u00ec ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng, t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4345\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4543\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4566\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4568\" data-end=\"4735\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4737\" data-end=\"4853\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4855\" data-end=\"4861\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4972\"><strong data-start=\"4863\" data-end=\"4897\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4897\" data-end=\"4900\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4917\" data-end=\"4936\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5126\"><strong data-start=\"4974\" data-end=\"5022\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5022\" data-end=\"5025\" \/>Hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5038\" data-end=\"5077\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5286\"><strong data-start=\"5128\" data-end=\"5180\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5180\" data-end=\"5183\" \/>C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5553\"><strong data-start=\"5288\" data-end=\"5351\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5351\" data-end=\"5354\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5479\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5555\" data-end=\"5697\"><strong data-start=\"5555\" data-end=\"5593\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5593\" data-end=\"5596\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5827\"><strong data-start=\"5699\" data-end=\"5734\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5734\" data-end=\"5737\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5762\" data-end=\"5804\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2250000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.250.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.00