ame":"qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng","slug":"qua-tang-truyen-thong","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-truyen-thong\/"},{"id":2098,"name":"silk handmade","slug":"silk-handmade","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silk-handmade\/"},{"id":548,"name":"silk painting","slug":"silk-painting","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silk-painting\/"},{"id":1728,"name":"silk scarves","slug":"silk-scarves","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silk-scarves\/"}],"brands":[{"id":2869,"name":"Sen Silk","slug":"sen-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/thuong-hieu\/sen-silk\/"}],"attributes":[],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 21 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;100% Silk Scarf &#8211;  Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14551","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14551","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14551&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14537,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n SenSilk &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng M\u1eb9 Y\u00eau","slug":"khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-sensilk-qua-tang-me-handmade-gift","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-sensilk-qua-tang-me-handmade-gift\/","sku":"KLVT160 MAUDONDO","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"295\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"124\" data-end=\"143\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, g\u1ee3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh nh\u00e3, \u0111\u1eb1m th\u1eafm v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng s\u00e2u s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"297\" data-end=\"552\">V\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9, \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng. M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba \u0111\u1eb9p trong h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c, v\u1eeba g\u1eedi g\u1eafm t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m qua gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"575\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"1692\">. <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"596\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 MAUDON<br data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"614\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"685\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"722\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"736\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"748\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"768\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"817\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"848\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"867\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"882\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n<br data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"912\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"978\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1040\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1057\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1180\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1195\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1296\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1311\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1474\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1496\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1609\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1624\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1666\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1685\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-section-id=\"vb86kp\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1718\">C\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1970\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch trong m\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1eb7n, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng. L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y, SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1972\" data-end=\"2142\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3, gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh tho\u00e1t c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi v\u1eabn \u0111\u1ee7 trang tr\u1ecdng cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-39\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/sensilk-mun-25\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"204\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/SenSilk-Mun-25-300x204.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/0e7b4cb16af4b8aae1e518_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"229\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/0e7b4cb16af4b8aae1e518_result-300x229.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/sensilk-mun-64\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/SenSilk-Mun-64-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2184\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2401\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2195\" data-end=\"2214\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u tr\u1edf n\u00ean d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng, t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho t\u1eebng l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2403\" data-end=\"2556\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, tinh t\u1ebf, gi\u1eef tr\u1ecdn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m ch\u00fat.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/vietnamese-silk-scarves-12-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-11431\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/vietnamese-silk-scarves-12-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"234\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2571\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2573\" data-end=\"2780\">Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2601\" data-end=\"2626\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2779\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2782\" data-end=\"2793\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2795\" data-end=\"2903\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2825\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"3014\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t d\u00e0nh cho gia \u0111\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3016\" data-end=\"3035\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3317\"><strong data-start=\"3037\" data-end=\"3076\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n SenSilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3112\" data-end=\"3171\">m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP<\/strong>. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n g\u1ee3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p vi\u00ean m\u00e3n, thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3586\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3385\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3523\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3606\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3841\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3677\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u1eddi gian, trong khi t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3843\" data-end=\"3990\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u0103m ch\u00fat t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"3992\" data-end=\"4010\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4244\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4059\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Bao b\u00ec \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb ch\u1ec9n chu \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef th\u00e2n y\u00eau.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4246\" data-end=\"4266\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4268\" data-end=\"4457\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4459\" data-end=\"4480\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4649\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4767\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4769\" data-end=\"4775\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4886\"><strong data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4811\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4814\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4831\" data-end=\"4850\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"5045\"><strong data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"4940\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4940\" data-end=\"4943\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"4957\" data-end=\"4996\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5221\"><strong data-start=\"5047\" data-end=\"5089\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9 kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5089\" data-end=\"5092\" \/>C\u00f3. Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef th\u00e2n y\u00eau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5488\"><strong data-start=\"5223\" data-end=\"5286\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5289\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5367\" data-end=\"5414\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5640\"><strong data-start=\"5490\" data-end=\"5528\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5528\" data-end=\"5531\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5642\" data-end=\"5770\"><strong data-start=\"5642\" data-end=\"5677\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5677\" data-end=\"5680\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5705\" data-end=\"5747\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2300000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.300.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.300.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14538,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/893dcbde5c1a9e44c70b125_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/893dcbde5c1a9e44c70b125_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"893dcbde5c1a9e44c70b125_result","alt":""},{"id":14548,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/SenSilk-Mun-61_result-scaled-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/SenSilk-Mun-61_result-scaled-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1567px) 100vw, 1567px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"SenSilk Mun (61)_result","alt":""}