00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"585\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tinh t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"539\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>, mang theo v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"608\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"1721\">. <strong data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"629\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 HOAMAI<br data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"647\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"718\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"769\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"781\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"801\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"833\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"850\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"865\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"881\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"915\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa mai<br data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"926\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"941\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"980\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1007\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1069\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1086\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1209\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1224\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1325\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1340\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1503\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1525\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1638\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1653\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1692\" data-end=\"1695\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1714\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1749\" data-end=\"1984\">Hoa mai l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong m\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t g\u1eafn v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p. T\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng \u1ea5y, SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh mai thanh tho\u00e1t l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"2156\">C\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n, \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa mai gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh tao v\u1ed1n c\u00f3 m\u00e0 v\u1eabn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-40\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-ve-hoa-mai-sensilk-10\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-hoa-mai-SenSilk-10.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/2020_09_03_18_43_img_6988_result-2\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2020_09_03_18_43_IMG_6988_result-1-scaled-300x225.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-ve-hoa-mai-sensilk-8\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"203\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-hoa-mai-SenSilk-8-scaled-300x203.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div class=\"_1aa6\" style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2198\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2408\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2209\" data-end=\"2228\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng c\u00e0nh v\u00e0 c\u00e1nh hoa mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u1edf n\u00ean thanh tho\u00e1t v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2410\" data-end=\"2527\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c tinh t\u1ebf, g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2542\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2544\" data-end=\"2749\">Hoa Mai mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2593\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2748\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2762\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2764\" data-end=\"2872\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2794\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2874\" data-end=\"2978\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tham d\u1ef1 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5, T\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2020_09_03_18_44_IMG_6992_result-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4032\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2020_09_03_18_44_IMG_6992_result-1024x829.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"284\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"2999\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3266\"><strong data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3045\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Mai<\/strong> l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang nh\u00e3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3078\" data-end=\"3147\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa mai mang n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 g\u1eedi g\u1eafm l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3535\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3334\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3423\" data-end=\"3472\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3537\" data-end=\"3555\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3557\" data-end=\"3779\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3573\" data-end=\"3626\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa mai mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac, trong khi t\u1eebng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3904\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n theo tinh th\u1ea7n tinh gi\u1ea3n, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"3906\" data-end=\"3924\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3926\" data-end=\"4149\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"3953\" data-end=\"3973\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Bao b\u00ec ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng, t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4151\" data-end=\"4171\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4380\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa mai tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u s\u1eafc th\u00e1i \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4382\" data-end=\"4403\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4405\" data-end=\"4572\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4690\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4692\" data-end=\"4698\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4809\"><strong data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4734\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4737\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4773\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4964\"><strong data-start=\"4811\" data-end=\"4859\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa mai \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4862\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"4876\" data-end=\"4915\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5149\"><strong data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5018\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5021\" \/>C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5, T\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5416\"><strong data-start=\"5151\" data-end=\"5214\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5214\" data-end=\"5217\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5295\" data-end=\"5342\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5568\"><strong data-start=\"5418\" data-end=\"5456\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5456\" data-end=\"5459\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa mai mang \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5698\"><strong data-start=\"5570\" data-end=\"5605\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5608\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5633\" data-end=\"5675\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.200.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.200.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":12156,"src":"https:\