00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 mang \u0111\u1eadm n\u00e9t duy\u00ean \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"685\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tinh t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang nh\u00e3 cho <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"608\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, d\u00e0nh cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"708\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"1831\">. <strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"729\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT160 DONGTIENDO<br data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"751\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"822\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"859\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"873\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"885\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"887\" data-end=\"905\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<br data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"937\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"954\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 160 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"985\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1004\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1019\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n<br data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1036\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1051\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1090\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1117\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1179\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1196\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1334\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1435\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1437\" data-end=\"1450\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1610\" data-end=\"1613\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1635\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u1edbi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1748\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1763\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1805\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1807\" data-end=\"1824\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"2126\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 g\u1ea7n g\u0169i, th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i li\u00ean t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn ni\u1ec1m vui, s\u1ef1 may m\u1eafn v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p. SenSilk l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb d\u00e1ng hoa tr\u00f2n \u0111\u1ea7y c\u00f9ng nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang s\u1eafc th\u00e1i t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2128\" data-end=\"2284\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n theo l\u1ed1i h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2286\" data-end=\"2326\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2565\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2337\" data-end=\"2356\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng \u0111\u00f3a hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u1edf n\u00ean trong tr\u1ebbo, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2567\" data-end=\"2705\">N\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t trong t\u1eebng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, n\u01a1i ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 b\u00e0n tay c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-43\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/509e76bdfb992ec7778838\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"231\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/509e76bdfb992ec7778838-300x231.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/4ec59a65175dc2039b4c7_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"210\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/4ec59a65175dc2039b4c7_result.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/4aa81dd790f345ad1ce247\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"218\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/4aa81dd790f345ad1ce247-300x218.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2707\" data-end=\"2720\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2722\" data-end=\"2920\">Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2777\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"2919\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2922\" data-end=\"2933\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2935\" data-end=\"3043\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2950\" data-end=\"2965\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3152\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tham d\u1ef1 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3173\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3431\"><strong data-start=\"3175\" data-end=\"3229\">Hand Painted Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n<\/strong> l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3260\" data-end=\"3329\">doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang s\u1eafc th\u00e1i vui t\u01b0\u01a1i, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eedi g\u1eafm l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3433\" data-end=\"3700\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3446\" data-end=\"3499\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3637\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3702\" data-end=\"3720\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3936\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3738\" data-end=\"3791\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p g\u1ea7n g\u0169i, trong khi t\u1eebng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang cho t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3938\" data-end=\"4087\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m ch\u00fat c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4089\" data-end=\"4107\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4317\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4136\" data-end=\"4156\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Bao b\u00ec ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng, t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4319\" data-end=\"4339\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4341\" data-end=\"4527\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4529\" data-end=\"4550\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4719\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4721\" data-end=\"4837\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4845\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4956\"><strong data-start=\"4847\" data-end=\"4881\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4884\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4901\" data-end=\"4920\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"5117\"><strong data-start=\"4958\" data-end=\"5012\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5015\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5029\" data-end=\"5068\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5284\"><strong data-start=\"5119\" data-end=\"5153\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5153\" data-end=\"5156\" \/>Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1, ni\u1ec1m vui, s\u1ef1 may m\u1eafn v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p, v\u00ec v\u1eady ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5437\"><strong data-start=\"5286\" data-end=\"5338\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5341\" \/>C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5439\" data-end=\"5704\"><strong data-start=\"5439\" data-end=\"5502\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5502\" data-end=\"5505\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5583\" data-end=\"5630\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5835\"><strong data-start=\"5706\" data-end=\"5744\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5744\" data-end=\"5747\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"5965\"><strong data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"5872\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5872\" data-end=\"5875\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5900\" data-end=\"5942\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2250000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.250.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.250.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14489,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/509e76bdfb992ec7778838.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/509e76bdfb992ec7778838-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"509e76bdfb992ec7778838","alt":""},{"id":14491,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/0cfa5441d9790c2755684_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/0cfa5441d9790c2755684_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"0cfa5441d9790c2755684_result","alt":""},{"id":14493,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/4aa81dd790f345ad1ce247-1.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/4aa81dd790f345ad1ce247-1-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"4aa81dd790f345ad1ce247","alt":""},{"id":14495,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/4ec59a65175dc2039b4c7_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/4ec59a65175dc2039b4c7_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"4ec59a65175dc2039b4c7_result","alt":""},{"id":14497,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/9f0ff2617e59ab07f24812_result.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/9f0ff2617e59ab07f24812_result-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"9f0ff2617e59ab07f24812_result","alt":""},{"id":14499,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/92c72584a9a07cfe25b15.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/92c72584a9a07cfe25b15-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"92c72584a9a07cfe25b15","alt":""}],"categories":[{"id":2215,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product-category\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay\/"}],"tags":[{"id":1968,"name":"100% silk","slug":"100-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/100-silk\/"},{"id":2112,"name":"handmade gift","slug":"handmade-gift","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/handmade-gift\/"},{"id":703,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"khan-lua-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-cao-cap\/"},{"id":1803,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang","slug":"khan-lua-thoi-trang","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-thoi-trang\/"},{"id":547,"name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay","slug":"khan-lua-ve-tay","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-lua-ve-tay\/"},{"id":1420,"name":"kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 l\u1ee5a","slug":"khan-quang-co-lua","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-quang-co-lua\/"},{"id":2304,"name":"kh\u0103n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p","slug":"khan-to-tam-cao-cap","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/khan-to-tam-cao-cap\/"},{"id":2316,"name":"l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m vi\u1ec7t nam","slug":"lua-to-tam-viet-nam","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/lua-to-tam-viet-nam\/"},{"id":1805,"name":"l\u1ee5a vi\u1ec7t","slug":"lua-viet","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/lua-viet\/"},{"id":630,"name":"qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p","slug":"qua-tang-doanh-nghiep","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-doanh-nghiep\/"},{"id":1649,"name":"qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p","slug":"qua-tang-dang-cap","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-dang-cap\/"},{"id":566,"name":"qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c","slug":"qua-tang-doi-tac","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/qua-tang-doi-tac\/"},{"id":1967,"name":"silk shawl","slug":"silk-shawl","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/silk-shawl\/"},{"id":1700,"name":"vietnam gift","slug":"vietnam-gift","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/tag\/vietnam-gift\/"}],"brands":[{"id":2869,"name":"Sen Silk","slug":"sen-silk","link":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/thuong-hieu\/sen-silk\/"}],"attributes":[{"id":0,"name":"Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p Vi\u1ec7t Nam\nM\u00e0u v\u1ebd cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u, an to\u00e0n cho da.","slug":"100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p Vi\u1ec7t Nam\nM\u00e0u v\u1ebd cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u, an to\u00e0n cho da."}]},{"id":0,"name":"\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, thi\u1ec7p sensilk, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y","slug":"Kh\u0103n, h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0, thi\u1ec7p sensilk, t\u00fai gi\u1ea5y"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Giao h\u00e0ng","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ship to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c","slug":"Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ship to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i\/tr\u1ea3","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c.","slug":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c."}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 20 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Hand Painted Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14488","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14488","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14488&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14486,"name":"Art Of Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa B\u1eb1ng L\u0103ng SenSilk","slug":"art-of-silk-khan-quang-co-lua-ve-tay-hoa-bang-lang-sensilk","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/art-of-silk-khan-quang-co-lua-ve-tay-hoa-bang-lang-sensilk\/","sku":"KLVT160 BANGLANG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"155\" data-end=\"401\">Hand Painted Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"244\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong> v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 mang \u0111\u1eadm n\u00e9t duy\u00ean \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"403\" data-end=\"685\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tinh t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang nh\u00e3 cho <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"608\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, d\u00e0nh cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>","description":"<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"2113\">Hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng g\u1ee3i nh\u1edb \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng m\u00f9a h\u00e8 d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng v\u1edbi s\u1eafc t\u00edm m\u1ed9ng m\u01a1 v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ed7i th\u00e2n thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a ph\u1ed1 Vi\u1ec7t. T\u1eeb h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh nh\u1eefng ch\u00f9m hoa m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u1ea5y, SenSilk t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang c\u1ea3m x\u00fac nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, thanh tho\u00e1t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2115\" data-end=\"2258\">N\u00e9t v\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a hoa, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2300\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2302\" data-end=\"2505\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <strong data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2330\">l\u1ee5a 100% t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1eebng ch\u00f9m hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng. B\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a m\u1ec1m nh\u1eb9, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u1eaft s\u00e1ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean gi\u00fap s\u1eafc t\u00edm tr\u1edf n\u00ean d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2628\">N\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m ch\u00fat c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n trong t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-18-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7528\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-18-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"301\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ibwac2\" data-start=\"2630\" data-end=\"2643\">Phong c\u00e1ch<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2645\" data-end=\"2847\">Hoa B\u1eb1ng L\u0103ng mang phong c\u00e1ch <strong data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2700\">Art Luxury thanh l\u1ecbch<\/strong>, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u ch\u1ea5t th\u01a1. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n theo tinh th\u1ea7n <strong data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2846\">Quiet Luxury<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"de7s3w\" data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2860\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2862\" data-end=\"2982\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2892\">160 \u00d7 55 cm<\/strong>, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2984\" data-end=\"3085\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y, \u0111i l\u00e0m, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, tham d\u1ef1 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1qjv3hs\" data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3106\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3389\"><strong data-start=\"3108\" data-end=\"3172\">Art Of Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa B\u1eb1ng L\u0103ng SenSilk<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3271\">ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1edbi c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t Nam, mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3391\" data-end=\"3658\">SenSilk nh\u1eadn <strong data-start=\"3404\" data-end=\"3457\">thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang<\/strong> cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, t\u1eeb \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3595\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ho\u1eb7c th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Bang-Lang-Tim-SenSilk-3.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5603\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Bang-Lang-Tim-SenSilk-3-1024x866.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"381\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"ba22zz\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3678\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3680\" data-end=\"3907\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3749\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng<\/strong> t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac, trong khi t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3909\" data-end=\"4062\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau hoa, y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh th\u00e2n thu\u1ed9c trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4082\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4084\" data-end=\"4310\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n trong <strong data-start=\"4111\" data-end=\"4131\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, \u0111i k\u00e8m t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk. Bao b\u00ec ch\u1ec9n chu gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng, t\u1eeb qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ebfn qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"4312\" data-end=\"4332\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4334\" data-end=\"4539\">C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n quanh c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf. S\u1eafc t\u00edm c\u1ee7a hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f3 gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"4541\" data-end=\"4562\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4564\" data-end=\"4731\">N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9 b\u1eb1ng tay v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m gi\u1eb7t chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng d\u00e0nh cho l\u1ee5a. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m l\u00e2u, kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft m\u1ea1nh v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh ph\u01a1i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4733\" data-end=\"4849\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng, n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryhf7\" data-start=\"4851\" data-end=\"4857\">FAQ<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4968\"><strong data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4893\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/strong><br data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4896\" \/>Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"4913\" data-end=\"4932\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5129\"><strong data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"5024\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5027\" \/>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5041\" data-end=\"5080\">v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/strong>, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5331\"><strong data-start=\"5131\" data-end=\"5179\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5179\" data-end=\"5182\" \/>C\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1edbi c\u1ea3nh s\u1eafc Vi\u1ec7t Nam, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5598\"><strong data-start=\"5333\" data-end=\"5396\">SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5396\" data-end=\"5399\" \/>C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong data-start=\"5477\" data-end=\"5524\">v\u1ebd tay, th\u00eau tay, in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5749\"><strong data-start=\"5600\" data-end=\"5638\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5638\" data-end=\"5641\" \/>C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng mang n\u00e9t thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5751\" data-end=\"5879\"><strong data-start=\"5751\" data-end=\"5786\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/strong><br data-start=\"5786\" data-end=\"5789\" \/>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng trong <strong data-start=\"5814\" data-end=\"5856\">h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2050000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"2050000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.200.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.200.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.050.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.050.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":8147,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-40-scaled-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/07\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-40-scaled-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1674px) 100vw, 1674px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-40","alt":""},{"id":7528,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-18-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-18-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p v\u1ebd b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng t\u00edm SenSilk (18)","alt":""},{"id":7530,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-28-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-bang-lang-tim-SenSilk-28-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p v\u1ebd b\u1eb1ng l\u0103ng t\u00edm SenSilk (28)","alt":""},{"id":5603,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Bang-Lang-Tim-SenSilk-3.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/12\/lua-to-tam-ve-tay-Ban