a3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c.","slug":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c."}]},{"id":0,"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"180x55cm","slug":"180x55cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 14 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Sen Silk | Thi\u1ebft K\u1ebf Hoa Lan&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14480","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14480","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14480&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14478,"name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n | SenSilk","slug":"khan-choang-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-mau-don","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-choang-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-mau-don\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE MAUDON","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"333\">Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y cu\u1ed1n h\u00fat.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"535\">L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p vi\u00ean m\u00e3n c\u1ee7a hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u1edbi n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a thanh nh\u00e3, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n mang tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng trong th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"558\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"1665\">. <strong data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"579\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE MAUDON<br data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"677\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"714\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"728\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"760\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"800\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"817\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"832\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"848\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"867\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"882\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n<br data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"897\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"912\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"978\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1040\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1054\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n nude thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1124\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1141\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1251\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1266\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1388\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1403\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t; th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt, 8\/3, 20\/10, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1584\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1586\" data-end=\"1599\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1641\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1660\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"105ynoa\" data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1720\">Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 vi\u00ean m\u00e3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1818\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch trong ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1eb7n, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1820\" data-end=\"2023\">T\u1eebng l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh hoa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u, mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c v\u1eeba m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u1eeba quy\u1ebfn r\u0169. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u1ea5y tr\u1edf n\u00ean nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2025\" data-end=\"2157\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n v\u00e0o thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n thanh l\u1ecbch, kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3, \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa c\u00f3 kh\u00f4ng gian h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2232\">N\u1ec1n nude gi\u00fap t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf n\u00ean trang nh\u00e3, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-7-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7584\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-7-1024x726.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"299\" height=\"212\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2274\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2346\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn tinh t\u1ebf v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2464\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n c\u1ea7n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u00e0u, \u0111\u1ed9 lan v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2561\">Tr\u00ean ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean nh\u1edd \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ee3i l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2697\">Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 v\u00e0 \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda \u0111ang chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-10-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7581\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-10-1024x782.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"229\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2734\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2808\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2810\" data-end=\"2901\">N\u1ec1n nude t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, trong khi nh\u1eefng c\u1ee5m hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2903\" data-end=\"3025\">S\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u00f2a v\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang kh\u00e1c nhau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3159\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury m\u00e0 SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i: sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng chi ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1e5l8e3\" data-start=\"3161\" data-end=\"3198\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3266\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3378\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be, nude ho\u1eb7c pastel, hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3380\" data-end=\"3492\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi, blazer v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3494\" data-end=\"3621\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai, t\u1ea1o th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i s\u1ef1 thanh tho\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3623\" data-end=\"3745\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3783\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3785\" data-end=\"3836\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm mang \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3873\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3875\" data-end=\"3909\">Cho\u00e0ng vai khi \u0111i l\u00e0m ho\u1eb7c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3911\" data-end=\"3927\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3929\" data-end=\"3944\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3946\" data-end=\"3974\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3999\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4001\" data-end=\"4047\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4097\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"efukgy\" data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4137\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4139\" data-end=\"4282\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, v\u00ec v\u1eady r\u1ea5t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4284\" data-end=\"4396\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4398\" data-end=\"4521\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, ch\u1ecb em g\u00e1i, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4523\" data-end=\"4653\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4797\">V\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam th\u00f4ng qua m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"4799\" data-end=\"4817\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4819\" data-end=\"4887\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4889\" data-end=\"4982\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4984\" data-end=\"5132\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1vfdjvd\" data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5183\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Limited \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5185\" data-end=\"5290\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t t\u1eeb qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5363\">M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t v\u1ec1 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 lan c\u1ee7a m\u00e0u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5365\" data-end=\"5472\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh c\u00e0ng l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5474\" data-end=\"5603\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1edf h\u1eefu kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng cao c\u1ea5p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"5605\" data-end=\"5625\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5627\" data-end=\"5726\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5728\" data-end=\"5829\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5831\" data-end=\"5895\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5897\" data-end=\"6029\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, nude v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6031\" data-end=\"6052\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6054\" data-end=\"6094\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6096\" data-end=\"6132\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6134\" data-end=\"6178\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6180\" data-end=\"6208\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6210\" data-end=\"6258\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6260\" data-end=\"6296\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6298\" data-end=\"6365\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6367\" data-end=\"6436\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"6438\" data-end=\"6459\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k2jonh\" data-start=\"6461\" data-end=\"6522\">Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6524\" data-end=\"6627\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"6629\" data-end=\"6667\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6669\" data-end=\"6825\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"6827\" data-end=\"6860\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"6862\" data-end=\"6980\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8vzlgo\" data-start=\"6982\" data-end=\"7014\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7016\" data-end=\"7101\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng, vi\u00ean m\u00e3n, th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7150\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7152\" data-end=\"7267\">C\u00f3. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogyly2\" data-start=\"7269\" data-end=\"7327\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7329\" data-end=\"7438\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"7440\" data-end=\"7478\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7480\" data-end=\"7555\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, nude, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"7557\" data-end=\"7609\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7611\" data-end=\"7752\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2800000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.800.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.800.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":7586,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-10-1-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-10-1-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n SenSilk Limited (10)","alt":""},{"id":7588,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-12-Copy_result-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-mau-don-SenSilk-Limited-12-Copy_result-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","th