l,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"H\u1ed3ng, Tr\u1eafng, Nude, Xanh","slug":"H\u1ed3ng, Tr\u1eafng, Nude, Xanh"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 13 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Mai &#8211; Qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14460","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14460","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14460&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14456,"name":"Hand Painted Silk SENSILK &#8211; Kh\u0103n Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay C\u00fac V\u00e0ng","slug":"hand-painting-silk-scarf-sensilk-khan-quang-co-ve-tay-cuc-vang","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/hand-painting-silk-scarf-sensilk-khan-quang-co-ve-tay-cuc-vang\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED HONG CUCVANG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"256\" data-end=\"551\">Hand Painted Silk SENSILK &#8211; Kh\u0103n Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay C\u00fac V\u00e0ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a c\u00fac v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"796\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p, trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 tr\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng. Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a h\u1ed3ng nh\u1eb9, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 n\u1eef t\u00ednh nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn sang tr\u1ecdng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury v\u00e0 Quiet Luxury m\u00e0 SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"819\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"821\" data-end=\"2139\">. <strong data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"840\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED HONG CUCVANG<br data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"939\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"976\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"990\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1002\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1022\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1062\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1079\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1094\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1110\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1144\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1160\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1175\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1214\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1241\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1303\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1317\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n h\u1ed3ng thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1409\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1534\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1656\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1671\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho sinh nh\u1eadt, 8\/3, 20\/10, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1846\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1868\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2058\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2060\" data-end=\"2073\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2115\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2117\" data-end=\"2134\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"138dj8u\" data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2184\">Hoa C\u00fac V\u00e0ng \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao v\u00e0 \u1ea5m \u00e1p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2312\">Hoa c\u00fac l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, g\u1ee3i n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao, b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2314\" data-end=\"2450\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng. Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a h\u1ed3ng nh\u1eb9, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a c\u00fac t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1eeba m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2624\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p gi\u1ea3n d\u1ecb nh\u01b0ng tinh t\u1ebf \u2013 n\u01a1i m\u1ed9t lo\u00e0i hoa quen thu\u1ed9c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e2ng l\u00ean th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"xvk9yu\" data-start=\"2626\" data-end=\"2671\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2673\" data-end=\"2774\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng n\u00e9t c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u00e0u tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2884\">M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a c\u00e1nh hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"3010\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng, gi\u00fap s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac thay \u0111\u1ed5i theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3012\" data-end=\"3131\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u00e0ng l\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi, t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t ph\u1eb3ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u00e0 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p class=\"justifyfull\" style=\"text-align: left\"><a style=\"font-size: 14.4px\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-cuc-SenSilk-3-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7611\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-cuc-SenSilk-3-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"205\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3168\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3170\" data-end=\"3263\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf C\u00fac V\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng theo \u0111u\u1ed5i s\u1ef1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 m\u00e0 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3265\" data-end=\"3357\">N\u1ec1n h\u1ed3ng t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, trong khi s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac mang \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3359\" data-end=\"3452\">S\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng n\u00e0y gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1eeba c\u00f3 t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1eeba d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng trong th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3454\" data-end=\"3590\">\u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3590\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-cuc-SenSilk-1-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7607\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-cuc-SenSilk-1-1024x827.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"245\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1rpdv5i\" data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3630\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay C\u00fac V\u00e0ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3697\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3699\" data-end=\"3826\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem, be ho\u1eb7c pastel, s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa c\u00fac tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn h\u00e0i h\u00f2a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3828\" data-end=\"3932\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"4060\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t v\u00f2ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4062\" data-end=\"4155\">Kh\u0103n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cu\u1ed9n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4157\" data-end=\"4193\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4269\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4306\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4327\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4329\" data-end=\"4345\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4347\" data-end=\"4377\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4379\" data-end=\"4400\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4402\" data-end=\"4425\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4427\" data-end=\"4473\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4523\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17659sy\" data-start=\"4525\" data-end=\"4569\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 trao g\u1eedi s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4571\" data-end=\"4656\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n mang theo m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4837\">Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng g\u1ee3i n\u00ean s\u1ef1 \u1ea5m \u00e1p, thanh tao v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4839\" data-end=\"4971\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, ch\u1ecb em g\u00e1i, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4973\" data-end=\"5103\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5105\" data-end=\"5243\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy4l6y\" data-start=\"5245\" data-end=\"5298\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5300\" data-end=\"5421\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5423\" data-end=\"5539\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5541\" data-end=\"5707\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng mang t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u01b0\u1ee3t ra ngo\u00e0i c\u00f4ng n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5709\" data-end=\"5803\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"5732\" data-end=\"5802\">s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5805\" data-end=\"5823\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5893\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5987\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5989\" data-end=\"6157\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay b\u00ean trong \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6159\" data-end=\"6179\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6181\" data-end=\"6280\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6383\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6385\" data-end=\"6449\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6451\" data-end=\"6592\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6594\" data-end=\"6615\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6617\" data-end=\"6657\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6659\" data-end=\"6695\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6697\" data-end=\"6741\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6743\" data-end=\"6771\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6773\" data-end=\"6821\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6823\" data-end=\"6859\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6861\" data-end=\"6928\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6930\" data-end=\"6999\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7001\" data-end=\"7022\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1jio146\" data-start=\"7024\" data-end=\"7079\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a C\u00fac V\u00e0ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7081\" data-end=\"7184\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7224\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7226\" data-end=\"7383\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7385\" data-end=\"7418\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7420\" data-end=\"7538\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"12g8aqo\" data-start=\"7540\" data-end=\"7573\">Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7575\" data-end=\"7660\">Hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 thanh tao, \u1ea5m \u00e1p, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"7662\" data-end=\"7709\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7711\" data-end=\"7837\">C\u00f3. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa c\u00fac v\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwoklx\" data-start=\"7839\" data-end=\"7880\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7882\" data-end=\"8029\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogyly2\" data-start=\"8031\" data-end=\"8089\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8091\" data-end=\"8232\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n b\u00e8, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"8234\" data-end=\"8272\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8274\" data-end=\"8354\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"8356\" data-end=\"8408\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8551\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2900000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.900.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.900.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14457,"src":"https:\/\/sensi