bu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12lw7sh\" data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"334\"><strong data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"325\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"rcz75r\" data-start=\"335\" data-end=\"392\"><strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"355\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jy7cq3\" data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"395\" data-end=\"410\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8inljy\" data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"455\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"439\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12s0bbu\" data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"480\"><strong data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"471\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Mai v\u00e0ng<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qm3a04\" data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"532\"><strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"496\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"136ywc7\" data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"619\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"560\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ohjkmt\" data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"681\"><strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"634\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> Nude kem k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u00e0ng mai v\u00e0 s\u1eafc xanh t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xjluuj\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"699\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh, tinh t\u1ebf theo tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury; d\u1ec5 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4msfod\" data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"969\"><strong data-start=\"825\" data-end=\"838\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, th\u1eaft t\u00fai ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho trang ph\u1ee5c; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6k29c\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1115\"><strong data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"985\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho m\u1eb9, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng n\u1eef; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 T\u1ebft.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1k6k29c\" data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1115\"><strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1407\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p2hya4\" data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1131\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<\/li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1l5jjpy\" data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1195\"><strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1190\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1wxz9rr\" data-start=\"2274\" data-end=\"2315\">Hoa M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2317\" data-end=\"2403\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt b\u1edfi c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1eb7n, sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2405\" data-end=\"2605\">Trong ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng, m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh qu\u00fd v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh vi\u00ean m\u00e3n. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa c\u00f3 th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2787\">SenSilk khai th\u00e1c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u1ea5y theo h\u01b0\u1edbng tinh gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ec3 hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh tho\u00e1t c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2789\" data-end=\"2830\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2832\" data-end=\"2922\">V\u1ebd tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, ki\u00ean nh\u1eabn v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn t\u1ed1t v\u1ec1 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2924\" data-end=\"3038\">M\u00e0u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u1edf c\u00e1c l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3040\" data-end=\"3190\">\u0110\u1ed9 \u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng. Khi kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3348\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, thay v\u00ec c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_5175_result-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-8799\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_5175_result-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"205\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"drzbco\" data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3374\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art of Silk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3376\" data-end=\"3453\">Art of Silk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3590\">Trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n, SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a c\u00e1nh hoa, s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng th\u1edf c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3663\">S\u1ef1 ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3665\" data-end=\"3785\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3785\">\u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a t\u1ef1 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-To-Tam-Ve-Tay-Hoa-Mau-Don-SenSilk-7-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5741\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-To-Tam-Ve-Tay-Hoa-Mau-Don-SenSilk-7-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"226\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1qxyojj\" data-start=\"3787\" data-end=\"3824\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3881\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3993\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng, kem, be ho\u1eb7c pastel, s\u1eafc hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4094\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4096\" data-end=\"4173\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4175\" data-end=\"4296\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-To-Tam-Ve-Tay-Hoa-Mau-Don-SenSilk-4-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5735\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-To-Tam-Ve-Tay-Hoa-Mau-Don-SenSilk-4-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"228\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4298\" data-end=\"4334\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4336\" data-end=\"4404\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4406\" data-end=\"4424\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4426\" data-end=\"4445\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4463\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4480\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4482\" data-end=\"4505\">Ph\u1ed1i trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4530\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4532\" data-end=\"4578\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4630\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"tu2o28\" data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4678\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ec3 trao g\u1eedi<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4680\" data-end=\"4788\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi g\u1eafm.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4790\" data-end=\"4926\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4928\" data-end=\"5051\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, ch\u1ecb em g\u00e1i, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5053\" data-end=\"5183\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5185\" data-end=\"5317\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u0169ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"roobt\" data-start=\"5319\" data-end=\"5372\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5499\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5501\" data-end=\"5617\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 giao thoa gi\u1eefa h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda, th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5619\" data-end=\"5707\">M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1nh hoa g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang cho t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5709\" data-end=\"5856\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong data-start=\"5787\" data-end=\"5855\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5858\" data-end=\"5876\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5878\" data-end=\"5946\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5948\" data-end=\"6040\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6042\" data-end=\"6193\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u1ea3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6215\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6217\" data-end=\"6316\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6318\" data-end=\"6419\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6421\" data-end=\"6485\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6487\" data-end=\"6611\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6613\" data-end=\"6634\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6636\" data-end=\"6676\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6678\" data-end=\"6714\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6760\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6762\" data-end=\"6790\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6792\" data-end=\"6840\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6842\" data-end=\"6878\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6880\" data-end=\"6947\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6949\" data-end=\"7018\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7020\" data-end=\"7041\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ljdcr3\" data-start=\"7043\" data-end=\"7097\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7099\" data-end=\"7202\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7204\" data-end=\"7242\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7244\" data-end=\"7400\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7402\" data-end=\"7435\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7437\" data-end=\"7555\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"8vzlgo\" data-start=\"7557\" data-end=\"7589\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7591\" data-end=\"7674\">Hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng, thanh qu\u00fd, vi\u00ean m\u00e3n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1vcf7bv\" data-start=\"7676\" data-end=\"7727\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7729\" data-end=\"7862\">C\u00f3. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa m\u1eabu \u0111\u01a1n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"7864\" data-end=\"7902\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7904\" data-end=\"8051\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogyly2\" data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8111\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8113\" data-end=\"8220\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"8222\" data-end=\"8260\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8262\" data-end=\"8337\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, h\u1ed3ng, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"8339\" data-end=\"8391\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8393\" data-end=\"8534\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2850000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.850.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14451,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_2465_result-scaled-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_2465_result-scaled-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1470px) 100vw, 1470px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_2465_result","alt":""},{"id":14453,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_5175_result-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_5175_result-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"2021_05_22_18_01_IMG_5175_result","alt":""},{"id":7594,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/Khan-Lua-To-Tam-Ve-Tay-Hoa-Mau-Don-sc