u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c."}]},{"id":0,"name":"K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"180x55cm","slug":"180x55cm"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 14 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Art of Silk &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay M\u1eabu \u0110\u01a1n | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14450","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14450","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14450&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14448,"name":"Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa \u0110\u00e0o SenSilk Limited &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c","slug":"khan-choang-lua-ve-tay-hoa-dao-sensilk-limited-qua-tang-doi-tac","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-choang-lua-ve-tay-hoa-dao-sensilk-limited-qua-tang-doi-tac\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED XANH HOADAO","short_description":"<p data-start=\"268\" data-end=\"586\">Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa \u0110\u00e0o SenSilk Limited &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"859\">S\u1eafc xanh c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u00e0o. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p, v\u1eeba ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam tinh t\u1ebf d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1029\">\u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m Art Luxury Limited, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1052\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"2391\">. <strong data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1073\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED XANH HOADAO<br data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1171\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1208\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1222\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1234\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1254\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1294\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1311\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1326\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1342\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1376\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o<br data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1387\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1402\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1441\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1468\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1527\" data-end=\"1530\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1544\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n xanh thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1607\" data-end=\"1610\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1627\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1759\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1761\" data-end=\"1774\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1899\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1901\" data-end=\"1914\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"2080\" data-end=\"2083\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2105\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2307\" data-end=\"2310\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2325\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2367\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2386\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3hk7de\" data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2440\">Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u2013 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p thanh nh\u00e3 c\u1ee7a v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2562\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t g\u1eafn v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, s\u1ef1 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2564\" data-end=\"2742\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa m\u1ea3nh mai mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n qua t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2918\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn hoa \u0111\u00e0o nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng quen thu\u1ed9c tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 mang theo, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/2021_05_22_18_07_IMG_2499_result-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7534\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/2021_05_22_18_07_IMG_2499_result-1024x764.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"227\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1segeki\" data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2960\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2962\" data-end=\"3060\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3197\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n c\u1ea7n x\u1eed l\u00fd l\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u00e0u v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 lan ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ea1o n\u00ean chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u cho b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3199\" data-end=\"3363\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng. Khi kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh hoa v\u00e0 c\u00e1nh \u0111\u00e0o c\u0169ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3365\" data-end=\"3512\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n thay v\u00ec c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-SenSilk-23-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7540\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-SenSilk-23-1024x800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"302\" height=\"236\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3549\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3551\" data-end=\"3658\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Hoa \u0110\u00e0o s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n xanh l\u00e0m kh\u00f4ng gian th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c, gi\u00fap nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3750\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa xanh v\u00e0 s\u1eafc hoa \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1eeba thanh l\u1ecbch v\u1eeba c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3852\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u chi ti\u1ebft, gi\u1eef kho\u1ea3ng th\u1edf c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 n\u00e9t v\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00f4n l\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3977\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3894\" data-end=\"3977\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-SenSilk-Limited-ve-tay-hoa-Dao-2021-6-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5755\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Khan-Lua-SenSilk-Limited-ve-tay-hoa-Dao-2021-6-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"233\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1dw7ikg\" data-start=\"3979\" data-end=\"4016\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a Hoa \u0110\u00e0o<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4018\" data-end=\"4085\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00f3 n\u00e9t \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4087\" data-end=\"4201\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang nh\u00e3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4203\" data-end=\"4302\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4409\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4411\" data-end=\"4532\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4534\" data-end=\"4570\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4572\" data-end=\"4640\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4642\" data-end=\"4677\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4679\" data-end=\"4698\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4716\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4718\" data-end=\"4748\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4771\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4773\" data-end=\"4796\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4798\" data-end=\"4844\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4894\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12zqf0f\" data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4952\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c \u2013 mang tinh hoa Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4954\" data-end=\"5062\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ea7n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5064\" data-end=\"5208\">Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111i\u1ec1u \u0111\u00f3 b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5210\" data-end=\"5347\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n quan tr\u1ecdng trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp tri \u00e2n, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5349\" data-end=\"5480\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam c\u00f3 t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5482\" data-end=\"5613\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy4l6y\" data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5668\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5670\" data-end=\"5782\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5784\" data-end=\"5894\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o mang trong m\u00ecnh c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a, trong khi k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang tr\u00ean t\u1eebng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5896\" data-end=\"6036\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 \u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a khi\u1ebfn chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u01b0\u1ee3t ra ngo\u00e0i m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6038\" data-end=\"6145\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"6065\" data-end=\"6144\">s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6147\" data-end=\"6165\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6167\" data-end=\"6235\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6237\" data-end=\"6329\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6331\" data-end=\"6499\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6521\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6523\" data-end=\"6622\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6624\" data-end=\"6725\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6727\" data-end=\"6791\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6793\" data-end=\"6922\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6924\" data-end=\"6945\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6947\" data-end=\"6987\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6989\" data-end=\"7025\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7027\" data-end=\"7071\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7101\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7103\" data-end=\"7151\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7153\" data-end=\"7189\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7191\" data-end=\"7258\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7260\" data-end=\"7329\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7331\" data-end=\"7352\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"10wsbq7\" data-start=\"7354\" data-end=\"7411\">Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng Hoa \u0110\u00e0o SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7413\" data-end=\"7516\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7518\" data-end=\"7556\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7558\" data-end=\"7710\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7712\" data-end=\"7745\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7747\" data-end=\"7865\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3fmvvf\" data-start=\"7867\" data-end=\"7895\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7897\" data-end=\"7996\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t Nam, th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rdhhmb\" data-start=\"7998\" data-end=\"8045\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8047\" data-end=\"8183\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"v9ie4o\" data-start=\"8185\" data-end=\"8249\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8251\" data-end=\"8398\">C\u00f3. Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"8400\" data-end=\"8438\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8440\" data-end=\"8583\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogyly2\" data-start=\"8585\" data-end=\"8643\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8645\" data-end=\"8783\">C\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"8785\" data-end=\"8823\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8825\" data-end=\"8905\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2800000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.800.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.800.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":7538,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-SenSilk-16-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-SenSilk-16-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1965px) 100vw, 1965px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1ebd tay hoa \u0111\u00e0o SenSilk (16)","alt":""},{"id":9187,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-