p to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c","slug":"Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed ship to\u00e0n qu\u1ed1c"}]},{"id":0,"name":"Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i\/tr\u1ea3","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c.","slug":"\u2013 SenSilk ch\u1ecbu 100% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng cho s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ed7i do nh\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t.\n\u2013 \u0110\u1ed5i h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng 02 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\n\u2013 S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f2n trong t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u khi nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng, c\u00f2n nguy\u00ean tem v\u00e0 nh\u00e3n m\u00e1c."}]},{"id":0,"name":"M\u00e0u kh\u0103n n\u1ec1n","taxonomy":null,"has_variations":false,"terms":[{"id":0,"name":"Xanh, Nude, H\u1ed3ng, Tr\u1eafng","slug":"Xanh, Nude, H\u1ed3ng, Tr\u1eafng"}]}],"variations":[],"grouped_products":[],"has_options":false,"is_purchasable":true,"is_in_stock":true,"is_on_backorder":false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 12 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Vietnamese Silk Gift &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Mai | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14441","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14441","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14441&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14429,"name":"100% Mulberry Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u1ed3ng SenSilk","slug":"100-mulberry-silk-scarf-hand-painted-khan-choang-co-ve-tay-hoa-hong","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/100-mulberry-silk-scarf-hand-painted-khan-choang-co-ve-tay-hoa-hong\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED XANH HOAHONGVANG","short_description":"<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"16xg44k\" data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"299\">100% Mulberry Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng SenSilk<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"519\">100% Mulberry Silk Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, n\u01a1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"758\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa n\u1ec1n xanh thanh nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 v\u1eeba m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u1eeba sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda. \u0110\u1ed9 \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1edf n\u00ean s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng khi chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"979\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p, H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng c\u00f2n mang tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m Art of Silk \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n \u0111\u1ed3 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1002\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"2372\">. <strong data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1023\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED XANH HOAHONGVANG<br data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1055\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1126\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1163\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1177\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1189\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1209\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1249\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1266\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1281\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1297\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1316\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1331\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng<br data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1363\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1402\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1429\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1491\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1505\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n xanh thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1581\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1598\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1745\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1879\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1894\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho sinh nh\u1eadt, 8\/3, 20\/10, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2073\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2095\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2288\" data-end=\"2291\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2306\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2367\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"f5sg93\" data-start=\"2374\" data-end=\"2417\">Hoa H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2504\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng lu\u00f4n l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p, s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2660\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa tr\u1edf n\u00ean n\u1eef t\u00ednh nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ng\u1ecdt ng\u00e0o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2784\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a xanh, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a hoa tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2786\" data-end=\"2964\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0o ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a theo h\u01b0\u1edbng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba mang h\u01a1i th\u1edf c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-6-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7554\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-6-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"308\" height=\"205\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3007\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3009\" data-end=\"3108\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng n\u00e9t c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3207\">C\u00e1c l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng chuy\u1ec3n s\u1eafc m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3209\" data-end=\"3358\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng. Khi kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3360\" data-end=\"3465\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Vietnam-Silk-Painting-khan-lua-ve-tay-SenSilk-2-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-5786\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Vietnam-Silk-Painting-khan-lua-ve-tay-SenSilk-2-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"309\" height=\"232\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3467\" data-end=\"3502\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3578\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa n\u1ec1n xanh v\u00e0 s\u1eafc hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3685\">N\u1ec1n xanh mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u0129nh v\u00e0 thanh l\u1ecbch, trong khi hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3758\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3760\" data-end=\"3897\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3800\" data-end=\"3897\">\u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc t\u1ef1 k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thay v\u00ec ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o s\u1ef1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-11-Copy_result-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7556\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-11-Copy_result-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"227\" \/><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"f5kbku\" data-start=\"3899\" data-end=\"3938\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3940\" data-end=\"4006\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4008\" data-end=\"4120\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be ho\u1eb7c h\u1ed3ng pastel, s\u1eafc hoa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4226\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4305\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4307\" data-end=\"4440\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4478\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4480\" data-end=\"4554\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4556\" data-end=\"4591\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4593\" data-end=\"4612\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4614\" data-end=\"4630\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4662\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4685\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4710\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4758\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4760\" data-end=\"4808\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1flprov\" data-start=\"4810\" data-end=\"4856\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 trao g\u1eedi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1eb1ng l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4858\" data-end=\"4945\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n mang theo c\u1ea3m x\u00fac v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4947\" data-end=\"5079\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng g\u1ee3i n\u00ean s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, trong khi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5081\" data-end=\"5204\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3, ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau, ch\u1ecb em g\u00e1i, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 n\u1eef, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5206\" data-end=\"5336\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng 8\/3, 20\/10, sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy4l6y\" data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5391\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5506\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5508\" data-end=\"5620\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5622\" data-end=\"5784\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u01b0\u1ee3t ra ngo\u00e0i c\u00f4ng n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5786\" data-end=\"5893\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"5813\" data-end=\"5892\">s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, trao t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"5895\" data-end=\"5913\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"5983\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5985\" data-end=\"6077\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6079\" data-end=\"6246\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6248\" data-end=\"6268\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6270\" data-end=\"6369\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6371\" data-end=\"6472\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6474\" data-end=\"6538\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6540\" data-end=\"6669\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"6671\" data-end=\"6692\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6694\" data-end=\"6734\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6736\" data-end=\"6772\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6774\" data-end=\"6818\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6820\" data-end=\"6848\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6850\" data-end=\"6898\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6900\" data-end=\"6936\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6938\" data-end=\"7005\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7007\" data-end=\"7076\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7078\" data-end=\"7099\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1g9lj0m\" data-start=\"7101\" data-end=\"7153\">Kh\u0103n H\u1ed3ng V\u00e0ng SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7155\" data-end=\"7258\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7260\" data-end=\"7298\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7300\" data-end=\"7458\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7460\" data-end=\"7493\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7495\" data-end=\"7613\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"6nlay0\" data-start=\"7615\" data-end=\"7649\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7651\" data-end=\"7744\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng, v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u1ea5m \u00e1p, ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"7746\" data-end=\"7793\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7795\" data-end=\"7930\">C\u00f3. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"cwoklx\" data-start=\"7932\" data-end=\"7973\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7975\" data-end=\"8118\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"rdhhmb\" data-start=\"8120\" data-end=\"8167\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8169\" data-end=\"8297\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf sang tr\u1ecdng c\u00f9ng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cao c\u1ea5p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"8299\" data-end=\"8351\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8353\" data-end=\"8498\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 n\u1eef trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"8500\" data-end=\"8538\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8540\" data-end=\"8620\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2750000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.750.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.750.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":8809,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-ve-tay-hoa-hong-SenSilk-11-Copy_result-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content