},{"id":14417,"name":"Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Di S\u1ea3n | SenSilk","slug":"khan-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-huong-duong-100-mulberry-silk-handmade-gift","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-huong-duong-100-mulberry-silk-handmade-gift\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE HUONGDUONG","short_description":"<p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"563\">Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Di S\u1ea3n | SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, n\u01a1i ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"739\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a nude thanh nh\u00e3, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u00f3a h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1eafc th\u00e1i t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"1007\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng mang h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh c\u1ee7a \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, s\u1ef1 l\u1ea1c quan v\u00e0 n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u1ea5y tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1030\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"2395\">. <strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1051\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE HUONGDUONG<br data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1153\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1190\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1204\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1216\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1236\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1276\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1293\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1308\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1324\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1343\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1358\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng<br data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1377\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1392\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1431\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1458\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1520\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1534\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n nude thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1617\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1634\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch, t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1768\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1783\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"1917\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1932\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> M\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nh\u00e2n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 di s\u1ea3n, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2098\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2120\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2311\" data-end=\"2314\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2329\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2368\" data-end=\"2371\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2390\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"37vtl4\" data-start=\"2397\" data-end=\"2453\">Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2455\" data-end=\"2540\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng lu\u00f4n t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1edfi s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 v\u00e0 d\u00e1ng hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u1ec1 ph\u00eda \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2542\" data-end=\"2623\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i l\u00ean s\u1ef1 l\u1ea1c quan, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng, ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2625\" data-end=\"2742\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a nude, s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2910\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba c\u00f3 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba mang th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p t\u00edch c\u1ef1c, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-44\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/fa50fe1a713ea460fd2f68\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"236\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/fa50fe1a713ea460fd2f68.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-huong-duong-sensilk-5-2\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-huong-duong-SenSilk-5-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/0cbc5f9ed0ba05e45cab65\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"220\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0cbc5f9ed0ba05e45cab65.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2912\" data-end=\"2953\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"2955\" data-end=\"3069\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3071\" data-end=\"3169\">T\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a l\u00e1 v\u00e0 th\u00e2n c\u00e2y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3171\" data-end=\"3265\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3377\">Khi kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh \u0111ang s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3379\" data-end=\"3478\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3515\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3517\" data-end=\"3616\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n nude l\u00e0m kh\u00f4ng gian ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o, t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3716\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n, gi\u00fap thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3718\" data-end=\"3809\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh trung t\u00e2m c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3811\" data-end=\"3943\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3851\" data-end=\"3943\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"19uw186\" data-start=\"3945\" data-end=\"3993\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"3995\" data-end=\"4049\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4152\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be ho\u1eb7c pastel, s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a hoa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4154\" data-end=\"4258\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4333\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4335\" data-end=\"4463\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4465\" data-end=\"4501\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4503\" data-end=\"4577\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4614\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4616\" data-end=\"4635\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4637\" data-end=\"4653\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4655\" data-end=\"4685\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4687\" data-end=\"4708\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4710\" data-end=\"4733\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4781\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4831\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"ay63\" data-start=\"4833\" data-end=\"4890\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Di S\u1ea3n \u2013 mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb Vi\u1ec7t qua ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4892\" data-end=\"4988\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang tinh th\u1ea7n di s\u1ea3n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ph\u00eda sau.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5128\">Kh\u0103n t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1ebd tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u00ednh v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5130\" data-end=\"5229\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nh\u00e2n, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5231\" data-end=\"5377\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp mu\u1ed1n g\u1eedi trao m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"19pei3d\" data-start=\"5379\" data-end=\"5429\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 trao g\u1eedi n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5431\" data-end=\"5501\">S\u1eafc v\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 tr\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5503\" data-end=\"5670\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1ed9t h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh m\u1edbi, m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c m\u1edbi ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5672\" data-end=\"5798\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p c\u1ee7a SenSilk, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb l\u01b0u gi\u1eef l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1yy4l6y\" data-start=\"5800\" data-end=\"5853\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5855\" data-end=\"5968\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"5970\" data-end=\"6082\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6084\" data-end=\"6190\">Hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, trong khi 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6192\" data-end=\"6340\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"6259\" data-end=\"6339\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6342\" data-end=\"6360\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6362\" data-end=\"6430\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6432\" data-end=\"6524\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6526\" data-end=\"6692\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6694\" data-end=\"6714\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6716\" data-end=\"6815\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6817\" data-end=\"6918\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6920\" data-end=\"6984\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"6986\" data-end=\"7110\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7112\" data-end=\"7133\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7135\" data-end=\"7175\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7177\" data-end=\"7213\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7215\" data-end=\"7259\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7261\" data-end=\"7289\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7291\" data-end=\"7339\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7341\" data-end=\"7377\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7379\" data-end=\"7446\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7448\" data-end=\"7517\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7519\" data-end=\"7540\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"pstquc\" data-start=\"7542\" data-end=\"7606\">Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7608\" data-end=\"7711\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7713\" data-end=\"7751\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7753\" data-end=\"7913\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7915\" data-end=\"7948\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"7950\" data-end=\"8068\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1g3rnv7\" data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8106\">Hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"8108\" data-end=\"8204\">Hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng, s\u1ef1 l\u1ea1c quan, ni\u1ec1m tin v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"m064i7\" data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8254\">V\u00ec sao s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Di S\u1ea3n?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"8256\" data-end=\"8419\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"11bj9y7\" data-start=\"8421\" data-end=\"8472\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"8474\" data-end=\"8590\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch c\u00f9ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1al84hf\" data-start=\"8592\" data-end=\"8648\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"8650\" data-end=\"8784\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"8786\" data-end=\"8824\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"8826\" data-end=\"8969\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"50k5me\" data-start=\"8971\" data-end=\"9025\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"9027\" data-end=\"9185\">C\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"9187\" data-end=\"9225\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"9227\" data-end=\"9302\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2850000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.850.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":13445,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/4250e8a8658cb0d2e99d31.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/4250e8a8658cb0d2e99d31-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"4250e8a8658cb0d2e99d31","alt":""},{"id":13447,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/05\/0cbc5f9ed0ba05e45cab65.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/