3 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Hoa H\u01b0\u1edbng D\u01b0\u01a1ng &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Di S\u1ea3n | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14417","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14417","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14417&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14378,"name":"Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam &#8211; Luxury Silk Gift | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-sen","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-hoa-sen\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED XANH HOASEN","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"611\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam &#8211; Luxury Silk Gift | SenSilk l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"1140\">Mang tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t Luxury Silk Gift, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nh\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf ho\u1eb7c l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1163\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"2528\">. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED XANH HOASEN<br data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1211\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1282\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1333\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1342\" data-end=\"1345\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1365\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1422\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1437\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1439\" data-end=\"1453\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1472\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1487\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1507\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1522\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1561\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1588\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1664\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n xanh thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa sen v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1727\" data-end=\"1730\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1747\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1870\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1885\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2026\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2041\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Luxury Silk Gift d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, doanh nh\u00e2n, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2207\" data-end=\"2210\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2232\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen \u2013 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2447\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2449\" data-end=\"2462\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2501\" data-end=\"2504\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2506\" data-end=\"2523\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 data-section-id=\"y4exba\" data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2570\">Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2572\" data-end=\"2639\">Hoa sen l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ti\u00eau bi\u1ec3u c\u1ee7a v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2641\" data-end=\"2797\">T\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a \u0111\u00f3a hoa \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh sen trong ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, ki\u1ebfn tr\u00fac v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng, hoa sen lu\u00f4n mang m\u1ed9t v\u1ecb tr\u00ed \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong t\u00e2m th\u1ee9c ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2799\" data-end=\"2979\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, hoa sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft trang tr\u00ed m\u00e0 c\u00f2n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch k\u1ec3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam b\u1eb1ng ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2981\" data-end=\"3122\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam c\u1ee7a SenSilk h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong nhi\u1ec1u ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"3124\" data-end=\"3165\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3167\" data-end=\"3266\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng n\u00e9t c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3268\" data-end=\"3383\">T\u1eebng c\u00e1nh sen, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a l\u00e1 v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft trong b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3385\" data-end=\"3478\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3480\" data-end=\"3589\">Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3591\" data-end=\"3692\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-6-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7696\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-6-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"306\" height=\"204\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3694\" data-end=\"3729\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3731\" data-end=\"3835\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Hoa Sen s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n xanh nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c thanh t\u0129nh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3933\">S\u1eafc xanh t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi l\u00e0m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4018\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh trung t\u00e2m c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4020\" data-end=\"4159\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"4060\" data-end=\"4159\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a style=\"font-size: 14.4px\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-31-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-7698\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-31-1024x755.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"304\" height=\"224\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"d6el9p\" data-start=\"4161\" data-end=\"4198\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4271\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm n\u00e9t \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4273\" data-end=\"4398\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u trung t\u00ednh, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft sen t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4400\" data-end=\"4504\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4506\" data-end=\"4583\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4714\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4716\" data-end=\"4752\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4828\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4830\" data-end=\"4865\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4867\" data-end=\"4886\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4888\" data-end=\"4904\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4906\" data-end=\"4936\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4938\" data-end=\"4959\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"4984\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4986\" data-end=\"5032\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5034\" data-end=\"5104\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"d588fv\" data-start=\"5106\" data-end=\"5155\">Luxury Silk Gift \u2013 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5240\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb khi v\u1eeba \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1ec1 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c v\u1eeba c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ph\u00eda sau.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5242\" data-end=\"5380\">Hoa sen gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, trong khi 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5382\" data-end=\"5485\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, doanh nh\u00e2n, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5487\" data-end=\"5635\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p, qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 Vi\u1ec7t Nam cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"v7joaz\" data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5682\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c \u2013 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5684\" data-end=\"5788\">Trong nh\u1eefng m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c quan tr\u1ecdng, m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5790\" data-end=\"5913\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"6012\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c trong n\u01b0\u1edbc, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p mang h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6014\" data-end=\"6159\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, hoa sen tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ec5 gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6161\" data-end=\"6257\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp trao t\u1eb7ng trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ij7oj1\" data-start=\"6259\" data-end=\"6308\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6310\" data-end=\"6423\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6425\" data-end=\"6537\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6632\">Hoa sen mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, trong khi l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6634\" data-end=\"6782\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"6701\" data-end=\"6781\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6784\" data-end=\"6802\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6804\" data-end=\"6872\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6874\" data-end=\"6966\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6968\" data-end=\"7133\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m Luxury Silk Gift ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"7135\" data-end=\"7155\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7157\" data-end=\"7256\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7258\" data-end=\"7359\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7361\" data-end=\"7425\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7427\" data-end=\"7556\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7558\" data-end=\"7579\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7581\" data-end=\"7621\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7659\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7661\" data-end=\"7705\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7707\" data-end=\"7735\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7737\" data-end=\"7785\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7787\" data-end=\"7823\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7825\" data-end=\"7892\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7894\" data-end=\"7963\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7965\" data-end=\"7986\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3zujn7\" data-start=\"7988\" data-end=\"8051\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Hoa Sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8053\" data-end=\"8156\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"8158\" data-end=\"8196\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8198\" data-end=\"8350\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"8352\" data-end=\"8385\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8387\" data-end=\"8505\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vi5fnr\" data-start=\"8507\" data-end=\"8556\">Hoa sen c\u00f3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8558\" data-end=\"8686\">Hoa sen l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, g\u1eafn v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft, s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"h8ci0p\" data-start=\"8688\" data-end=\"8737\">V\u00ec sao s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m Luxury Silk Gift?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8739\" data-end=\"8892\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u1eeba mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ogyly2\" data-start=\"8894\" data-end=\"8952\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8954\" data-end=\"9103\">C\u00f3. Hoa sen v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam theo c\u00e1ch tinh t\u1ebf, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"9105\" data-end=\"9143\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9145\" data-end=\"9288\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1al84hf\" data-start=\"9290\" data-end=\"9346\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9348\" data-end=\"9503\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"9505\" data-end=\"9543\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9545\" data-end=\"9642\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa sen \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, xanh nh\u1ea1t, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2850000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.850.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.850.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":14379,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-4-scaled-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-4-scaled-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1605px) 100vw, 1605px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a sensilk v\u1ebd hoa sen cao c\u1ea5p (4)","alt":""},{"id":14381,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-46-scaled.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-hoa-sen-cao-cap-46-scaled-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 2048px) 100vw, 2048px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_si