103n L\u1ee5a Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng V\u1ebd Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n Sen Silk &#8211; Ki\u1ec7t T\u00e1c L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t","slug":"khan-lua-qua-tang-ve-hoa-dong-tien-sen-silk-kiet-tac-lua-viet","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-qua-tang-ve-hoa-dong-tien-sen-silk-kiet-tac-lua-viet\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE HOADONGTIEN","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"608\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng V\u1ebd Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n Sen Silk &#8211; Ki\u1ec7t T\u00e1c L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1111\">L\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1 v\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 trao t\u1eb7ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1134\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"2465\">. <strong data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1155\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE HOADONGTIEN<br data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1187\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1258\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1295\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1309\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1321\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1323\" data-end=\"1341\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1398\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1413\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1429\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1448\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1463\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n<br data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1480\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1495\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1531\" data-end=\"1534\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1561\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1623\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1625\" data-end=\"1637\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n nude thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1726\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1849\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1864\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1986\" data-end=\"1989\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1991\" data-end=\"2004\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, doanh nh\u00e2n, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 ch\u00fac m\u1eebng, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2170\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2172\" data-end=\"2192\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2381\" data-end=\"2384\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2386\" data-end=\"2399\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2441\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2460\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ty173e\" data-start=\"2467\" data-end=\"2527\">Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2604\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1edfi d\u00e1ng hoa tr\u00f2n \u0111\u1ea7y v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2786\">Trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam, hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp ch\u00fac m\u1eebng, khai tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, l\u1ec5 T\u1ebft hay nh\u1eefng c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2788\" data-end=\"2904\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1eddi trang h\u01a1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"3049\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i tinh th\u1ea7n t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a lo\u00e0i hoa, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi \u0111\u01b0a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1ec1 g\u1ea7n h\u01a1n v\u1edbi ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef Art Luxury.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"3051\" data-end=\"3092\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3195\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3312\">T\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a l\u00e1 v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft trong b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3314\" data-end=\"3407\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3409\" data-end=\"3512\">Khi kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3514\" data-end=\"3613\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">\n<div id=\"gallery-45\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/1ac8303c00c2c29c9bd3_result-2\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"210\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/1ac8303c00c2c29c9bd3_result-1-300x210.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/dsc00652_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"198\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/DSC00652_result-scaled-300x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/dsc00698_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/DSC00698_result-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3615\" data-end=\"3650\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3652\" data-end=\"3724\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n nude l\u00e0m kh\u00f4ng gian th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3726\" data-end=\"3835\">Gam nude t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u00fap s\u1eafc hoa tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3837\" data-end=\"3930\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3932\" data-end=\"4063\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3972\" data-end=\"4063\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4liiml\" data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4108\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4164\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p t\u01b0\u01a1i s\u00e1ng, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 n\u1eef t\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4166\" data-end=\"4270\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be ho\u1eb7c pastel, s\u1eafc hoa t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4272\" data-end=\"4376\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4455\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4457\" data-end=\"4585\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4623\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4625\" data-end=\"4699\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4736\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4757\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4759\" data-end=\"4775\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4777\" data-end=\"4807\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4809\" data-end=\"4830\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4832\" data-end=\"4855\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4903\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4905\" data-end=\"4959\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yqrwtp\" data-start=\"4961\" data-end=\"5010\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 g\u1eedi trao nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5137\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1, v\u00ec v\u1eady thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5139\" data-end=\"5255\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m c\u00f9ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5257\" data-end=\"5352\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5354\" data-end=\"5510\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 ch\u00fac m\u1eebng, qu\u00e0 khai tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u00e1nh d\u1ea5u m\u1ed9t c\u1ed9t m\u1ed1c quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"17v2950\" data-start=\"5512\" data-end=\"5564\">Ki\u1ec7t T\u00e1c L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t \u2013 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5566\" data-end=\"5678\">M\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u00e1ch c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n h\u00f3a th\u00e0nh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5680\" data-end=\"5825\">Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 t\u01b0 duy thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5972\">T\u1eeb m\u1ed9t h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam, SenSilk t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n trong nh\u1eefng kh\u00f4ng gian th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5974\" data-end=\"6107\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t <strong data-start=\"5998\" data-end=\"6019\">Ki\u1ec7t T\u00e1c L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong>: g\u00ecn gi\u1eef v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p quen thu\u1ed9c b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1edbi, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"zg6rxf\" data-start=\"6109\" data-end=\"6155\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c \u2013 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 \u00fd ngh\u0129a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6157\" data-end=\"6240\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ea7n s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, trang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6242\" data-end=\"6369\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u00f3 th\u00f4ng qua ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6371\" data-end=\"6491\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ed9 tu\u1ed5i v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch, gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng sau khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6614\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c l\u00e2u n\u0103m ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2hf2ox\" data-start=\"6616\" data-end=\"6660\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6662\" data-end=\"6775\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6777\" data-end=\"6889\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6891\" data-end=\"6995\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, trong khi 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec1 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6997\" data-end=\"7145\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ec3 m\u1eb7c m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong data-start=\"7064\" data-end=\"7144\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"7147\" data-end=\"7165\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7167\" data-end=\"7235\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7237\" data-end=\"7329\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7331\" data-end=\"7497\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"7499\" data-end=\"7519\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7521\" data-end=\"7620\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7622\" data-end=\"7723\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7789\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7791\" data-end=\"7915\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7917\" data-end=\"7938\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7940\" data-end=\"7980\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7982\" data-end=\"8018\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8020\" data-end=\"8064\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8066\" data-end=\"8094\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8096\" data-end=\"8144\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8146\" data-end=\"8182\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8184\" data-end=\"8251\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8253\" data-end=\"8322\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"8324\" data-end=\"8345\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1mbe9zq\" data-start=\"8347\" data-end=\"8410\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8412\" data-end=\"8515\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"8517\" data-end=\"8555\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8557\" data-end=\"8715\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"8717\" data-end=\"8750\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8752\" data-end=\"8870\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1ee0py4\" data-start=\"8872\" data-end=\"8906\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8908\" data-end=\"9023\">Hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn ni\u1ec1m vui, s\u1ef1 r\u1ea1ng r\u1ee1, nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 l\u1eddi ch\u00fac may m\u1eafn trong nhi\u1ec1u d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1c4s7ea\" data-start=\"9025\" data-end=\"9074\">V\u00ec sao s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9076\" data-end=\"9222\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba \u0111\u1eb9p v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"103qywa\" data-start=\"9224\" data-end=\"9274\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9276\" data-end=\"9417\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi qu\u00e0 ch\u00fac m\u1eebng, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng d\u00e0nh cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1al84hf\" data-start=\"9419\" data-end=\"9475\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9477\" data-end=\"9606\">C\u00f3. H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tri \u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"9608\" data-end=\"9646\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9648\" data-end=\"9791\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"fwikbl\" data-start=\"9793\" data-end=\"9831\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9833\" data-end=\"9908\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1hryxbw\" data-start=\"9910\" data-end=\"9916\">SEO<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"9918\" data-end=\"9990\"><strong data-start=\"9918\" data-end=\"9932\">SEO Title:<\/strong><br data-start=\"9932\" data-end=\"9935\" \/>Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n \u2013 Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t | SenSilk<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"9992\" data-end=\"10161\"><strong data-start=\"9992\" data-end=\"10013\">Meta Description:<\/strong><br data-start=\"10013\" data-end=\"10016\" \/>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay Hoa \u0110\u1ed3ng Ti\u1ec1n tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m \u2013 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m Art Luxury Limited, mang tinh th\u1ea7n Ki\u1ec7t T\u00e1c L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t, d\u00e0nh cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10163\" data-end=\"10232\"><strong data-start=\"10163\" data-end=\"10176\">URL Slug:<\/strong><br data-start=\"10176\" data-end=\"10179\" \/><code data-start=\"10179\" data-end=\"10232\">khan-lua-ve-hoa-dong-tien-qua-tang-lua-viet-sensilk<\/code><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10234\" data-end=\"10280\"><strong data-start=\"10234\" data-end=\"10252\">T\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ch\u00ednh:<\/strong><br data-start=\"10252\" data-end=\"10255\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10282\" data-end=\"10638\"><strong data-start=\"10282\" data-end=\"10298\">T\u1eeb kh\u00f3a ph\u1ee5:<\/strong><br data-start=\"10298\" data-end=\"10301\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n<br data-start=\"10330\" data-end=\"10333\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n<br data-start=\"10362\" data-end=\"10365\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<br data-start=\"10390\" data-end=\"10393\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Limited<br data-start=\"10420\" data-end=\"10423\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay cao c\u1ea5p<br data-start=\"10446\" data-end=\"10449\" \/>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"10470\" data-end=\"10473\" \/>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n<br data-start=\"10492\" data-end=\"10495\" \/>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c cao c\u1ea5p<br data-start=\"10519\" data-end=\"10522\" \/>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<br data-start=\"10543\" data-end=\"10546\" \/>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"10572\" data-end=\"10575\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m<br data-start=\"10591\" data-end=\"10594\" \/>Ki\u1ec7t t\u00e1c l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<br data-start=\"10611\" data-end=\"10614\" \/>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay 180x55cm<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10640\" data-end=\"10832\"><strong data-start=\"10640\" data-end=\"10657\">ALT h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh:<\/strong><br data-start=\"10657\" data-end=\"10660\" \/>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n \u2013 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t SenSilk<br data-start=\"10717\" data-end=\"10720\" \/>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1ebd hoa \u0111\u1ed3ng ti\u1ec1n n\u1ec1n nude SenSilk<br data-start=\"1076