-lavender-mulberry-silk-scarf-one-of-a-kind","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-cao-cap-ve-tay-lavender-mulberry-silk-scarf-one-of-a-kind\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE LAVENDER","short_description":"<h1 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1ns8og2\" data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"404\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Lavender &#8211; One-Of-A-Kind | SenSilk<\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"630\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Lavender &#8211; One-Of-A-Kind | SenSilk l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, n\u01a1i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a hoa Lavender \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n th\u1ec3 l\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"989\">Mang tinh th\u1ea7n One-Of-A-Kind trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n l\u1ee5a c\u00f3 c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1216\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n th\u1eddi trang, \u0111\u00e2y c\u00f2n l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn trang nh\u00e3 cho <strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1139\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong>, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1239\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"2531\">. <strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1260\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE LAVENDER<br data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1289\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1360\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1397\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1411\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1443\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1483\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1500\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1512\" data-end=\"1515\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1531\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1547\" data-end=\"1550\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1565\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa Lavender<br data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1581\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1596\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1635\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1662\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1738\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> N\u1ec1n nude thanh nh\u00e3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eafc t\u00edm Lavender v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean<br data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1809\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"1826\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1937\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"1952\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"2083\" data-end=\"2086\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2101\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2270\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2272\" data-end=\"2292\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, mang ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda ri\u00eang tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<br data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2450\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2452\" data-end=\"2465\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2504\" data-end=\"2507\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2509\" data-end=\"2526\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"1208y2f\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2568\">Lavender \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2570\" data-end=\"2637\">Lavender \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch b\u1edfi s\u1eafc t\u00edm d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tho\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2756\">Kh\u00f4ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng lo\u00e0i hoa nhi\u1ec1u m\u00e0u s\u1eafc, Lavender t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2758\" data-end=\"2879\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a nude, s\u1eafc t\u00edm tr\u1edf n\u00ean m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i h\u01a1n, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2970\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tr\u01b0\u1edfng th\u00e0nh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury.<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2972\" data-end=\"3013\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3015\" data-end=\"3116\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3217\">Nh\u1eefng c\u00e0nh Lavender \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1c n\u00e9t v\u1ebd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ea1o c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3219\" data-end=\"3305\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1eafc t\u00edm c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 bi\u1ebfn chuy\u1ec3n nh\u1eb9 d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3307\" data-end=\"3461\">Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-46\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/5a2fc7baad7e6f20366f77_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/5a2fc7baad7e6f20366f77_result.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/hand-painted-silk-scarves-by-sensilk-vietnam-1-3\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"238\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/hand-painted-silk-scarves-by-SenSilk-Vietnam-1-2-scaled-300x238.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/dsc00601_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/DSC00601_result-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3463\" data-end=\"3498\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3593\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Lavender l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn n\u1ec1n nude nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian trung t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n l\u00ean s\u1eafc t\u00edm c\u1ee7a hoa.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3670\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa nude v\u00e0 Lavender t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9, sang v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3748\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3750\" data-end=\"3891\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3891\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ph\u00eda sau m\u1ed7i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"12e5hbk\" data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3931\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Lavender<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3933\" data-end=\"4002\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00f3 n\u00e9t l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4100\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be ho\u1eb7c pastel, s\u1eafc Lavender t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4197\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4199\" data-end=\"4278\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4412\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4414\" data-end=\"4450\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4452\" data-end=\"4526\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4528\" data-end=\"4563\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4565\" data-end=\"4584\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4586\" data-end=\"4602\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4634\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4657\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4659\" data-end=\"4682\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4684\" data-end=\"4720\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4722\" data-end=\"4776\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1lnjmwt\" data-start=\"4778\" data-end=\"4826\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau c\u00e1i \u0111\u1eb9p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4922\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"5061\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Lavender mang \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5209\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t y\u00eau th\u00edch th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5211\" data-end=\"5328\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng sinh nh\u1eadt, k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"z5fsk3\" data-start=\"5330\" data-end=\"5374\">One-Of-A-Kind \u2013 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5376\" data-end=\"5465\">One-Of-A-Kind \u1edf \u0111\u00e2y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n qua tinh th\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5649\">Thay v\u00ec m\u1ed9t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra theo c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00e0, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 c\u00e1 t\u00ednh ri\u00eang, n\u01a1i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u c\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5651\" data-end=\"5789\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n mu\u1ed1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"182ix87\" data-start=\"5791\" data-end=\"5834\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c \u2013 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5836\" data-end=\"5942\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p khi c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba sang tr\u1ecdng v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5944\" data-end=\"6034\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Lavender v\u1edbi b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 t\u1ea1o thi\u1ec7n c\u1ea3m v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6036\" data-end=\"6179\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng n\u1eef doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef quan tr\u1ecdng trong c\u00e1c m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6181\" data-end=\"6281\">H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2hf2ox\" data-start=\"6283\" data-end=\"6327\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6329\" data-end=\"6442\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6444\" data-end=\"6550\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6552\" data-end=\"6647\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u, trong khi k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6649\" data-end=\"6807\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi <strong data-start=\"6738\" data-end=\"6806\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef v\u00e0 s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6809\" data-end=\"6827\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6829\" data-end=\"6897\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6899\" data-end=\"6991\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6993\" data-end=\"7156\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"7158\" data-end=\"7178\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7180\" data-end=\"7279\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7281\" data-end=\"7382\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7384\" data-end=\"7448\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7450\" data-end=\"7574\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7576\" data-end=\"7597\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7599\" data-end=\"7639\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7641\" data-end=\"7677\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7679\" data-end=\"7723\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7725\" data-end=\"7753\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7755\" data-end=\"7803\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7805\" data-end=\"7841\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7843\" data-end=\"7910\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7912\" data-end=\"7981\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7983\" data-end=\"8004\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1a2sugp\" data-start=\"8006\" data-end=\"8068\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Cao C\u1ea5p V\u1ebd Tay Lavender \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8070\" data-end=\"8173\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"8175\" data-end=\"8213\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8215\" data-end=\"8368\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft Lavender \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"8370\" data-end=\"8403\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8405\" data-end=\"8523\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1nguexq\" data-start=\"8525\" data-end=\"8562\">Lavender mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8564\" data-end=\"8689\">Lavender n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt v\u1edbi s\u1eafc t\u00edm d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng, thanh tho\u00e1t v\u00e0 c\u00f3 n\u00e9t l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"8691\" data-end=\"8738\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8740\" data-end=\"8901\">C\u00f3. Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1e5rcm7\" data-start=\"8903\" data-end=\"8955\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8957\" data-end=\"9069\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"9071\" data-end=\"9109\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9111\" data-end=\"9254\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yvaox0\" data-start=\"9256\" data-end=\"9293\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9295\" data-end=\"9384\">C\u00f3. N\u1ec1n nude v\u00e0 s\u1eafc Lavender ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, nude, kem, be v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u gam pastel.<\/p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2800000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden