limited-hand-painted-silk-shawl","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-quy-ba-ve-tay-hoa-dao-sensilk-limited-hand-painted-silk-shawl\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED TRANG HOADAO","short_description":"<p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"429\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u2013 Silk Shawl | SenSilk Limited l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, n\u01a1i h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n th\u1ec3 b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"431\" data-end=\"623\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao, gi\u00e0u ch\u1ea5t th\u01a1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng. Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u00f4n l\u00ean \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 v\u00e0 \u00e1nh \u00f3ng \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"879\">Thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u1eddi trang, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tinh t\u1ebf. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"878\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, doanh nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"902\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"2092\">. <strong data-start=\"906\" data-end=\"923\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED TRANG HOADAO<br data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"951\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1022\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1059\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1073\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1085\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1105\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1145\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1162\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1177\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1193\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1212\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1227\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o<br data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1238\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1253\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1292\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1319\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1381\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1398\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1521\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1536\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<br data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1670\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1685\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1848\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1870\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Limited, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<br data-start=\"2008\" data-end=\"2011\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2013\" data-end=\"2026\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2065\" data-end=\"2068\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2087\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"18zh487\" data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2131\">Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2133\" data-end=\"2266\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u s\u1ee9c g\u1ee3i c\u1ee7a v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t g\u1eafn v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, T\u1ebft v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111o\u00e0n vi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2268\" data-end=\"2386\">V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u00e0o kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1eafc hoa m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u01b0\u01a1i m\u1edbi, thanh tao v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng m\u00e0 lo\u00e0i hoa mang l\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2556\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, hoa \u0111\u00e0o tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef th\u1eddi trang m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, v\u1eeba mang n\u00e9t truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u1eeba c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u00f2a v\u00e0o phong c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2558\" data-end=\"2676\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01b0a tinh th\u1ea7n m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-48\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/484cbff4ef0b2d55741a_result\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"210\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/484cbff4ef0b2d55741a_result-300x210.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/art-of-silk-by-sensilk-13-2\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"222\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/art-of-silk-by-SenSilk-13-1-scaled-300x222.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/sensilk-mun-73\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/SenSilk-Mun-73-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2678\" data-end=\"2719\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2721\" data-end=\"2822\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t v\u1ea3i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2824\" data-end=\"2932\">T\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa, nh\u00e1nh \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft trong b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"3030\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 bi\u1ebfn chuy\u1ec3n nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3141\">Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3143\" data-end=\"3242\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-49\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-sensilk-15\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"220\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-ve-tay-hoa-dao-SenSilk-15-scaled-300x220.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-bao-loc-cao-cap-ve-tay-sensilk-limited-17\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/khan-lua-bao-loc-cao-cap-ve-tay-SenSilk-Limited-17-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-tay-hoa-dao-10\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"230\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/khan-lua-sensilk-ve-tay-hoa-dao-10-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3279\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3281\" data-end=\"3435\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u1ed1n mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a v\u00e0o thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ee5a, SenSilk ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c qu\u00e1 trang tr\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3437\" data-end=\"3536\">\u0110\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n b\u1eb1ng gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a, h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda v\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3538\" data-end=\"3640\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n, \u0111\u1ec3 chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3781\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3682\" data-end=\"3781\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left\">\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"13cdjz0\" data-start=\"3783\" data-end=\"3831\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hoa \u0110\u00e0o<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3891\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u ch\u1ea5t th\u01a1.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"4012\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c gam m\u00e0u pastel, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4112\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4198\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4200\" data-end=\"4328\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4366\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4368\" data-end=\"4442\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n linh ho\u1ea1t trong nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4444\" data-end=\"4479\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4481\" data-end=\"4500\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4518\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4520\" data-end=\"4550\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4573\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4598\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4600\" data-end=\"4646\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4648\" data-end=\"4702\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nra6gq\" data-start=\"4704\" data-end=\"4748\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 g\u1eedi trao s\u1eafc xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4750\" data-end=\"4826\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o mang theo c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, s\u1ef1 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4828\" data-end=\"4967\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u1ea5y tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u1eeba mang chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u0103n h\u00f3a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4969\" data-end=\"5074\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5076\" data-end=\"5178\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4ftu2j\" data-start=\"5180\" data-end=\"5224\">Silk Shawl \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt Vi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5226\" data-end=\"5340\">Silk Shawl mang tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5342\" data-end=\"5486\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n th\u1ec3 th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, gi\u00fap v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam hi\u1ec7n di\u1ec7n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean trong th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5488\" data-end=\"5606\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1jipoc7\" data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5654\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng \u0110\u1ed1i T\u00e1c \u2013 mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5656\" data-end=\"5767\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng nh\u1ea5t thi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3; gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi g\u1eafm.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5769\" data-end=\"5896\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hoa \u0110\u00e0o mang h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5898\" data-end=\"6021\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c trong n\u01b0\u1edbc, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6023\" data-end=\"6123\">H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"wqp7j4\" data-start=\"6125\" data-end=\"6165\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6167\" data-end=\"6280\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6282\" data-end=\"6394\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a, v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6396\" data-end=\"6491\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u, trong khi k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6493\" data-end=\"6640\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o c\u00f2n mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a, gi\u00fap t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 th\u00eam chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6642\" data-end=\"6660\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6662\" data-end=\"6730\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6732\" data-end=\"6824\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6826\" data-end=\"6989\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6991\" data-end=\"7011\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7013\" data-end=\"7112\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7114\" data-end=\"7215\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7217\" data-end=\"7281\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7283\" data-end=\"7401\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7403\" data-end=\"7424\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7426\" data-end=\"7466\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7468\" data-end=\"7504\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7506\" data-end=\"7550\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7552\" data-end=\"7580\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7582\" data-end=\"7630\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7632\" data-end=\"7668\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7670\" data-end=\"7737\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7739\" data-end=\"7808\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7810\" data-end=\"7831\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"otpdn2\" data-start=\"7833\" data-end=\"7897\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Hoa \u0110\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7899\" data-end=\"8002\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"8004\" data-end=\"8042\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8044\" data-end=\"8196\">\u0110\u00fang. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited c\u1ee7a SenSilk, v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"8198\" data-end=\"8231\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8233\" data-end=\"8351\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"3fmvvf\" data-start=\"8353\" data-end=\"8381\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8383\" data-end=\"8532\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o g\u1eafn li\u1ec1n v\u1edbi m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n, T\u1ebft v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh v\u0103n h\u00f3a trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam, g\u1ee3i c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c t\u01b0\u01a1i m\u1edbi, \u0111o\u00e0n vi\u00ean v\u00e0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"15z1nsy\" data-start=\"8534\" data-end=\"8580\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8582\" data-end=\"8723\">C\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 T\u1ebft mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cao.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"11bj9y7\" data-start=\"8725\" data-end=\"8776\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8778\" data-end=\"8912\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, gi\u00e0u c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 doanh nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"8914\" data-end=\"8952\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8954\" data-end=\"9101\">C\u00f3. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yvaox0\" data-start=\"9103\" data-end=\"9140\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9142\" data-end=\"9252\">C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be, pastel v\u00e0 c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2900000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.900.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"scre