Nam V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng May M\u1eafn | SenSilk","slug":"khan-lua-viet-nam-ve-ngoc-lan","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-viet-nam-ve-ngoc-lan\/","sku":"KLVT180 HONG NGOCLAN","short_description":"<p data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"505\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan &#8211; Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng May M\u1eafn | SenSilk l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, l\u1ea5y v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao c\u1ee7a hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan l\u00e0m c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"675\">Nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh Ng\u1ecdc Lan l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a theo c\u00e1ch nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, tinh t\u1ebf, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p trang nh\u00e3 v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"882\">Kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf c\u00f2n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"798\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p mang l\u1eddi ch\u00fac t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p<\/strong>, d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"905\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"2017\">. <strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"926\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVT180 HONG NGOCLAN<br data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"950\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"1021\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1058\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1072\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1084\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1104\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt<br data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1134\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1151\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1163\" data-end=\"1166\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1182\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1201\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1216\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan<br data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1232\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1247\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1286\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1313\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1375\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1392\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh tao v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1501\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1516\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<br data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1630\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1645\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p cho doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; mang l\u1eddi ch\u00fac may m\u1eafn v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p.<br data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1799\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1821\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan thanh tao v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<br data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"1936\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1951\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"1993\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2012\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"m279ls\" data-start=\"2019\" data-end=\"2053\">Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2055\" data-end=\"2149\">Ng\u1ecdc Lan l\u00e0 lo\u00e0i hoa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch b\u1edfi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, thanh khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u01a1m \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2151\" data-end=\"2257\">Kh\u00f4ng mang v\u1ebb r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 hay ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, Ng\u1ecdc Lan t\u1ea1o \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u1eb1ng nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2434\">Trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ee5a, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh Ng\u1ecdc Lan tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt mang t\u00ednh thanh l\u1ecbch, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2566\">SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn Ng\u1ecdc Lan \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba g\u1ea7n g\u0169i v\u1edbi thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean v\u1eeba mang tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-50\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=10962#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/SenSilk-Mun-108-scaled-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=10966#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"227\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/Hand-Painted-Silk-by-SenSilk-7-1-scaled-300x227.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=10964#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/11\/SenSilk-Mun-200-300x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2568\" data-end=\"2609\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2611\" data-end=\"2712\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean t\u1eebng v\u00f9ng ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2828\">C\u00e1c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a hoa v\u00e0 l\u00e1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2923\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap m\u00e0u s\u1eafc c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"3048\">Khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng, nh\u1eefng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t hoa c\u0169ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng theo \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3050\" data-end=\"3182\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: <strong data-start=\"3094\" data-end=\"3182\">m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u1ee7a b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/2021_11_03_16_02_IMG_6201_result-scaled.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-9237\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/2021_11_03_16_02_IMG_6201_result-1024x793.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"301\" height=\"233\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3219\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3221\" data-end=\"3290\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Ng\u1ecdc Lan h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3292\" data-end=\"3375\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n l\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t c\u1ee7a hoa, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3377\" data-end=\"3489\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0m m\u1ea5t \u0111i v\u1ebb thanh l\u1ecbch t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3491\" data-end=\"3622\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"3531\" data-end=\"3622\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1sqfdsh\" data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3666\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3668\" data-end=\"3720\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao, n\u1eef t\u00ednh v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3793\">Khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, kh\u0103n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3 duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3795\" data-end=\"3886\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi tr\u1eafng, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3888\" data-end=\"3962\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3964\" data-end=\"4089\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ch\u00ednh.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4127\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4180\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm mang \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4217\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4219\" data-end=\"4238\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4240\" data-end=\"4256\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4288\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4290\" data-end=\"4311\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4336\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4338\" data-end=\"4374\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4376\" data-end=\"4430\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"13t9fsf\" data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4475\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng May M\u1eafn \u2013 g\u1eedi trao \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4543\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb9p s\u1ebd tr\u1edf n\u00ean \u00fd ngh\u0129a h\u01a1n khi mang theo m\u1ed9t l\u1eddi ch\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4545\" data-end=\"4675\">Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan v\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eedi g\u1eafm nh\u01b0 l\u1eddi ch\u00fac v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 b\u00ecnh an, thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p trong cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4793\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba sang tr\u1ecdng v\u1eeba gi\u00e0u c\u1ea3m x\u00fac.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4795\" data-end=\"4896\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hoilrk\" data-start=\"4898\" data-end=\"4946\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nh\u00e2n \u2013 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4948\" data-end=\"5049\">\u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5051\" data-end=\"5181\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111i\u1ec1u \u0111\u00f3 v\u1edbi ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5183\" data-end=\"5262\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 ch\u00fac m\u1eebng, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5264\" data-end=\"5371\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng n\u1eef doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1259fzw\" data-start=\"5373\" data-end=\"5434\">L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng trong \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5550\">SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 t\u01b0 duy thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5552\" data-end=\"5611\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m mang \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5677\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda ri\u00eang tr\u00ean t\u1eebng t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5679\" data-end=\"5841\">S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p n\u00e0y gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u1ec1 <strong data-start=\"5792\" data-end=\"5840\">l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"2hf2ox\" data-start=\"5843\" data-end=\"5887\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5889\" data-end=\"5989\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5991\" data-end=\"6095\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6191\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u, trong khi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6193\" data-end=\"6327\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u00ec v\u1eady c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi <strong data-start=\"6269\" data-end=\"6326\">l\u01b0u gi\u1eef nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6329\" data-end=\"6347\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6349\" data-end=\"6417\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6419\" data-end=\"6515\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6517\" data-end=\"6682\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6684\" data-end=\"6704\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6706\" data-end=\"6805\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6807\" data-end=\"6908\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6910\" data-end=\"6974\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6976\" data-end=\"7085\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7087\" data-end=\"7108\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7110\" data-end=\"7150\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7152\" data-end=\"7188\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7190\" data-end=\"7234\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7236\" data-end=\"7264\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7266\" data-end=\"7314\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7316\" data-end=\"7352\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7354\" data-end=\"7421\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7423\" data-end=\"7492\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7494\" data-end=\"7515\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1lr23nx\" data-start=\"7517\" data-end=\"7584\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam V\u1ebd Tay Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7586\" data-end=\"7689\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7691\" data-end=\"7729\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7731\" data-end=\"7823\">\u0110\u00fang. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"7825\" data-end=\"7858\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7860\" data-end=\"7978\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ie4dy9\" data-start=\"7980\" data-end=\"8013\">Hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan mang \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8015\" data-end=\"8155\">Ng\u1ecdc Lan g\u1ee3i l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao, tinh khi\u1ebft v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 mang l\u1eddi ch\u00fac may m\u1eafn v\u00e0 b\u00ecnh an.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"8157\" data-end=\"8204\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8206\" data-end=\"8350\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1al84hf\" data-start=\"8352\" data-end=\"8408\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8410\" data-end=\"8511\">C\u00f3. Kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"8513\" data-end=\"8551\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8553\" data-end=\"8699\">C\u00f3. Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ri\u00eang, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yvaox0\" data-start=\"8701\" data-end=\"8738\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8740\" data-end=\"8846\">C\u00f3. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa Ng\u1ecdc Lan ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be, pastel v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch \u00e1o d\u00e0i thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>\n<div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left\"><\/h3>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2750000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.750.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.750.000&#8363;.<\/s