false,"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 22 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"400","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"16","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"400 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 16 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m V\u1ebd Tay Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng Lavender | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=14228","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/14228","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14228&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":14206,"name":"Silk Shawl Hand Painted SenSilk- Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Rose","slug":"silk-shawl-hand-painted-sensilk-khan-lua-tinh-yeu-rose-qua-tang-handmade","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/silk-shawl-hand-painted-sensilk-khan-lua-tinh-yeu-rose-qua-tang-handmade\/","sku":"KLVTLIMITED NUDE ROSE","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"525\">Silk Shawl Hand Painted SenSilk- Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Rose l\u00e0 t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, l\u1ea5y v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00e0m c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ea1o.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"789\">T\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng l\u1edbp c\u00e1nh hoa gi\u00e0u chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u0111\u1ea7y n\u1eef t\u00ednh. S\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n v\u1eeba mang gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1eddi trang v\u1eeba c\u00f3 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1041\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau hoa, y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng nh\u1eefng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1eb1ng b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n. \u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn tinh t\u1ebf cho <strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"1040\">qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"txs4j9\" data-start=\"1043\" data-end=\"1064\">Th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"2184\">. <strong data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1085\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVTLIMITED NUDE HOAHONG<br data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1184\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1221\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1235\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1247\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1267\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited<br data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1307\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1324\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 55 cm<br data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1339\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1355\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1371\" data-end=\"1374\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1376\" data-end=\"1389\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> Hoa h\u1ed3ng<br data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1401\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1416\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> V\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1455\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1482\">Nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u nhu\u1ed9m v\u1ebd:<\/strong> M\u00e0u n\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u00ean d\u1ee5ng cho v\u1ea3i, m\u00e0u m\u1ec1m m\u1ecbn, gi\u1eb7t kh\u00f4ng phai<br data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1544\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1546\" data-end=\"1561\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Art Luxury, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 quy\u1ebfn r\u0169; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf v\u00e0 phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury.<br data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1672\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1674\" data-end=\"1687\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<br data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1801\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1816\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt; th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1974\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"1996\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m:<\/strong> T\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<br data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2103\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2118\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2160\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"2162\" data-end=\"2179\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"ef4io\" data-start=\"2186\" data-end=\"2229\">Hoa H\u1ed3ng \u2013 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1ea5t t\u1eadn c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2324\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh kinh \u0111i\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2326\" data-end=\"2464\">V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf m\u00e0u s\u1eafc m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u1edf c\u1ea5u tr\u00fac nhi\u1ec1u l\u1edbp c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng c\u00e1nh hoa, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, s\u00e2u l\u1eafng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2608\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean l\u1ee5a b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay, t\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh nh\u1eefng n\u00e9t c\u1ecd c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 chuy\u1ec3n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2757\">SenSilk khai th\u00e1c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p \u1ea5y theo h\u01b0\u1edbng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, \u0111\u1ec3 hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt thay v\u00ec m\u1ed9t h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft trang tr\u00ed \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-53\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/de3a0cbf9d9b48c5118a96\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"212\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/de3a0cbf9d9b48c5118a96.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/82619b29ca2a1874413b6_result-2\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/82619b29ca2a1874413b6_result-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/30ef4091d0b505eb5ca492\/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"214\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/30ef4091d0b505eb5ca492-300x214.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"11qlqpj\" data-start=\"2759\" data-end=\"2800\">Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2909\">V\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong t\u1eebng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t m\u00e0u s\u1eafc tr\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2911\" data-end=\"3002\">T\u1eebng c\u00e1nh hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ef1 chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ebfp m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i gi\u1eefa c\u00e1c l\u1edbp m\u00e0u.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3004\" data-end=\"3097\">\u0110\u1eb7c t\u00ednh \u00f3ng nh\u1eb9 c\u1ee7a 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m gi\u00fap s\u1eafc m\u00e0u c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u v\u00e0 thay \u0111\u1ed5i nh\u1eb9 theo \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3182\">\u0110\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a khi\u1ebfn h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft tr\u1edf n\u00ean s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng khi chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3184\" data-end=\"3321\">\u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay: <strong data-start=\"3228\" data-end=\"3321\">m\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb b\u00e0n tay ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"on6qou\" data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3367\">Silk Shawl \u2013 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3369\" data-end=\"3480\">Silk Shawl Hand Painted SenSilk l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3607\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c cho\u00e0ng vai, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3726\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i gi\u00fap kh\u0103n chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean theo c\u01a1 th\u1ec3, trong khi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n th\u1ecb gi\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3824\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch SenSilk \u0111\u01b0a ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0o \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3inknn\" data-start=\"3826\" data-end=\"3861\">Tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3932\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa h\u1ed3ng h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3934\" data-end=\"4017\">B\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebft ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n l\u00ean h\u00ecnh th\u00e1i c\u1ee7a hoa, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n h\u1ed9i h\u1ecda.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4127\">Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n m\u00e0 v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch t\u1ed5ng th\u1ec3.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4260\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n Art Luxury c\u1ee7a SenSilk: <strong data-start=\"4169\" data-end=\"4260\">sang tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u, k\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf trong thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"3bekkp\" data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4300\">Phong c\u00e1ch Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Rose<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4302\" data-end=\"4375\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00f3 s\u1ee9c h\u00fat v\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u1eddi gian.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4377\" data-end=\"4447\">Khi ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, kh\u0103n mang \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c duy\u00ean d\u00e1ng v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4449\" data-end=\"4531\">V\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng s\u01a1 mi, blazer ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u01a1n s\u1eafc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4533\" data-end=\"4607\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c, kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4727\">V\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch Quiet Luxury, n\u00ean ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tay tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"9h10r3\" data-start=\"4729\" data-end=\"4765\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng c\u1ee7a kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a 180 \u00d7 55 cm<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4767\" data-end=\"4818\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm mang \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u c\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng:<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4820\" data-end=\"4855\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong trang ph\u1ee5c h\u1eb1ng ng\u00e0y<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4857\" data-end=\"4876\">Cho\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 tr\u00ean vai<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4878\" data-end=\"4894\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4926\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4928\" data-end=\"4949\">Ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ea7m d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4951\" data-end=\"4974\">Th\u1eaft tr\u00ean quai t\u00fai x\u00e1ch<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4976\" data-end=\"5022\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng khi \u0111i du l\u1ecbch, ngh\u1ec9 d\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u00e0 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5078\">L\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"k58fqd\" data-start=\"5080\" data-end=\"5132\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Cao C\u1ea5p \u2013 trao g\u1eedi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u01b0\u1ee3t th\u1eddi gian<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5192\">Hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh d\u1ec5 t\u1ea1o n\u00ean c\u1ea3m x\u00fac trong m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5194\" data-end=\"5342\">Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 c\u00f3 chi\u1ec1u s\u00e2u h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5445\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5447\" data-end=\"5557\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t th\u00edch h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt, qu\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1kl6fa\" data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5608\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nh\u00e2n \u2013 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 sang tr\u1ecdng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5610\" data-end=\"5693\">M\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho doanh nh\u00e2n c\u1ea7n c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 tinh t\u1ebf, gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5695\" data-end=\"5825\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Rose k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u cao c\u1ea5p v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 v\u1eeba sang tr\u1ecdng v\u1eeba c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5950\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng n\u1eef doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c n\u1eef, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP ho\u1eb7c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan tr\u1ecdng trong m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5952\" data-end=\"6052\">H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk gi\u00fap m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 tr\u1edf n\u00ean ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 trang tr\u1ecdng khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1yy4l6y\" data-start=\"6054\" data-end=\"6107\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m \u2013 m\u1ed9t t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6109\" data-end=\"6222\">D\u00f2ng Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a V\u1ebd Tay Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt \u2013 Limited d\u00e0nh cho nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6335\">M\u1ed7i t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a v\u1edbi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ecd, s\u1eafc m\u00e0u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6337\" data-end=\"6432\">100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u, trong khi k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay t\u1ea1o n\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6605\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa h\u1ed3ng mang t\u00ednh bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 cao, gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 c\u00e1c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u00f3 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ky131h\" data-start=\"6607\" data-end=\"6625\">H\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6627\" data-end=\"6695\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6697\" data-end=\"6793\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i trang nh\u00e3 gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh ngay khi trao t\u1eb7ng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6795\" data-end=\"6958\">S\u1ef1 ch\u1ec9n chu t\u1eeb t\u00e1c ph\u1ea9m v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ebfn h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"69br7c\" data-start=\"6960\" data-end=\"6980\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6982\" data-end=\"7081\">Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5: G\u1ea5p ho\u1eb7c cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n theo chi\u1ec1u d\u00e0i r\u1ed3i qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft n\u00fat m\u1ec1m ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7083\" data-end=\"7184\">Cho\u00e0ng vai: \u0110\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean tr\u00ean vai khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c trang ph\u1ee5c trang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7186\" data-end=\"7250\">Th\u1eaft t\u00fai: Cu\u1ed9n kh\u0103n g\u1ecdn v\u00e0 bu\u1ed9c quanh quai t\u00fai \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7252\" data-end=\"7361\">Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i: C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1eaft nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n bu\u00f4ng hai t\u00e0, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be v\u00e0 pastel.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"1cvkcll\" data-start=\"7363\" data-end=\"7384\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"7386\" data-end=\"7426\">\u01afu ti\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7428\" data-end=\"7464\">Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n trong th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7466\" data-end=\"7510\">Kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2, xo\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh l\u00ean b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7512\" data-end=\"7540\">Kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng ch\u1ea5t t\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7542\" data-end=\"7590\">Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7592\" data-end=\"7628\">Kh\u00f4ng l\u00e0 ho\u1eb7c \u1ee7i \u1edf nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 qu\u00e1 cao.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7630\" data-end=\"7697\">Khi kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, n\u00ean g\u1ea5p nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n trong h\u1ed9p ho\u1eb7c t\u00fai s\u1ea1ch.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"7699\" data-end=\"7768\">H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u0103n ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi n\u01b0\u1edbc hoa, m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 h\u00f3a ch\u1ea5t.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"ly38sn\" data-start=\"7770\" data-end=\"7791\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bmnjaz\" data-start=\"7793\" data-end=\"7847\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Ngh\u1ec7 Thu\u1eadt Rose \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7849\" data-end=\"7952\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, mang \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 r\u1ee7 t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7c tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9dgtsf\" data-start=\"7954\" data-end=\"7992\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"7994\" data-end=\"8082\">\u0110\u00fang. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1wernnm\" data-start=\"8084\" data-end=\"8117\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8119\" data-end=\"8237\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc 180 \u00d7 55 cm, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"vc4bw7\" data-start=\"8239\" data-end=\"8286\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8288\" data-end=\"8442\">C\u00f3. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay v\u00e0 h\u1ed9p qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1al84hf\" data-start=\"8444\" data-end=\"8500\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8502\" data-end=\"8603\">C\u00f3. Kh\u0103n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"2udxof\" data-start=\"8605\" data-end=\"8643\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u01b0u t\u1ea7m kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8645\" data-end=\"8785\">C\u00f3. Ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tay tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a t\u1ea1o n\u00ean d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng ri\u00eang, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt, th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u1ee5a th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1yvaox0\" data-start=\"8787\" data-end=\"8824\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"8826\" data-end=\"8935\">C\u00f3. H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa h\u1ed3ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u00e1o d\u00e0i tr\u1eafng, kem, be, pastel v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch \u00e1o d\u00e0i thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/p>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"2560000","regular_price":"2800000","sale_price":"2560000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.800.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.800.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.560.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 2.560.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":13435,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/de3a0cbf9d9b48c5118a96.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/de3a0cbf9d9b48c5118a96-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"de3a0cbf9d9b48c5118a96","alt":""},{"id":13441,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/229dfbf777d3a28dfbc29.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/229dfbf777d3a28dfbc29-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"229dfbf777d3a28dfbc29","alt":""},{"id":13437,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/8b815af6cad21f8c46c394.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/8b815af6cad21f8c46c394-247x296.jpg","sr