ints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=14194&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":13734,"name":"Silk Square Printed Scarf &#8211; Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng | SenSilk","slug":"silk-square-printed-scarf-65x65cm-khan-lua-in-cao-cap","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/silk-square-printed-scarf-65x65cm-khan-lua-in-cao-cap\/","sku":"KLVI09 SENTHAIDUONG","short_description":"<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"72\" data-end=\"414\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng 65x65cm Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng thu\u1ed9c BST Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau, in 3D tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen c\u00e1ch \u0111i\u1ec7u h\u00f2a c\u00f9ng ngu\u1ed3n s\u00e1ng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang tinh th\u1ea7n Quiet Luxury \u2013 Vietnamese Heritage, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam cao c\u1ea5p.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"441\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"441\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"1538\">. <strong data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"462\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI09 SENTHAIDUONG<br data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"485\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"556\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"593\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"607\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"619\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"639\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"663\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"680\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<br data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"717\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"731\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"747\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"766\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"779\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa sen v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh t\u01b0\u1ee3ng th\u00e1i d\u01b0\u01a1ng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"847\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"861\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 Cam \u2013 \u0110\u1ecf son \u2013 Xanh l\u00e1 \u2013 Ng\u00e0 kem<br data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"912\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"927\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"945\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"962\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"999\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1014\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1143\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1158\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1330\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1345\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1454\" data-end=\"1457\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1472\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1514\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1533\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam Sang Tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 Tinh T\u1ebf<\/h3>\n<h3 data-start=\"624\" data-end=\"683\">Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng \u2013 Bi\u1ec3u T\u01b0\u1ee3ng C\u1ee7a N\u0103ng L\u01b0\u1ee3ng V\u00e0 Hy V\u1ecdng<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"959\">\u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ebf t\u00e1c t\u1eeb <strong data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"727\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/strong> c\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, ho\u1ea1 ti\u1ebft sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u01b0\u01a1n l\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi \u00e1nh n\u1eafng m\u1eb7t tr\u1eddi, r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng. M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t, m\u1ed7i gam m\u00e0u \u0111\u1ec1u mang trong m\u00ecnh th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p: <strong data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"956\">v\u01b0\u01a1n cao, t\u1ecfa s\u00e1ng, v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng lan t\u1ecfa y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1008\">V\u1ebb \u0110\u1eb9p Th\u1eddi Trang, Ph\u00f9 H\u1ee3p M\u1ecdi Phong C\u00e1ch<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1263\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1035\">65x65cm<\/strong>, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang l\u1ea1i s\u1ef1 linh ho\u1ea1t tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi. Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 trong bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 sang tr\u1ecdng, bu\u1ed9c t\u00f3c t\u1ea1o n\u00e9t tr\u1ebb trung, hay \u0111i\u1ec3m xuy\u1ebft tr\u00ean t\u00fai x\u00e1ch nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u2013 Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ec1u khi\u1ebfn ch\u1ee7 nh\u00e2n to\u1ea3 s\u00e1ng theo c\u00e1ch ri\u00eang.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-55\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16130#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/bd361eca73abc8f591ba39-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16128#main\"><img width=\"224\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/65353cd551b4eaeab3a535.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16132#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/11\/ef62248349e2f2bcabf336-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1311\">M\u00f3n Qu\u00e0 Thay L\u1eddi Ch\u00fac B\u00ecnh An V\u00e0 May M\u1eafn<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1574\">Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"1369\" data-end=\"1388\">m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> g\u1eedi g\u1eafm l\u1eddi ch\u00fac ph\u00fac tr\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7y n\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf hay nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n y\u00eau, nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch trao \u0111i \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 ni\u1ec1m hy v\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1626\">\u0110i\u1ec3m K\u1ebft Trong H\u00e0nh Tr\u00ecnh <em data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1624\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<\/em><\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1900\">N\u1ebfu m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n trong b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ch\u01b0\u01a1ng chuy\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh, th\u00ec <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1712\">Sen Th\u00e1i D\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/strong> ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 c\u00e1i k\u1ebft r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1, n\u01a1i t\u00ecnh y\u00eau, ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt v\u00e0 tinh hoa v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t h\u1ed9i t\u1ee5. N\u00f3 nh\u1eafc nh\u1edb r\u1eb1ng: <strong data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1898\">Sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o l\u1ee5a, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ch\u1ea1m \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u00e1i tim, \u0111\u1ec3 y\u00eau th\u00eam m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"652\">Kh\u00e9p l\u1ea1i h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh c\u00f9ng <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"369\">Sen Ch\u1ea1m L\u1ee5a Y\u00eau<\/strong>, ta nh\u01b0 v\u1eeba \u0111i qua m\u1ed9t b\u1ee9c tranh s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a qu\u00ea h\u01b0\u01a1ng \u2013 n\u01a1i c\u00f3 n\u00f3n l\u00e1 m\u1ed9c m\u1ea1c, c\u00f3 h\u01b0\u01a1ng sen trong tr\u1ebbo, c\u00f3 s\u1eafc v\u00e0ng r\u1ef1c r\u1ee1 v\u00e0 \u00e1nh d\u01b0\u01a1ng chan h\u00f2a. M\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u00f4 phong c\u00e1ch, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 <strong data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"611\">m\u1ed9t m\u1ea3nh h\u1ed3n Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00eau d\u1ec7t b\u1eb1ng t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-56\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17516#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/100-silk-printed-scarf-200x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17522#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-ky-thuat-so-sen-silk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=17520#main\"><img width=\"200\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/khan-lua-thoi-trang-in-3d-Sen-Silk.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"999\">SenSilk tin r\u1eb1ng, khi b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn kho\u00e1c l\u00ean m\u00ecnh m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n trong b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0y, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o s\u1ef1 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n ch\u1ea1m v\u00e0o <strong data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"849\">ni\