e1ch:<\/strong> Vietnamese Heritage tr\u1ebb trung, ti\u1ec7n d\u1ee5ng<br data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"724\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"739\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, kh\u0103n b\u1ecf t\u00fai, lau th\u1ea5m m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y ho\u1eb7c trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"857\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"872\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> \u00dd ngh\u0129a d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1025\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1040\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1152\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1154\" data-end=\"1167\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> T\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1210\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Th\u00eau Tay<\/a>\u00a0Hoa Mai\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/\">SenSilk<\/a>\u00a0bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng cho 5 \u0111i\u1ec1u t\u1ed1t l\u00e0nh bao g\u1ed3m h\u1ea1nh ph\u00fac, may m\u1eafn, tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1ecd, th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 h\u00f2a b\u00ecnh; ch\u00ednh v\u00ec l\u1ebd \u0111\u00f3\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">Hoa Mai<\/a>\u00a0\u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u00ed nh\u01b0 s\u1ee9 gi\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a xu\u00e2n<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">C\u1ed5 nh\u00e2n cho r\u1eb1ng, mai v\u1ed1n c\u00f3 t\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ee9c, khi m\u1edbi k\u1ebft n\u1ee5 l\u00e0 nguy\u00ean, khi n\u1edf hoa l\u00e0 hanh, k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 l\u00e0 l\u1ee3i, khi qu\u1ea3 ch\u00edn l\u00e0 trinh, t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 t\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ee9c \u201cnguy\u00ean, hanh, l\u1ee3i, trinh\u201d. V\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng trong nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 t\u1ee9c l\u00e0 \u201cNh\u00e2n, ngh\u0129a, l\u1ec5, tr\u00ed\u201d.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-58\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13335#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_09_07_20_48_IMG_0896_result-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13325#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_09_07_18_31_IMG_0890_result-1-scaled-300x225.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13329#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_09_07_18_33_IMG_0893_result-scaled-300x225.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">H\u1eadu nh\u00e2n c\u00f2n c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch l\u00fd gi\u1ea3i kh\u00e1c:\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/\">Hoa mai<\/a>\u00a0c\u00f3 5 c\u00e1nh, t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho ng\u0169 ph\u00fac: Th\u1ee9 nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 vui v\u1ebb, th\u1ee9 hai l\u00e0 h\u1ea1nh v\u1eadn, th\u1ee9 ba l\u00e0 tr\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1ecd, th\u1ee9 t\u01b0 l\u00e0 hanh th\u00f4ng, th\u1ee9 n\u0103m l\u00e0 \u00e2n h\u00f2a. \u0110\u00f3 c\u0169ng ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a lo\u00e0i hoa n\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div class=\"_1aa6\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\u270d\ufe0fD\u01b0\u1edbi b\u00e0n tay c\u1ee7a ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 th\u00eau ren Ninh B\u00ecnh<\/a>, b\u00f4ng h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u1ecf th\u1eafm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00eau tinh t\u1ebf, s\u1eafc n\u00e9t n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-tron\/\">L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/a> \u00f3ng \u1ea3. Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u00eau c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 r\u1ea5t \u00fd ngh\u0129a g\u1eedi t\u1eb7ng cho kh\u00e1ch n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i, \u0111\u00e2y c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong s\u1ed1 nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng th\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng m\u1ef9 ngh\u1ec7 m\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i r\u1ea5t y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u00e0 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">Gi\u1eefa v\u00f4 v\u00e0n nh\u1eefng t\u1ea5t b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1eddi th\u01b0\u1eddng, c\u1ea7m chi\u1ebfc <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/cravat-lua\/\">kh\u0103n m\u00f9i xoa l\u1ee5a<\/a> th\u00eau l\u00ean, ta c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 an y\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ea1 th\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1edfi g\u1eedi g\u1eafm trong \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, b\u1ea1n b\u00e8, \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c\u2026Y\u00eau bi\u1ebft m\u1ea5y, th\u01b0\u01a1ng bi\u1ebft m\u1ea5y khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 nh\u1ecf \u0111\u00e1ng y\u00eau n\u00e0y.<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div>T\u1eb7ng <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-tay-theu\/\">kh\u0103n tay th\u00eau<\/a> C\u00f4 G\u00e1i l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u00fd ngh\u0129a, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 nh\u1eafc nh\u1edb v\u1ec1 m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u00e9t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a T\u1ebft, m\u1ed9t m\u1ef9 t\u1ee5c c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t m\u00e0 c\u00f2n bi\u1ec3u tr\u01b0ng cho s\u1ef1 may m\u1eafn, h\u1ea1nh ph\u00fac, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 t\u00ecnh b\u1ea1n kh\u1eafng kh\u00edt tr\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1ed3n!<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"_3_bl\">\n<div class=\"_5w1r _3_om _5wdf\">\n<div class=\"_4gx_\">\n<div class=\"_1aa6\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\">\u0110\u1eb6C \u0110I\u1ec2M N\u1ed4I B\u1eacT C\u1ee6A <\/span><a style=\"font-size: 14.4px\" href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">KH\u0102N TAY L\u1ee4A<\/a><span style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\"> T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M TH\u00caU SENSILK<\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft th\u00eau tay xinh x\u1eafn, trang nh\u00e3<\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"\"><span style=\"color: #555555\">* Ch\u1ec9 th\u00eau kh\u00f4ng phai m\u00e0u theo th\u1eddi gian<\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* SenSilk nh\u1eadn <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-mui-xoa-lua-theu-hoa-hong-tim\/\">th\u00eau theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/a> ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nha<\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"_5yl5\" style=\"font-size: 14.4px\">* Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/span><span class=\"_5yl5\" style=\"font-size: 14.4px\"> 100% <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/a> B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c (L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng), m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00e2u v\u00e0 th\u00eau ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n b\u1eb1ng tay b\u1edfi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">l\u00e0ng ngh\u1ec1 th\u00eau r\u00ean Ninh B\u00ecnh<\/a><\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhu\u1ed9m m\u00e0u b\u1eb1ng nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ecf c\u00e2y, hoa l\u00e1 r\u1ea5t an to\u00e0n cho s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/huong-dan-bao-quan-lua-to-tam\/\"><strong>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG L\u1ee4A T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<div>1. N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh<\/div>\n<div>2. Gi\u1eb7t nhanh, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng v\u00e0i gi\u1ecdt d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh pha lo\u00e3ng<\/div>\n<div>3. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m n\u01b0\u1edbc qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u, t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t gi\u0169 th\u1eb3ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1eaft<\/div>\n<div>4. \u1ee6i\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-tron\/\">l\u1ee5a<\/a>\u00a0khi c\u00f2n \u1ea9m<\/div>\n<div>5. B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf h