r_page=10"}]}},{"id":13229,"name":"Silk Print Square Scarves &#8211; Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 In 3D \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n | SenSilk","slug":"khan-quang-co-lua-in-sensilk-klvi06-dao-xuan","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-quang-co-lua-in-sensilk-klvi06-dao-xuan\/","sku":"KLVI06 DAOXUAN","short_description":"<p>Silk Print Square Scarves &#8211; Kh\u0103n Qu\u00e0ng C\u1ed5 L\u1ee5a In K\u1ef9 Thu\u1eadt S\u1ed1 SenSilk \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho nh\u1eefng ai \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p. S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 g\u1eafn k\u1ebft v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m.<\/p>\n<p>H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ec3 SenSilk c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n lan t\u1ecfa v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p qua nh\u1eefng m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-section-id=\"10akh3p\" data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"248\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"248\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"1345\">. <strong data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"269\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLVI06 DAO XUAN<br data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"288\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"359\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"396\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"410\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"422\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"442\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a Vu\u00f4ng In 3D<br data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"503\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"520\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 65 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"534\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"550\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"569\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"582\">Ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1:<\/strong> Hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 s\u1eafc xu\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t Nam thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"646\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"660\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> H\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e0o \u2013 Tr\u1eafng ng\u00e0 \u2013 \u0110\u1ecf son \u2013 V\u00e0ng \u00e1nh kim \u2013 N\u00e2u g\u1ed7<br data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"717\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"732\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"750\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"767\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Quiet luxury, Vietnamese Heritage<br data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"804\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"819\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang, ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y; s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, ti\u1ec7c tr\u00e0, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n\u2026<br data-start=\"945\" data-end=\"948\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"963\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, tri \u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1135\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1150\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1262\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1277\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1319\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1338\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p>V\u1edbi v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p, <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in<\/strong> SenSilk \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n KLVI06 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang sang tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> \u0111\u1eb7c s\u1eafc, mang \u0111\u1eadm v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c. Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf s\u1eafc s\u1ea3o t\u1eeb c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn gi\u00fap m\u1eabu kh\u0103n n\u00e0y t\u1ecfa s\u00e1ng, tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a In SenSilk \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n &#8211; Phong C\u00e1ch Th\u1eddi Trang Cao C\u1ea5p Cho Ph\u00e1i \u0110\u1eb9p<\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n qu\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n v\u1edbi hoa v\u0103n trang nh\u00e3, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc h\u00e0i h\u00f2a v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean, l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p. K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt <strong>in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<\/strong> ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn gi\u00fap c\u00e1c chi ti\u1ebft hoa v\u0103n s\u1eafc n\u00e9t, kh\u00f4ng phai m\u00e0u, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau th\u00edch phong c\u00e1ch sang tr\u1ecdng.<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam &#8211; L\u01b0u Gi\u1eef Gi\u00e1 Tr\u1ecb V\u0103n H\u00f3a Truy\u1ec1n Th\u1ed1ng<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in<\/strong> SenSilk \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n ni\u1ec1m t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, l\u00e0 m\u00f3n <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi cho nh\u1eefng ai y\u00eau qu\u00fd gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ho\u00e0n h\u1ea3o gi\u1eefa hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i v\u00e0 truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng, v\u1eeba gi\u1eef g\u00ecn b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc v\u0103n h\u00f3a v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-63\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16105#main\"><img width=\"225\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/8822bbc5d6a46dfa34b528.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=16115#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/e57f8ed1ebb550eb09a410.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Qu\u00e0 T\u1eb7ng Doanh Nghi\u1ec7p &#8211; \u0110\u1eb3ng C\u1ea5p v\u00e0 S\u1ef1 Tinh T\u1ebf<\/h3>\n<p>L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong> l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng trong vi\u1ec7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 v\u00e0 ghi d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in KLVI06 SenSilk \u0110\u00e0o Xu\u00e2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf, gi\u00fap doanh nghi\u1ec7p truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i. \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ef1 t\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p qua m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t n\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY CP SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<\/strong><\/p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udecd<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\"><strong>\u00a0https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\n<strong>\u260e\ufe0f(+84) 976722736 \u2013 963545166<\/strong><br \/>\n<strong>\ud83d\udecd B15-08A, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng Violet 3, Vinhomes Gardenia, H\u00e0m Nghi, Nam T\u1eeb Li\u00eam, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><\/p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter is-resized\"><img class=\"wp-image-15565 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/qr-code-sensilk-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" \/><\/figure>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1100000","regular_price":"1320000","sale_price":"1100000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,