N","short_description":"<p>\u0110\u00e0o M\u1ed9c Lan l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D c\u1ee7a SenSilk, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh tao c\u1ee7a nh\u1eefng nh\u00e0nh hoa \u0111\u00e0o v\u00e0 hoa m\u1ed9c lan.<\/p>\n<p>Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00e1i hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 3D v\u1edbi b\u1ea3ng m\u00e0u h\u00e0i h\u00f2a, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p n\u1eef t\u00ednh, sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng. M\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, \u0111\u1ea7m, vest v\u00e0 trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI04 DAOMOCLAN<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> v\u00e0ng &#8211; \u0111\u1ecf &#8211; cam<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang:\u00a0Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 \u00b7 Cho\u00e0ng vai \u00b7 Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i \u00b7 V\u00e1y \u00b7 Trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>","description":"<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/product\/khan-ve-thuy-an-moc-lan-sensilk-nang-tho-mong-mo\/\">Hoa M\u1ed9c Lan<\/a>\u00a0l\u00e0 lo\u00e0i hoa \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u1ea5t m\u1ecdi th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i, t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u01b0ng cho ph\u1ea9m gi\u00e1, ni\u1ec1m ki\u00eau h\u00e3nh, ho\u00e0ng gia, b\u00ed \u1ea9n, t\u00e2m linh v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 xa hoa. Hoa m\u1ed9c lan t\u00edm s\u1ebd lu\u00f4n c\u00f3 v\u1ebb r\u1ea5t sang tr\u1ecdng, quy\u1ebfn r\u0169 v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o, \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u m\u00e0 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 ch\u00fang ta \u0111\u1ec1u th\u00edch nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\">Hoa \u0111\u00e0o<\/a>\u00a0mang \u0111\u1ea7y gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb nh\u00e2n v\u0103n \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eedi g\u1eafm nh\u1eefng mong mu\u1ed1n cho m\u1ed9t n\u0103m m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ef1 g\u1eafn k\u1ebft v\u00e0 h\u00f2a thu\u1eadn gi\u1eefa ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi. Bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 an khang th\u1ecbnh v\u01b0\u1ee3ng: S\u1eafc h\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a hoa \u0111\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem l\u00e0 m\u00e0u s\u1eafc mang l\u1ea1i may m\u1eafn, s\u1ef1 \u1ea5m c\u00fang, ni\u1ec1m vui, ni\u1ec1m tin, t\u00ecnh y\u00eau v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng hy v\u1ecdng m\u1ed9t n\u0103m m\u1edbi h\u1ea1nh ph\u00fac v\u00e0 b\u00ecnh an.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-65\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13128#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_08_29_22_13_IMG_0581_result-scaled-300x225.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13116#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_08_29_18_46_IMG_0498_result-scaled.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=13122#main\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"231\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/2023_08_29_22_12_IMG_0578_result-scaled-300x231.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/\">SenSilk<\/a> &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-thuy-an\/\">L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Thu\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t<\/a> k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p h\u00e0i ho\u00e0 gi\u1eefa <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/a> cao c\u1ea5p v\u1edbi c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 cao c\u1ea5p. Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf theo phong c\u00e1ch \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng v\u1edbi ho\u1ea1 ti\u1ebft quen thu\u1ed9c, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t tinh x\u1ea3o, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng trang nh\u00e3 &#8211; l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p, qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1eadm ch\u1ea5t Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb 100% <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/a> (L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng) \u2013 n\u01a1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1ec7nh danh \u201c<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">Th\u1ee7 ph\u1ee7 d\u00e2u t\u1eb1m t\u01a1 Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/a>\u201d t\u1eeb l\u00e2u \u0111\u00e3 n\u1ed5i ti\u1ebfng v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec1 tr\u1ed3ng d\u00e2u, nu\u00f4i t\u1eb1m v\u00e0 d\u1ec7t l\u1ee5a.<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-theu-tay\/\">T\u01a1 l\u1ee5a B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/a> t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, b\u00f3ng, x\u1ed1p, cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t v\u1ebb m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0 v\u00e0 \u00eam \u00e1i; \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u1ea5m \u00e1p khi \u0111\u00f4ng sang, m\u00e1t m\u1ebb khi h\u00e8 v\u1ec1.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center\">Do \u0111\u00f3, Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in cao c\u1ea5p SenSilk ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn l\u00e0 m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb3ng c\u1ea5p th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c &#8220;T\u00e2m&#8221; v\u00e0 \u201cT\u1ea7m\u201d c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eb7ng th\u00edch h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i&#8230;<\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">Trong ti\u1ebft tr\u1eddi h\u01a1i se l\u1ea1nh c\u1ee7a m\u00f9a Thu \u2013 \u0110\u00f4ng &#8211; Xu\u00e2n, n\u00e0ng \u0111\u1eebng qu\u00ean kho\u00e1c nh\u1eb9 l\u00ean b\u1edd vai chi\u1ebfc Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a d\u00e0i h\u1ed3ng tr\u01a1n m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0. Kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eefng gi\u00fap gi\u1eef \u1ea5m \u0111\u00f4i vai m\u00e0 \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n l\u00e0m t\u00f4n l\u00ean v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p d\u1ecbu d\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7y thi v\u1ecb c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb6C \u0110I\u1ec2M N\u1ed4I B\u1eacT C\u1ee6A <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-ve-tay\/\">KH\u0102N L\u1ee4A IN<\/a>\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-ve-tay\/khan-lua-ve-tay-sensilk-limited\/\">SENSILK<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div class=\"\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* SenSilk nh\u1eadn <a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-ve-tay\/\">in l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/a>\u00a0ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n nha<\/span><\/div>\n<div><span class=\"_5yl5\">* H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft v\u1ebd tinh t\u1ebf, m\u00e0u in cao c\u1ea5p nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u kh\u00f4ng phai m\u00e0u<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"_5yl5\">* Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u\u00a0100%\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-tay-theu\/\">l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/a>\u00a0B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c\u00a0(L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng) cao c\u1ea5p, m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, th\u1ea5m h\u00fat m\u1ed3 h\u00f4i t\u1ed1t<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n<div><a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/vi\/huong-dan-bao-quan-lua-to-tam\/\"><strong>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN S\u1eec D\u1ee4NG L\u1ee4A T\u01a0 T\u1eb0M<\/strong><\/a><\/div>\n<div>1. N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh<\/div>\n<div>2. Gi\u1eb7t nhanh, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng v\u00e0i gi\u1ecdt d\u1ea7u g\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ea7u ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc chanh pha lo\u00e3ng<\/div>\n<div>3. Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m n\u01b0\u1edbc qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u, t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t gi\u0169 th\u1eb3ng kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n v\u1eaft<\/div>\n<div>4. \u1ee6i\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/danh-muc\/khan-lua-tron\/\">l\u1ee5a<\/a>\u00a0khi c\u00f2n \u1ea9m<\/div>\n<div>5. B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t<\/div>\n<div><\/div>\n<div><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5