"low_stock_remaining":null,"stock_availability":{"text":"C\u00f2n 43 trong kho","class":"in-stock"},"sold_individually":false,"weight":"0.5","dimensions":{"length":"30","width":"15","height":"6"},"formatted_weight":"0.5 g","formatted_dimensions":"30 \u00d7 15 \u00d7 6 cm","add_to_cart":{"text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","description":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng: &ldquo;H\u1ed3ng V\u00e2n T\u01a1 \u2013 Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D | SenSilk&rdquo;","url":"\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?per_page=100&#038;page=1&#038;add-to-cart=13094","single_text":"Th\u00eam v\u00e0o gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng","minimum":1,"maximum":9999,"multiple_of":1},"is_password_protected":false,"extensions":{},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products\/13094","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products"}],"related":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-json\/wc\/store\/v1\/products?related=13094&per_page=10"}]}},{"id":13075,"name":"Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p In 3D 180x65cm","slug":"khan-lua-to-tam-nguyet-ha-sen","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/product\/khan-lua-to-tam-nguyet-ha-sen\/","sku":"KLDI03 NGUYETHASEN","short_description":"<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen thu\u1ed9c BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean \u2013 b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh khi\u1ebft c\u1ee7a hoa sen Vi\u1ec7t Nam. Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a SenSilk v\u1edbi c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00ean kh\u1ed5 kh\u0103n 180\u00d765cm.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thanh l\u1ecbch, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eadm tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i, trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf, d\u1ef1 ti\u1ec7c ho\u1eb7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"k3jgar\" data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1426\">Th\u00f4ng Tin S\u1ea3n Ph\u1ea9m<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"1189\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">. <strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"157\">T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> KLDI03 NGUYETHASEN<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"246\">T\u00ean v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 c\u1ee7a t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a:<\/strong> C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N SEN SILK VI\u1ec6T NAM<br data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"283\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"297\">Xu\u1ea5t x\u1ee9:<\/strong> Vi\u1ec7t Nam<br data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"309\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"311\" data-end=\"329\">D\u00f2ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n Cho\u00e0ng L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m In 3D<br data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"361\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"378\">B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp:<\/strong> Sen Ho\u1ea1 Mi\u00ean<br data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"394\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"411\">K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc:<\/strong> 180 \u00d7 65 cm<br data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"426\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"442\">Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u:<\/strong> 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<br data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"461\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"476\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft:<\/strong> hoa sen thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt b\u1edfi SenSilk<br data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"519\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"533\">M\u00e0u s\u1eafc:<\/strong> v\u00e0ng &#8211; s\u1eafc s\u1eabm<br data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"572\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"574\" data-end=\"587\">K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt:<\/strong> in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<br data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"605\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"622\">Phong c\u00e1ch:<\/strong> thanh l\u1ecbch, sang tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"663\">\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng:<\/strong> Kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng, ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang:\u00a0Qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5 \u00b7 Cho\u00e0ng vai \u00b7 Ph\u1ed1i \u00e1o d\u00e0i \u00b7 V\u00e1y \u00b7 Trang ph\u1ee5c c\u00f4ng s\u1edf<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"807\">Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng:<\/strong> kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1eddi trang cao c\u1ea5p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng doanh nh\u00e2n, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP, ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 tri \u00e2n, qu\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i ngo\u1ea1i v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<br data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"981\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"996\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t:<\/strong> SenSilk nh\u1eadn v\u1ebd, th\u00eau v\u00e0 in theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u ri\u00eang v\u00e0 trao t\u1eadn tay Qu\u00fd kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trong v\u00f2ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 5-7 ng\u00e0y.<br data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1108\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1123\">\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i:<\/strong> H\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng cao c\u1ea5p, t\u00fai v\u00e0 thi\u1ec7p SenSilk<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" \/>. <strong data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1184\">N\u0103m s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t:<\/strong> 2026<\/p>\n<h2><\/h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Thu\u1ed9c t\u00ednh<\/th>\n<th>Chi ti\u1ebft<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>T\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u2013 Kh\u0103n L\u1ee5a T\u01a1 T\u1eb1m Cao C\u1ea5p In 3D 180x65cm<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>B\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>SenSilk<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>K\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>In 3D b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>180 \u00d7 65 cm<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Hoa sen<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>C\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Hoa sen v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Phong c\u00e1ch<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>\u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i \u00b7 Thanh l\u1ecbch \u00b7 Tinh t\u1ebf<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>C\u00f4ng d\u1ee5ng<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang \u00b7 Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n \u00b7 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u00e2n \u00b7 \u0110\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u00b7 Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP \u00b7 B\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>SenSilk \u2013 Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 in kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>","description":"<h2>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u2013 N\u00e9t sen thanh khi\u1ebft tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/strong> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf thu\u1ed9c <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong>, b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ri\u00eang t\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u1ec1 hoa sen v\u00e0 v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">N\u1ebfu nh\u1eefng d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay c\u1ee7a SenSilk ghi d\u1ea5u b\u1eb1ng t\u1eebng n\u00e9t c\u1ecd c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ngh\u1ec7 nh\u00e2n, th\u00ec v\u1edbi Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean, SenSilk l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n kh\u00e1c: <strong>s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ri\u00eang, sau \u0111\u00f3 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u00ean t\u1eebng chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 n\u1eb1m \u1edf c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u1ea5y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb <strong>\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 giao thoa gi\u1eefa <strong>s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-67\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-4 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19228#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-nguyet-ha-sen-in-ky-thuat-so-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19218#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sen-suong-mai-in-ky-thuat-so.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Sen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m 100% \u2013 BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean SenSilk\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19232#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sen-lam-chieu-in-ky-thuat-so-sensilk-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=19230#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-lua-to-tam-sac-lien-xua-in-ky-thuat-so-240x300.webp\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<h2>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n SenSilk \u2013 Khi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o g\u1eb7p c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong> l\u00e0 ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong>SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n cho b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n, c\u00f2n <strong>thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o n\u00ean b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">T\u1eeb c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng ban \u0111\u1ea7u, SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c, m\u00e0u s\u1eafc v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng m\u1eabu kh\u0103n tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi chuy\u1ec3n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a SenSilk, thay v\u00ec \u0111\u01a1n thu\u1ea7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t m\u1eabu kh\u0103n in \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00e0.<\/p>\n<div id=\"gallery-68\" class=\"gallery galleryid-0 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-medium\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20390#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/khan-choang-lua-to-tam-in-3d-thai-lien-ngoc-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20167#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-an-hong-sen-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu cho\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D An H\u1ed3ng Sen SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen h\u1ed3ng thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/?attachment_id=20170#main\"><img width=\"240\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-3d-sen-nha-lam-sensilk-240x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu qu\u00e0ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m in 3D Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam SenSilk v\u1edbi h\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen tr\u1eafng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n lam sang tr\u1ecdng\" loading=\"lazy\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n 100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u00e2y c\u0169ng l\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean: <strong>gi\u1eef c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t nh\u01b0ng th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/strong><\/p>\n<h2>C\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa sen tr\u1eafng<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Li\u00ean Hoa \u2013 Lotus<\/strong> l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u \u00fd ngh\u0129a trong v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam, g\u1ee3i nh\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 thanh cao, b\u00ecnh d\u1ecb, s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng b\u1ec1n b\u1ec9 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ea5t \u0111\u1eb9p trong t\u00e2m h\u1ed3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi Vi\u1ec7t.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, <strong>sen tr\u1eafng<\/strong> mang v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thu\u1ea7n khi\u1ebft, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u0129nh t\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<blockquote>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><em>\u201cTrong \u0111\u1ea7m g\u00ec \u0111\u1eb9p b\u1eb1ng sen<\/em><br \/>\n<em>L\u00e1 xanh, b\u00f4ng tr\u1eafng l\u1ea1i chen nh\u1ee5y v\u00e0ng<\/em><br \/>\n<em>Nh\u1ee5y v\u00e0ng, b\u00f4ng tr\u1eafng, l\u00e1 xanh<\/em><br \/>\n<em>G\u1ea7n b\u00f9n m\u00e0 ch\u1eb3ng h\u00f4i tanh m\u00f9i b\u00f9n.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">T\u1eeb h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh quen thu\u1ed9c \u1ea5y, SenSilk ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n <strong>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/strong> theo h\u01b0\u1edbng thanh tho\u00e1t v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u00f4ng qu\u00e1 c\u1ea7u k\u1ef3 hay ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n v\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng n\u00e9t m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9 trang nh\u00e3, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1eeba mang tinh th\u1ea7n \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng v\u1eeba ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi phong c\u00e1ch th\u1eddi trang \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i.<\/p>\n<h2>100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean <strong>100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, v\u1edbi ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a t\u1eeb <strong>B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u00f3 \u0111\u1eb7c t\u00ednh m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i, nh\u1eb9, b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0 khi ti\u1ebfp x\u00fac v\u1edbi da.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u \u1ea5y, c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D gi\u00fap th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed9, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen r\u00f5 n\u00e9t nh\u01b0ng v\u1eabn gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 thanh tho\u00e1t c\u1ee7a chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi SenSilk, l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u t\u1ea1o n\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n trong c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n <strong>\u0111\u01b0a gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb l\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2>V\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p thanh l\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen l\u00e0 ki\u1ec3u kh\u0103n cho\u00e0ng d\u00e0i c\u00f3 t\u00ednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng cao.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf h\u01b0\u1edbng \u0111\u1ebfn tinh th\u1ea7n <strong>quiet luxury \u2013 sang tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0ng kh\u00f4ng ph\u00f4 tr\u01b0\u01a1ng<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n v\u1eeba \u0111\u1ee7, gi\u00fap chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u phong c\u00e1ch trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Qu\u00e0ng nh\u1eb9 quanh c\u1ed5 khi \u0111i l\u00e0m ho\u1eb7c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8.<\/li>\n<li>Cho\u00e0ng tr\u00ean vai trong nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y th\u1eddi ti\u1ebft se l\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng \u00e1o d\u00e0i trong nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u1ed1i v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ea7m ho\u1eb7c vest trong c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n phong c\u00e1ch thanh l\u1ecbch.<\/li>\n<li>L\u00e0m \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n cho nh\u1eefng b\u1ed9 trang ph\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i gi\u1ea3n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u2013 Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p mang c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a \u0111\u1eb9p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 m\u00f3n ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nh\u01b0ng m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n mang <strong>h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Vi\u1ec7t<\/strong> l\u1ea1i c\u00f3 th\u00eam m\u1ed9t c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 trao g\u1eedi.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng m\u1eb9, v\u1ee3 ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi ph\u1ee5 n\u1eef quan tr\u1ecdng.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 sinh nh\u1eadt v\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p cao c\u1ea5p.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/li>\n<li>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5, T\u1ebft v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c \u2013 tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 c\u00f3 b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng quan tr\u1ecdng, m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 t\u1ed1t kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n \u0111\u1eb9p m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u1ea7n <strong>th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n ph\u00eda sau<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ba y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 cao c\u1ea5p:<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>L\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2192 gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n SenSilk<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2192 d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2192 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u00ec v\u1eady, chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">SenSilk c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n c\u00e1c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p theo s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1eadn qu\u00e0 v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<h2>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/h2>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>L\u1ee5a c\u00f3 ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c t\u1eeb <strong>B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n thu\u1ed9c BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf do <strong>SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>In 3D b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt s\u1ed1 hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>H\u1ecda ti\u1ebft hoa sen l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li>Phong c\u00e1ch \u00c1 \u0110\u00f4ng hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 tinh t\u1ebf<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m ph\u1ee5 ki\u1ec7n th\u1eddi trang v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng cao c\u1ea5p<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho <strong>qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP v\u00e0 qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>SenSilk nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n <strong>in kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a theo thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ri\u00eang<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u1ec3 gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ebb m\u1ec1m m\u1ea1i v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00f3ng t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean c\u1ee7a l\u1ee5a:<\/p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>N\u00ean gi\u1eb7t tay b\u1eb1ng n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ea1nh ho\u1eb7c n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u00e1t.<\/li>\n<li>Gi\u1eb7t nh\u1eb9, kh\u00f4ng v\u00f2 ho\u1eb7c ch\u00e0 m\u1ea1nh.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng ng\u00e2m kh\u0103n qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u trong n\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/li>\n<li>Kh\u00f4ng v\u1eaft xo\u1eafn kh\u0103n.<\/li>\n<li>Ph\u01a1i \u1edf n\u01a1i tho\u00e1ng m\u00e1t, tr\u00e1nh \u00e1nh n\u1eafng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp.<\/li>\n<li>Khi \u1ee7i n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 th\u1ea5p v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t l\u1edbp v\u1ea3i m\u1ecfng gi\u1eefa b\u00e0n \u1ee7i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1 m\u1eb7t l\u1ee5a.<\/li>\n<li>B\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n \u1edf n\u01a1i kh\u00f4 tho\u00e1ng, tr\u00e1nh \u1ea9m v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 cao.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Xem th\u00eam <strong>H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn b\u1ea3o qu\u1ea3n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m SenSilk<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u0103n \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<h2>C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<h3>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i kh\u0103n v\u1ebd tay kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u00f4ng. Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen thu\u1ed9c d\u00f2ng <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D<\/strong>. Tuy nhi\u00ean, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa sen l\u00e0 <strong>thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/strong> thu\u1ed9c BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb c\u1ee7a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m n\u1eb1m \u1edf s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong>s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf, ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m t\u1eeb ch\u1ea5t li\u1ec7u g\u00ec?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u0103n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean <strong>100% l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong>, v\u1edbi ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ee5a t\u1eeb B\u1ea3o L\u1ed9c, L\u00e2m \u0110\u1ed3ng.<\/p>\n<h3>K\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc kh\u0103n Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen l\u00e0 bao nhi\u00eau?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen c\u00f3 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc <strong>180\u00d765cm<\/strong>, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u00e0ng c\u1ed5, cho\u00e0ng vai v\u00e0 ph\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng nhi\u1ec1u ki\u1ec3u trang ph\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<h3>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen thu\u1ed9c b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp n\u00e0o?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thu\u1ed9c <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong>, b\u1ed9 s\u01b0u t\u1eadp thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n do SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb hoa sen v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh gi\u00e0u gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<h3>In 3D c\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Kh\u00f4ng. V\u1edbi Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean, <strong>thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c SenSilk s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o ri\u00eang<\/strong>, c\u00f2n c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in 3D l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u00f3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<h3>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen c\u00f3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0m qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen mang tinh th\u1ea7n Vi\u1ec7t Nam, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00f9ng l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m cao c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n SenSilk, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean m\u1ed9t m\u00f3n qu\u00e0 trang nh\u00e3, c\u00f3 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p d\u00e0nh t\u1eb7ng <strong>\u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c, kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP ho\u1eb7c kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3>SenSilk c\u00f3 nh\u1eadn in kh\u0103n theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u kh\u00f4ng?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">C\u00f3. SenSilk nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n <strong>kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in theo thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ri\u00eang<\/strong>, t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o y\u00eau c\u1ea7u, s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.<\/p>\n<h2>Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf hoa sen trong BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">N\u1ebfu y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a hoa sen tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 th\u00eam nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf kh\u00e1c trong <strong>BST Sen H\u1ecda Mi\u00ean<\/strong> c\u1ee7a SenSilk nh\u01b0:<\/p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li><strong>Sen S\u01b0\u01a1ng Mai<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Sen Nh\u00e3 Lam<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>An H\u1ed3ng Sen<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Sen Lam Chi\u1ec1u<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Th\u00e1i Li\u00ean Ng\u1ecdc<\/li>\n<li>S\u1eafc Li\u00ean X\u01b0a<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">M\u1ed7i thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang m\u1ed9t s\u1eafc th\u00e1i ri\u00eang nh\u01b0ng c\u00f9ng chung tinh th\u1ea7n k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p <strong>l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam, c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t v\u00e0 ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h2>Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1c d\u00f2ng kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a SenSilk<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u1ee7y \u1ea5n v\u1ebd tay \u0111\u1ed9c b\u1ea3n<\/strong> \u2013 nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf mang hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng m\u00e0u s\u1eafc ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t tr\u00ean t\u1eebng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a v\u1ebd tay ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt<\/strong> \u2013 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp b\u1eb1ng k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt v\u1ebd tr\u00ean l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a vu\u00f4ng v\u1ebd tay<\/strong> \u2013 nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nh\u1ecf g\u1ecdn, thanh l\u1ecbch v\u00e0 gi\u00e0u t\u00ednh ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a th\u00eau tay<\/strong> \u2013 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m v\u1edbi ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt th\u00eau truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a in 3D<\/strong> \u2013 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n SenSilk \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n b\u1eb1ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 in hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><strong>Qu\u00e0 t\u1eb7ng l\u1ee5a cao c\u1ea5p<\/strong> \u2013 c\u00e1c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn d\u00e0nh cho c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, doanh nghi\u1ec7p, \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng VIP.<\/p>\n<h2>SenSilk \u2013 L\u1ee5a Vi\u1ec7t, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf Vi\u1ec7t, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n Vi\u1ec7t<\/h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">T\u1eeb <strong>l\u1ee5a t\u01a1 t\u1eb1m Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/strong> \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean v\u00e0 v\u0103n h\u00f3a Vi\u1ec7t, SenSilk theo \u0111u\u1ed5i s\u1ef1 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa <strong>gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf v\u00e0 k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">V\u1edbi <strong>Nguy\u1ec7t H\u1ea1 Sen<\/strong>, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh hoa sen kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01b0a l\u00ean m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc kh\u0103n l\u1ee5a.<\/p>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u0110\u00f3 l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch SenSilk k\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng quen thu\u1ed9c c\u1ee7a Vi\u1ec7t Nam b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4n ng\u1eef m\u1edbi \u2013 <strong>nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, tinh t\u1ebf v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea1i<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Love Vietnam, Remember Silk.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>","on_sale":true,"prices":{"price":"1880000","regular_price":"2200000","sale_price":"1880000","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":".","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":"\u20ab"},"price_html":"<del aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">2.200.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/del> <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 g\u1ed1c l\u00e0: 2.200.000&#8363;.<\/span><ins aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"woocommerce-Price-amount amount\">1.880.000<span class=\"woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol\" dir=\"auto\">&#8363;<\/span><\/span><\/ins><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0: 1.880.000&#8363;.<\/span>","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":17231,"src":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Nguyet-Ha-Sen.jpg","thumbnail":"https:\/\/sensilk.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/khan-lua-to-tam-in-Sen-Silk-Nguyet-Ha-Sen-247x296.jpg","srcset":"","sizes":"(max-width: 918px) 100vw, 918px","thumbnail_srcset":"","thumbnail_sizes":"(max-width: 247px) 100vw, 247px","name":"kh\u0103n l\